<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">LUK- Zigua Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">LUKA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mbuli yedi iwandikwe ni Luka</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luk</para>
  <para style="mt2">MBULI YEDI IWANDIKWE NI</para>
  <para style="mt1">LUKA</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGOZI</para>
  <para style="im">Chitabu cha Mbuli yedi chiwandikwe ni Luka ni chimwenga mwe vitabu vine mwe Lagano Hya chiya chikutamwila wikazi wa Yesu Kulisito. Chila chimwenga mwe ivyo chetangwa “Mbuli,” kugamba “Mbuli Yedi” Vya wandikagwa ni Matayo na Mako na Luka na Yohana, Yesu eze kubanika. Naho Luka suyo uyodu awandike lugano lwo wikazi wa Yesu, mna awandikaga naho mwe mbuli wadamanyaga wasigilwa wa Yesu eze abanike no kuuyuka kwakwe, chitabu chikwitangwa Ntendwa za Wasigilwa. Hahana amanyize pwilili chipindi icho Mbuli yedi iwandikwe ni Luka chawandikagwa hegu ni kuhi chawandikagwa, mna wasomile walozize wazumila kugamba mafani chawandikagwa mo mhilimo wa milongo mfungate. 70 AD</para>
  <para style="ip">(Eze elekwe Yesu) Mta kuwandika ni Luka, yudya endaga tabibu mkulu. Isila ivyo awandike na ulongi ajeseze walagisa kugamba endaga mntu mmanyi. Luka nakaunga awandike jejeje milosi yo wikazi wa Yesu, akalavyanya mwe sila ivyo vintu vilaile, chani kugamba watuhu wadahe kumanya kulaila mo kukisoma (Luka 1:1-3). Hendaga Myahudi (Wako 4:10-14) naho awandikaga mwe sila kugaba wantu sawo Wayahudi wadaha kukombaganya. Vino ni pwilili mwe sila idya alongile mwe mazwela ya Wayahudi (Luka 1:8).</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Mbuli yedi iwandikwe ni Luka chaliganisa ne vitabu vya Matayo na Mako, kwaviya vya vyatambalisa vintu iviya mwe sila iyo vyaligana. Mgati mwe vitabu vitatu, Luka alavya mbuli zilozize mo kwelekwa kwa Yohana Mta kubatiza. Luka naho atambalisa kulekeilwa (sula 3:3, 11:4, 17:3-4, 23:34, 24:47) na malombezo (sula 3:21, 5:16, 6:12, 11:1-12, 22:32).</para>
  <para style="iot">Vimndani</para>
  <para style="io">Mwe sula ya 1:1-4, Luka alonga Mbuli yawe na kutambalisa vilekile akawandika ichitabu icho.</para>
  <para style="io">Akaheza atamalisa ukwelekwa kwa Yesu naivyo amalanyagwa mwe ndima (1:14-21:38),</para>
  <para style="io">Mwe ntendele nkulu mbuli yedi isigale (4:14-1:8). Luka alonga mwe ndima idya Yesu adamanyaga, vitendese mpituko adamanye na mbuli ahinyize.</para>
  <para style="io">Mo udumo, mwe zisula zimbili (22-24), katambalisa ivyo Yesu abanike, kuhambwa, na kuuyuka kwakwe.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mkulu Teofilo,</para>
  <para style="p">Wantu walozize wajezaga kuwandika mbuli ziya zadamanyagwa mgati mwetu. <verse number="2" style="v" />Wawandikaga saviya chigambilwe ni wadya waukuzi naho wavionaga, na wandima wa udya ulosi kukongela nkongo, <verse number="3" style="v" />Ivyo mkulu Teofilo siwona vyawagila nikaule uchindedi we zimbuli izo zose kukongela nkongo, siwona ni vyedi niwandike kwa untanda mbuli izo ivyo zilaile. <verse number="4" style="v" />Sidamanya ivyo chani nawe umanye uchindedi we izimbuli ziya uhinyigwe.</para>
  <para style="s">Kwelekwa kwa Yohana Mta kubatiza kwalongwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mwe dizuwa hadya Helode endaga seuta ywa Yudeya, hendaga na mlavyantambiko yumwenga akwitangwa Zakaliya, endaga ywa bunga dya walavyantambiko wa lukolo lwa Abiya. Na mkaziwe naketangwa Elizabeti naye endaga wo lukolo lwa mlavyantambiko mkulu akwitangwa Haluni. <verse number="6" style="v" />Wose waidi wendaga wawoneka wedi kulongozi kwa Chohile, nawatoza kwa ukanuni miko na malagizo yose ya Zumbe. <verse number="7" style="v" />Mna wendaga hawena mwana, kwaviya Elizabeti nendile hana cheleko, naho wose waidi wendaga wadalahala.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zuwa dimwenga, Zakaliya endaga akamsankanila Chohile, akadamanya ndima yakwe ya ulavyantambiko kwaviya yendaga zamu ye dibunga dyakwe. <verse number="9" style="v" />Kulawana na mazwela ya walavyantambiko, uyo asagulagwa kwa sila ya kumtoila tegatega kwa kwingila mndani mwe nyumba yo kuvikila ya Zumbe, chani akafunkize ubani. <verse number="10" style="v" />Fyo kulu dya wantu nendile dikuse dikalombeza mwe saa idya Zakaliya awoka ubani.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Niyo mndima ywa kwembingu ywa Zumbe amlaila Zakaliya, kachimala ntendele ya kulume ye nchanja yo kufunkiziza ubani. <verse number="12" style="v" />Zakaliya eze amwone, niyo ehelwa na kwingilwa ni woga. <verse number="13" style="v" />Mna yudya mndima ywa kwembingu niyo amgamba, Zakaliya, “Use kogoha! Kwaviya Chohile keva malombeza yako, na mkaziwo Elizabeti nakwelekele mwana ywa chilume. Wenawe naumwitange Yohana. <verse number="14" style="v" />Wenawe na utende na mbwedo na chinyemi, na wantu walozize nawabwede mo kwelekwa kwakwe. <verse number="15" style="v" />Kwaviya nauwazwe kutenda mntu mkulu kulongozi kwa Zumbe. Hanywe divai hegu mpombe, naho namemezwe Muye Ukukile kukongela mwe nda ya nine. <verse number="16" style="v" />Nawahitule Waizulaeli walozize kwa kumuwiya Zumbe Chohile ywawe. <verse number="17" style="v" />Namlongweile Zumbe, naho na atende na nguvu na udahi wa Muye saviya muwoni Eliya. Na wevanye vituhu watati zamntu na wana wawo, na kuwahitula wehi watendwe na umanyi saviya wakuwoneka wedi, naho na watende wantu wemalanye kale kumhokela Zumbe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zakaliya amuza yudya mndima ywa kwembingu, “Nanimanye vivihi ichindedi che imbuli ino? Miye sidalahala, mkazangu naye kadalahala.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mndima ywa kwembingu amgamba, “Miye ni Gabulieli, akwikala haguhi na Chohile, anisigile nize kulonga na weye na kukugambila mbuli yedi ino. <verse number="20" style="v" />Mna kwaviya huzumile ulosi wangu, ukunga uchinte mwe chipindi chikigwe. Kwaviya huzumile, haudahe kulonga, naho naunyamale kubula mwe dizuwa diya dye ndagano nadichinte.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Wantu wendile wakamgoja Zakaliya wehelwa kwaviya kekalisa mwe nyumba yo kuvikila. <verse number="22" style="v" />Eze afose, hakudaha kulonga nawo, wantu niyo wamanya kugamba kawona uwoni mndani mwe nyumba yo kuvikila. Niyo alonga nawo kwa vilagiso mwe mikono yakwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Eze abinde ndima yakwe, Zakaliya auya kwe kaya yakwe. <verse number="24" style="v" />Yeze yomboke mazuwa majeche, mkaziwe Elizabeti niyo atenda msoka ekala hekaya yakwe miezi mishano. <verse number="25" style="v" />Elongela, “Vino nivyo anitendele Zumbe,” akagamba. “Kanusiza soni zangu za kuleka kweleka!”</para>
  <para style="s">Kwelekwa kwa Yesu kwalongwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mwezi wa mtandatu we inda ya Elizabeti Chohile amsigilaga mndima ywa kwembingu Gabulieli aite kwe isi ya Galilaya ikwitangwa Nazaleti. <verse number="27" style="v" />Nakasigilwa kwa mwana chiche akwitangwa Maliyamu henati kudugana na mgosi. Mwana chiche uyo nakalombwa ni mgosi akwitangwa Yusufu, akulaila mo lukolo lwa Daudi. <verse number="28" style="v" />Mndima ywa kwembingu niyo amlaila Maliyamu na kumlamsa, “Utondowazi utende naweye! Zumbe ehamwenga na weye naye kakujimbika vidala!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Maliyamu niyo engilwa ni chinyulu eze eve ulosi uwo, niyo ehelwa mbuli idya yagaze. <verse number="30" style="v" />Akaheza mndima ywa kwembingu amgamba, “Maliyamu, usekogoha, kwaviya Chohile kakufila mbazi. <verse number="31" style="v" />Nawinule nda, naho naweleke mwana chilume, namwitange zina dyakwe Yesu. <verse number="32" style="v" />Uyo natende mkulu naho netangwe Mwana Chohile Mkulu. Zumbe Chohile namwinke chigoda chakwe cho useuta, saviya endaga mwelesi ywakwe Daudi, <verse number="33" style="v" />naho natende seuta ywa lukolo lwa Yakobo mazuwa yose, useuta wakwe hauna udumo!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Maliyamu niyo amuza mndima ywa kwembingu, “Navidahike, vivihi, mbuli ino?” Miye simmanyize mgosi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Mndima ywa kwembingu amhitula, “Muye Ukukile nakwizile, na nguvu za Chohile nazikugubike. Kwa chausa icho mwana uyo nomwitange Mwana ywa Chohile. <verse number="36" style="v" />Naho umanye mlukolo ywako Elizabeti, yudya wantu wamanyize hakweleka, mna haluse ana nda ya myezi mtandatu, hatahegu kadalahala. <verse number="37" style="v" />Kwaviya hamna hedikudahika kwa Chohile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Maliyamu niyo agamba, “Kaula, miye ni mtumwa ywa Zumbe,” “navitende saivyo ulongile.” Niyo mndima ywa kwembingu ahalawa.</para>
  <para style="s">Maliyamu amtalamkila Elizabeti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Mwa mazuwa yadya Maliyamu kahalawa aita kwa kuchinyinta kwita ko mzi wendile kwa magulu ye mwe si ya Yudeya. <verse number="40" style="v" />Niyo engila mwe nyumba ya Zakaliya na kumlamsa Elizabeti. <verse number="41" style="v" />Elizabeti eze eve indamsa yakwe Maliyamu, kazana mwe inda yakwe katugusa. Elizabeti niyo amemezwa Muye Ukukile. <verse number="42" style="v" />Niyo alonga kwa izwi kulu, “Kujimbikwa weye kujinka wavyele wose, na umwana ukunga weleke kajimbikwa! <verse number="43" style="v" />Ilaila vivihi mbuli ino, vikaleka mame ywa Zumbe ywangu anitalamkile? <verse number="44" style="v" />Nize nive indamsa yako, kazana mwe nda yangu niyo katugusa kwa chinyemi. <verse number="45" style="v" />Chinyemi kwa weye uzumile longa mbuli ziya ugambilwe kulaila kwa Zumbe nazichinte!”</para>
  <para style="s">Uchemi wa Maliyamu wa kumtogola Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Maliyamu niyo alonga,</para>
  <para style="q">“Umoyo wangu wamtogola Zumbe,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />no muye wangu wamwelelwa Chohile Mwambula ywangu,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />kwaviya kanikumbuka, mtumwa wakwe mnyanyahala!</para>
  <para style="q">Kukongela vino haluse na kujendeleza,</para>
  <para style="q">vyeleko vyose navinitange mjimbikwa,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />kwaviya Chohile mta Udahi anidamanyiza vintu vikulu.</para>
  <para style="q">Zina dyakwe ni ukuka.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Mbazi zakwe zekala vyeleko na vyeleko</para>
  <para style="q">kwa wadya wakumwogoha.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Kadamanya vintu vikulu kwa mkono wakwe.</para>
  <para style="q">Kawasambalagasa wata kweduvya fanyanyi zawo mwe myoyo yawo.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Kawaseleza maseuta wata nguvu kulaila mwe vigoda vyawo vyo useuta,</para>
  <para style="q">na kuwakweza wachiwa.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Kawegusa wata sala kwa vintu vyedi,</para>
  <para style="q">na kuwabalaza wagoli mikono ibule.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Kamwambiza Izulaeli, mndima ywakwe,</para>
  <para style="q">naho kawafila mbazi wantu wakwe mazuwa yose.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Saviya alongile kwa wababa zetu Bulahimu</para>
  <para style="q">na lweleko lwakwe lose mazuwa yose!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Maliyamu niyo ekala na Elizabeti myezi mitatu, niyo auya kaya.</para>
  <para style="s">Kwelekwa kwa Yohana Mta kubatiza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Mazuwa ya Elizabeti yo kwefungula yeze yabule, niyo efungula mwana chilume. <verse number="58" style="v" />Wantu we haguhi hakwe hamwenga na walukolo wakwe weze weve ivyo Zumbe amfilise mbazi, niyo wose weleleswa hamwenga naye.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Mwana eze abule mazuwa mnane, weza kumjela ngasu. Niyo waunga wamwinke zina dya tati yakwe, etangwe Zakaliya. <verse number="60" style="v" />Mna nine niyo agamba, “Bule! Zina dyakwe netangwe Yohana.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Wamhitula, “Mna hahana mntu mo lukolo lwenyu akwitangwa zina idyo!” <verse number="62" style="v" />Niyo walonga na Zakaliya kwa vilagiso chani wamanye ivyo akunga amwitange mwanawe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Zakaliya niyo alombeza wamwinke chibawo awandike, niyo awandika vino, “Zina dyakwe netangwe Yohana.” Wose niyo wehelwa vidala! <verse number="64" style="v" />Ahadya Zakaliya niyo adaha kulonga naho, niyo akonga kumjimbika Chohile. <verse number="65" style="v" />Wantu we haguhi hakwe niyo wogoha, na mbuli za vintu ivyo niyo zalongwa kose kwa wagulu wose we isi ya Yudeya. <verse number="66" style="v" />Chila evile mbuli izo, afanyanya mo moyo wakwe na kweuza, “Ivyo mwana uyo natende mntu ywani? Kwaviya udahi wa Zumbe wi hamwenga naye.”</para>
  <para style="s">Uwoni wa Zakaliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />Zakaliya, ise dya Yohana, amemezwa Muye Ukukile, naye kalonga mbuli ino kwa uwoni kulaila kwa Chohile.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />Ajimbikwe Zumbe, Chohile ywa Izulaeli!</para>
  <para style="q">Kwaviya keza kuwambiza wantu wakwe na kuwambula.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="69" style="v" />Kachinka suwe Mwambula mta nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q">kulaila mo lukolo lwa Daudi, mtumwa ywakwe.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />Saviya alongaga kukongela nkongo,</para>
  <para style="q">kujinkila kwa wawoni wakwe wakukile,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="71" style="v" />kugamba na chambulwe kulaila mwe wankondo wetu,</para>
  <para style="q">na kulaila mwe mikono ya wadya wose wakuchihiwa.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="72" style="v" />Alongaga nawawonele mbazi wadalahala wetu,</para>
  <para style="q">na kudikumbuka lagano dyakwe dikukile.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="73" style="v" />Elisaga kwa Bulahimu mkale ywetu,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="74" style="v" />kugamba nachambule kulaila mwa wankondo wetu.</para>
  <para style="q">Naho nachitende chidahe kumsankanila Chohile hehena kogoha,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="75" style="v" />kwa ukuka na kwa kuwoneka wedi kwakwe,</para>
  <para style="q">mazuwa yose yo ujima wetu.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="76" style="v" />“Nawe mwanangu, nawitangwe muwoni ywa Chohile Mkulu.</para>
  <para style="q">Kwaviya naulongole kubula kulongozi kwa Zumbe,</para>
  <para style="q">chani umdamanyize sila.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="77" style="v" />Kuwagambila wantu wakwe kugamba nawambulwe</para>
  <para style="q">kwa kulekeilwa masa yawo.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="78" style="v" />Kwaviya Chohile ywetu ni mta mbazi.</para>
  <para style="q">Nachigaile mmweko wa wambulwa kulaila kulanga,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="79" style="v" />na kuwalangaziza wadya wose wakwikala mwe chiza,</para>
  <para style="q">na chizuli cha file,</para>
  <para style="q">na kuvilongoza iviga vyetu mwe isila ya utondowazi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" />Yudya mwana niyo akula umwili no muye. Ekalaga mwe nyika kubula zuwa diya eze awalaile wantu wa Izulaeli.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Kwelekwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 1:18-25</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mazuwa yadya, Augusito, seuta ywa Lumi kalavya sigilizi kugamba wantu wose wo uzumbe wa isi ya Lumi waungigwa wawazwe. <verse number="2" style="v" />Iyo nani nkanana ya nkongo kwa wantu kuwazwa umo Kileniyo endile mkulu ywe isi ya Siliya. <verse number="3" style="v" />Wantu wose niyo waita wawazwe, chila mntu ko mzi wakwe elekwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Yusufu naye ahalawaga heisi ya Galilaya mo mzi wa Nazaleti, niyo aita kwe isi ya Yudeya, mo mzi wa Beselehemu, hantu elekagwa zumbe Daudi. Yusufu nakaita uko kwaviya nani mntu akulaila mo lukolo lwa Daudi. <verse number="5" style="v" />Niyo aita wawazwe hamwenga na Maliyamu mchumbakwe, endile ni msoka. <verse number="6" style="v" />Umo wecheyuko Betilehemu, zuwa dya Maliyamu dyo kwefungula niyo dyabula. <verse number="7" style="v" />Niyo efungula mwanawe ywa nkongo, mwana chilume. Amvisa vibwende, amgoneza mwe hondo, kwaviya nahehena he kwikala mwe nyumba za kufikila wajeni.</para>
  <para style="s">Wadimi wa ngoto na wandima wa kwembingu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mwe isi idya, kwendaga na wadimi wa ngoto mwe zinkonde, wakadima fyo dyawo dya ngoto kwa kuhokelezana neichilo.<figure style="fig" desc="" file="02 Shepherds.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="LUK 2.8">Wadimi wakadima mafyo yawo ya ngoto</figure> <verse number="9" style="v" />Mndima ywa kwembingu ywa Zumbe awalaila, Ukulu wa Zumbe wawang'aziza kosekose, niyo wogoha vidala. <verse number="10" style="v" />Mna mndima ywa kwembingu awagamba, “Msekogoha! Siwegailani mbuli yedi ya chinyemi vidala, ikunga iwatamile wantu wose. <verse number="11" style="v" />Dyelo ko mzi wa Daudi, kelekwa Mwambula ywenyu, nuyo Kulisito,<note caller="c" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="fk">Kulisito. </char> Mwambuzi asagulwe ni Chohile atende Zumbe. </note> Zumbe! <verse number="12" style="v" />Chino ni chilagiso chikunga chileke mkammanya, namumbwile mwana mteke, kaviswa vibwende, kagonezwa mwe hondo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahadya, bunga kulu dya wandima wa kwembingu dyadugana na yudya mndima ywa kwembingu, wakamtogola Chohile na kugamba.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Ukulu una Chohile eyuko kulanga kwembingu,</para>
  <para style="q">na utondowazi kwa wantu mwe isi awaungile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Wandima wa kwembingu wadya weze wauye kulanga, wadya wadimi wagambilana, “Haya, chiteni uko Beselehemu chikakaule idyo dilaile, Zumbe achigambile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ivyo waita kwa kunyaguliza, wambwila Maliyamu na Yusufu hamwenga na yudya mwana umteke kagonezwa mwe hondo. <verse number="17" style="v" />Weze wamwone yudya mwana, niyo wawagambila mbuli wagambilwe ni mndima ywa kwembingu zikumlanga umwana. <verse number="18" style="v" />Wadya wose wevile, wehelwa kwa yadya wagambilwe ni wadya wadimi. <verse number="19" style="v" />Mna Maliyamu niyo ayaika yose mo moyo wakwe, akayafanyanya vitendese. <verse number="20" style="v" />Vikaheza wadya wadimi niyo wauya waka mtunya Chohile na kumtogola kwa chausa cha yose wevile na kuyawona, kwaviya yose yadamanyagwa saviya mndima ywa kwembingu endaga awagambilaga.</para>
  <para style="s">Umwana enkwa zina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mwe zuwa dya mnane, zuwa dyo kumjela ngasu umwana, niyo umwana etangwa Yesu saviya mndima ywa kwembingu alongaga umo nine nahenati kwinula nda.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alavigwa kwa Zumbe mwe Nyumba inkulu ya Kuvikila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Yabula mazuwa ya Maliyamu na Yusufu kulenguswa saviya mazwela ye Sigilizi ya Musa ikulagiza, niyo wamwigala umwana Yelusalemu uleke wamlavye kwa Zumbe, <verse number="23" style="v" />saviya iwandikwe mwe Sigilizi ya Zumbe, “Chila mwana ywa nkongo wa chilume aungwa aikwe kwa Chohile.” <verse number="24" style="v" />Niyo waita chani wakalavye majeleko saviya viungigwe mwe Sigilizi ya Zumbe ikulonga, “Suwa waidi hegu machinda maidi ya wasuwamanga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mazuwa ayo, hadya Yelusalemu nahana mntu akwitagwa Simoni. Mntu uyo nendile kawoneka ywedi kulongozi kwa Chohile. Naho nakagoja vidala wambulwa wa Izulaeli, na Muye Ukukile ne hamwenga naye. <verse number="26" style="v" />Naye nakagambigwa ni Muye Ukukile kugamba habanike kubula eze amwone Kulisito asagulwe ni Zumbe. <verse number="27" style="v" />Welesi wa Yesu weze wamwigale Yesu mwe Nyumba nkulu ya Chohile chani wamdamanyize saviya vikungwa ni Sigilizi ya Musa, niyo Muye Ukukile amlongoza Simoni kubula mwe Nyumba iyo. <verse number="28" style="v" />Simoni amhokela umwana mwe mikono yakwe, amjimbika Chohile agamba,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Haluse Zumbe, mlekeile mtumwa ywako,</para>
  <para style="q">aite kwa utondowazi saviya ulongile.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Kwaviya kwa meso yangu suuwona wambulwa wako,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />uutendile uwoneke mwa wantu wose.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Langailo dikunga diwagubwile wantu sawo Wayahudi yadya ukuunga weye,</para>
  <para style="q">naho nadigale ukulu kwa wantu wako wa Izulaeli.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Welesi wa Yesu wehelwa ni izimbuli zilongigwe ni Simoni zo umwana. <verse number="34" style="v" />Niyo Simoni awajimbika na kumgambila Maliyamu, nine dya Yesu, “Mwana yuno kasagulwa ni Chohile kutenda luhosa lwa kugwa na kuuyuka kwa wantu walozize mwe isi ya Izulaeli. Naho natende chilagiso kulaila kwa Chohile, na wantu walozize nawamlemele. <verse number="35" style="v" />Naho fanyanyi za mwe myoyo ya wantu walozize nazigubulwe pwilili. Nawe mwenye, usungu saviya bamba dikutwa naukusenge mo umoyo wako.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Hendaga na muwoni yumwenga mvyele akwitangwa Ana, mwana Fanueli, ywa kabila dya Asheli. Mvyele uyo ekalaga na mgosiwe kwa mihilimo mfungate kukongela kusolwa kwakwe. <verse number="37" style="v" />Niyo afilwa ni mgosiwe. Naho nana mihilimo milongo mnane na mine. Chipindi chose icho nakekala mwe nyumba nkulu ya Chohile, akalombeza kwa kufunga na kulombeza chilo na msi. <verse number="38" style="v" />Yuno nakalaila mwe sila idya, akamtogola Chohile, na kawagambila mbuli ya yudya mwana wantu wose nawakagoja wambulwa wa Yelusalemu.</para>
  <para style="s">Kuya Nazaleti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Yusufu na Maliyamu weze wabinde yose saviya waungigwe ni Sigilizi ya Zumbe, wauya Nazaleti, mo mzi wa Galilaya. <verse number="40" style="v" />Yudya mwana niyo akula na kutenda na nguvu, niyo atenda na umanyi, na wedi wa Chohile navihamwenga naye.</para>
  <para style="s">Mbwanga Yesu mwe Nyumba nkulu ya Kuvikila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Welesi wa Yesu nawa mazwela ya kwita Yelusalemu chila mhilimo mwe Pasaka. <verse number="42" style="v" />Yesu eze abuze mihilimo mlongo na midi, niyo waita naye mwe sikunkulu iyo saviya nawakaungigwa ni mazwela. <verse number="43" style="v" />Sikunkulu ize isile, wakonga kuya kaya. Mna yudya mwana Yesu niyo asigala ko mzi wa Yelusalemu, mna welesi wakwe hawavimanyize. <verse number="44" style="v" />Nawakamanya emgati mwe difyo dya wantu, wajenda kubula zuwa diswa. Niyo wakonga kumlonda kwa walukolo wawo na wambuya wawo. <verse number="45" style="v" />Weze wamswese, wauya Yelusalemu kumlonda. <verse number="46" style="v" />Yeze yabule mazuwa matatu, wambwila mwe Nyumba nkulu ya Chohile, kekala mgati mwa wahinya wa Chiyahudi, awategeleza na kuwauza milosi. <verse number="47" style="v" />Wose wamwetegeleze wehelwa ni zifanyanyi zakwe no umanyi ananawo. <verse number="48" style="v" />Welesi wakwe weze wamwone wehelwa. Mami yakwe amgamba, “Mwanangu, ni mbwani ukuchitenda vino? Kaula, miye na iso nachikakulonda kwa chinyulu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Yesu awagamba, “Kwa mbwani mwanilonda? Hammanyize kugamba naungwa nikale mwe inyumba ya Tate?” <verse number="50" style="v" />Mna wowo hawaimanyize imbuli idya awagambile.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Yesu niyo auyanya na welesi wakwe kubula Nazaleti, naye nakawevisa ise na nine. Nine azika izimbuli zose mo moyo wakwe. <verse number="52" style="v" />Naye Yesu niyo akula na kongezeka chimo na kutenda na umanyi, na kujendeleza kumuwagila Chohile na wantu.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Ulongi wa Yohana Mta kubatiza</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 3:1-12; Mako 1:1-8; Yohana 1:19-28</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mhilimo wa mlongo na mishano wo uzumbe wa zumbe Tibeliyo zumbe ywa Lumi, Pontiyo Pilato endaga mkulu ywa isi ya Yudeya, na Helode endaga chilongozi ywa Galilaya, na mlukolo ywakwe Filipo endaga chilongozi ywa si ya Ituleya hamwenga na Tilakoniti, Lisaniya naye endaga chilongozi ywa Abilene, <verse number="2" style="v" />Anasi na Kayafa wendaga walavyantambiko wakulu. Chipindi icho mbuli ya Chohile yambwila Yohana mwana ywa Zakaliya kwedijangwa. <verse number="3" style="v" />Yohana niyo abula chila hantu mwe si zose zihakane no mto Yolodani, akalonga, “Kweileni masa yenyu, mbatizwe, Chohile nawalekeileni masa yenyu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Saviya iwandikwe mwe chitabu cha muwoni Isaya</para>
  <para style="q">“Izwi dya mntu akwila kwe nyika,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Idamanyeni sila ya Zumbe,</para>
  <para style="q">mchumize hadya akunga ajinkile!</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chila kolongo nadigubikwe,</para>
  <para style="q">chila gulu na kagulu visalahazwe.</para>
  <para style="q">Sila zigonjize zichumizwe,</para>
  <para style="q">na sila zibanike zidamanywe vyedi.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chila mntu nawone ivyo Chohile nachambule!’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Yohana nakawagambila wadya wose wezile chani wabatizwe, “Nyuwe welekwa wa nyoka! Ni yuhi awagambileni mwadaha kusumka kanto dya Chohile dikwiza? <verse number="8" style="v" />Elo lagisani kwa ntendwa kugamba mweila masa yenyu. Msekwelongela mwe myoyo yenyu, ‘Bulahimu ni tati yetu!’ Nawagambilani kugamba, Chohile adaha kuyahitula mayuwe yano kutende wana Bulahimu! <verse number="9" style="v" />Mna haluse hoya imalanywa kale kukanta masina ye miti, chila mti haukweleka matunda yedi naukantwe na kudulwa mo moto.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Wantu niyo wamuza, “Haluse chitende mbwani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Niyo awahitula, “Mta nkazu mbili amwinkage imwenga yudya hena, mta nkande atende saivyo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Wachisanya kodi nawo niyo weza chani wabatizwe, wamuza, “Mhinyi, suwe naswi chitende mbwani?” <verse number="13" style="v" />Niyo awahitula, “Msekuguha vintu kujinka viya mpangilwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Wankondo nawo niyo wamuza, wamgamba, “Suwe naswi chitende mbwani?”</para>
  <para style="p">Awagamba, “Msekuhoka vintu vya wantu, msekumlongela mntu kwa udanti, naho mzumile maliho mkulihwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mna kwaviya wantu nawakagoja kwiza kwa Kulisito, ivyo wakonga kufanyanya mwe myoyo yawo kugamba Yohana nuyo Kulisito. <verse number="16" style="v" />Yohana niyo awahitula, “Miye nawabatizani kwa mazi, mna eza mntu mta udahi kujinka miye. Uyo akwiza miye sikuwagila hata kufungula izisigi ze vilatu vyakwe, uyo nawabatizeni kwa Muye Ukukile na kwa moto. <verse number="17" style="v" />Ana lungo mo mkono wakwe, naye aheta ingano yakwe. Akajika naike ngano kwedigulu, mna makanka nayoke ko moto houkufa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ivyo kwa mbuli ntuhu zilozize Yohana niyo awagambila wantu Mbuli Yedi na kuwagamba waleke wavu wawo. <verse number="19" style="v" />Naho Yohana nakamkwahila Helode, mkulu ywa Galilaya kwaviya nakamsola Helodiya, mkaza mlukolo ywa Filipo mwe mbuli ntuhu zihiye zilozize. <verse number="20" style="v" />Vikajika Helode nakongezeza wavu wakwe hadya eze amjele Yohana mwe digeleza.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu abatizwa</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 3:13-17; Mako 1:9-11</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Niyo wantu wose weze wabatizwe, Yesu naye niyo abatizwa. Umo akalombeza, kulanga kwembingu niyo kwagubuka, <verse number="22" style="v" />Muye Ukukile niyo asela mnanga mwakwe mwe mligano uge suwa manga. Niyo izwi kulaila kwembingu dyevika, “Weye nuyo mwanangu, hungisa. Weye waniwagila.”</para>
  <para style="s">Lukolo lwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 1:1-17</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Yesu eze akonge ndima yakwe, nakabula mihilimo milongo mitatu. Wantu nawakammanya kugamba ni mwana Yusufu, mwana Eli. <verse number="24" style="v" />Eli nani mwana Matati, endaga mwana Lawi, mwana Meliki, mwana Yana, mwana Yusufu, <verse number="25" style="v" />endaga mwana Matatiya, mwana Amosi, mwana Nahumu, mwana Hesili, mwana Nagayi, <verse number="26" style="v" />endaga mwana Mati, mwana Matatiya, mwana ywa Semeni, mwana ywa Yusufu, mwana ywa Yuda, <verse number="27" style="v" />endaga mwana Yohanani, mwana Lesa, mwana Zelubabeli, mwana Shealitieli, mwana Neli, <verse number="28" style="v" />mwana Meliki, mwana Adi, mwana Kosamu, mwana Elimadamu, mwana Eli, <verse number="29" style="v" />endaga mwana Yoshuwa, mwana Eliezeli, mwana Yolimu, mwana Matati, mwana Lawi, <verse number="30" style="v" />endaga mwana Simoni, mwana Yuda, mwana Yusufu, mwana Yonamu, mwana Eliakimu, <verse number="31" style="v" />endaga mwana Meleya, mwana Mena, mwana Matati, mwana Natani, mwana Daudi, <verse number="32" style="v" />endaga mwana Yese, mwana Obedi, mwana Boazi, mwana Salimoni, mwana Nashoni, <verse number="33" style="v" />endaga mwana Aminadabu, mwana Adimini mwana Hesiloni, mwana Pelesi, mwana Yuda, mwana wa Alini, <verse number="34" style="v" />endaga mwana Yakobo, mwana Isaka, mwana Bulahimu, mwana Tela, mwana Naholi, <verse number="35" style="v" />endaga mwana Selugi, mwana Leyu, mwana Pelegi, mwana Ebeli, mwana Sala, <verse number="36" style="v" />endaga mwana Kenani, mwana Alifakisadi, mwana Shemu, mwana Nuhu, mwana Lameki, <verse number="37" style="v" />endaga mwana Mesusela, mwana Henoko, mwana Yaledi, mwana Mahalaleli, mwana Kenani, <verse number="38" style="v" />endaga mwana Enoshi, mwana Seti, mwana Adamu, endile mwana Chohile.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Kujezwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 4:1-11; Mako 1:12-13</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Yesu kauya kulaila ko mto Yolodani kamema Muye Ukukile niyo alongozwa ni Muye uyo kwita kwe nyika. <verse number="2" style="v" />Uko niyo ajezwa ni Mwavu kwa mazuwa milongo mine. Mwe chipindi icho chose hadile chochose, ivyo eze yajinke mazuwa ayo niyo alumwa nisala.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mwavu amgamba, “Hegu weye wi Mwana ywa Chohile, digambe diyuwe dino dihituke mgate.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Yesu amhitula, “Iwandikwa mwa Mawandiko Yakukile, ‘Mntu hakwikala kwa kudya mgate uwodu.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Akaheza Mwavu amkweza hantu henukile kulanga na kumlagisa useuta wi mwe isi yose. <verse number="6" style="v" />Niyo Mwavu amgamba, “Nahwike useuta wose uwo una udahi wose na Ukuka na ugoli wose,” “Kwaviya vyose sinkigwa miye, nidahe kumwinka yoyose saviya hunga. <verse number="7" style="v" />Elo una nifikila madi kwa kunivikila miye, vyoseni vino navitende vyako.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Yesu niyo amhitula, “Iwandikwa vino mwa Mawandiko Yakukile, ‘Mvikile Zumbe Chohile ywako na kumsankanila uyo du!’”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Akaheza Mwavu amwigala Yelusalemu na kumkweza halanga ho lunenengwe he Nyumba nkulu ya Chohile, niyo amgamba, “Hegu weye wi Mwana ywa Chohile, kwedule hasi kulaila hano. <verse number="10" style="v" />Kwaviya iwandikwa mwa Mawandiko Yakukile kugamba, ‘Chohile nawasigile wandima wa kwembingu wakwe wakudime.’ <verse number="11" style="v" />Naho viwandikwa kugamba, ‘Nawakutoze mwe mikono yawo, chani unasekwebaja chiga chako mwe diyuwe.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mna Yesu niyo amhitula, “Viwandikwa kugamba, ‘Usekumjeza Zumbe Chohile ywako.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mwavu eze abinde kumjeza Yesu kwa chila sila, niyo amwasa kwa chipindi.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akonga ndima yakwe uko Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 4:12-17; Mako 1:14-15</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Yesu niyo auya Galilaya, atenda kamema nguvu za Muye Ukukile. Mbuli zakwe niyo zajendeleza mwe zi si zose zi mjihi. <verse number="15" style="v" />Nakahinya mwe zi nyumba zo kuvikila zawo naho nakatunyiswa ni wantu wose.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alemelwa uko Nazaleti</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 13:53-58; Mako 6:1-6</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Yesu niyo aita Nazaleti, hantu akwile, mwe zuwa dya kuhumula, engila mwe nyumba yo kuvikila saviya azwele. Niyo achimala chani asome Mawandiko Yakukile, <verse number="17" style="v" />niyo enkigwa chitabu cha muwoni Isaya. Kachigubula na kusoma hantu hawandikwe,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Muye wa Zumbe wi hamwenga na miye,</para>
  <para style="q">kwaviya kanisagula niwagambile wachiwa Mbuli Yedi.</para>
  <para style="q">Kanisigila niwagambile wadya wafungigwe kugamba nawalekeilwe,</para>
  <para style="q">na wadya hawekuwona nawawone naho,</para>
  <para style="q">kanisigila kuwalekeila wadya wakusulumizwa,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />na kulonga kugamba chipindi chibula, Zumbe hadya nakombole wantu wakwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Akaheza Yesu niyo agubika chiya chitabu, amvuziza mndima, na kwikala hasi. Wantu wose nawe mwe nyumba yo kuvikila wamng'oila meso, <verse number="21" style="v" />niyo akonga kuwagambila, “Mawandiko yano dyelo yachinta, saviya mwivile yakasomwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Wose niyo watamilwa na kwehelwa ni milosi yedi ya mbuli asimwile. Wagamba, “Yuno suyo mwana ywa Yusufu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Yesu awagamba, “Sivimanya kugamba namnigambile mliganyo, ‘Mganga, kwehonye mwenye.’ Naho namnigambe kugamba chiva mbuli zose udamanye uko ko mzi wa Kapelinaumu vidamanye hano he kaya yako. <verse number="24" style="v" />Yesu ongezeza, chindedi nawagambilani vino,” kugamba, “Hahana muwoni natunywe kwe isi yakwe mwenye.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Tegelezani chindedi, kwendaga na wavyele walozize mwe isi ya Izulaeli mwa mazuwa ya Eliya. Mwe chipindi chiya kwendaga hakuna fula kwembingu kwa mihilimo mitatu na myezi mtandatu naho niyo kwatenda na gumbo ditendese mwe si yose. <verse number="26" style="v" />Hata ivyo Eliya hasigilwe kwe mntu mgati mwawo, ukaleka du kwa yudya mvyele abanikilwe ni mgosi Saleputa mwe si ya Sidoni. <verse number="27" style="v" />Naho kwendaga na wantu walozize wata matana wakekala mwe isi ya Izulaeli mwa mazuwa ya muwoni Elisha, mna na hahana hata mtu yumwenga mgati mwawo alenguswe, mna Naamani uyodu we isi ya Siliya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Wantu wose nawe mwe idya nyumba yo kuvikila weze weve ivyo, niyo wengilwa ni maya. <verse number="29" style="v" />Niyo wachimala, wamlavya Yesu kuse ko mzi, na kumwigala halanga ho lugulu hadya mzi wawo uzengigwe. Nawakaunga wamdule hasi kulaila mnkanda mo lugulu, <verse number="30" style="v" />mna Yesu niyo ajinka mgati mwawo na kwita zakwe.</para>
  <para style="s">Mntu mta mpepo</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 1:21-28</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Akaheza Yesu niyo aita Kapelinaumu, mwe mzi wa Galilaya. Na akahinya wantu we Zuwa dya Kuhumula. <verse number="32" style="v" />Woseni niyo weheleswa eze wawone ivyo endile akawahinya, kwaviya nakahinya kwa udahi. <verse number="33" style="v" />Mwe nyumba yo kuvikila kwendaga na mntu mta mpepo nchafu, niyo aguta kwa izwi kulu, <verse number="34" style="v" />“Haa! Yesu ywa Nazaleti, waunga mbwani kwetu? Kwiza uchikome? Sikumanya weye wi yuhi, wi Msigilwa Mkuka ywa Chohile!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Yesu niyo aikwahila idya mpepo, “Nyamala naho mlawe yuno mntu!” Mpepo idya yamgwisa hasi yudya mntu kulongozi kwawo, yamlawa hemlumize.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Wantu wose weheleswa na kugambilana, “Yano ni mahinyo yani? Mntu yuno ana udahi na nguvu za kukwahila mpepo nchafu, nazo zamwiva!” <verse number="37" style="v" />Elo mbuli za Yesu niyo zazagala chila hantu mwe isi idya.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahonya wantu walozize</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 8:14-17; Mako 1:29-34</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Yesu niyo afosa mwe nyumba yo kuvikila aita kwe nyumba ya Simoni. Mkwewe Simoni ywe chivyele endaga akalumiswa homa, wamlombeza Yesu amhonye. <verse number="39" style="v" />Yesu aita na kuchimala hajihi na yudya mvyele aikwamila idya ihoma imlawe. Ihoma nayo niyo yamlawa, aho akonga kuwasankanila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Zuwa dize diswe, wamwigaila Yesu wantu wose wendile wakalumwa ni manyonje yesimile, niyo awajelekela mikono chila yumwenga na kuwahonya woseni. <verse number="41" style="v" />Mpepo niyo zawafosa wantu walozize, wakaguta kugamba, “Weye wi Mwana ywa Chohile!”</para>
  <para style="p">Mna Yesu kazikwahila naho haungile zilonge, kwaviya nawammanya kugamba uyo nuyo Kulisito.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alonga uko Yudeya</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 1:35-39</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Mtondo wakwe eze kuche, Yesu afosa mo mzi na kwita hantu hechedu. Fyo kulu dya Wantu wakonga kumbasa, weze wamuwone, niyo waunga wamchinde asekuhalawa aho hawo. <verse number="43" style="v" />Mna awagamba, “Naungigwa nilonge Mbuli Yedi ya Useuta wa Chohile mwe mizi mituhu nayo, kwaviya icho nicho nisigilwe ni Chohile kudamanya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Elo Yesu ajendeleza kulonga mwe isi ya Yudeya mndani mwe zi nyumba zo kuvikila ya Galilaya.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Yesu etanga wahinywa wa nkongo</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 4:18-22; Mako 1:16-20</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zuwa dimwenga Yesu achimalaga hankanda hedi ziwa dya Genesaleti. Wantu walozize nawammemela na kufintana kwita kwakwe kwetegeleza ulosi wa Chohile. <verse number="2" style="v" />Awona ngalawa mbili zijeile nanga mpwani, walowa wazasa nawakasunta izinyavu zawo. <verse number="3" style="v" />Yesu engila mwe ngalawa imwenga yendaga ya Simoni niyo amgamba aigale hale hadodo na mpwani. Akajika ekala mwe ingalawa iyo na kuhinya fyo dya wantu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Eze abinde ukuhinya, amgamba Simoni, “Igale halehale ingalawa kwa mazi amatali, niyo weye hamwenga na mbuyazo mziseleze izinyavu zenyu mlowe samaki.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Simoni amhitula, “Zumbe,” “chilowa chilo chijima mna hachipatile chochose. Mna hegu weye walonga seivyo, naniziseleze izinyavu.” <verse number="6" style="v" />Weze waseleze izinyavu niyo walowa samaki zilozise naho izinyavu niyo zakonga kukantika. <verse number="7" style="v" />Ivyo wawatagusa weyawe wadya nawe mwe ingalawa intuhu weza wawambize. Weza na kumemeza samaki mwe zingalawa zoseni mbili na zimeme niyo zakonga kudidimila. <verse number="8" style="v" />Simoni Petulo eze awone ayo yalaile, amfikila madi Yesu na kumgamba, Zumbe! “Halawe hangu, miye ni mta masa!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Simoni na wose wendile wehamwenga naye niyo weheleswa kwa chausa che zisamaki walowile. <verse number="10" style="v" />Seiviya weyawe dya Simoni, Yakobo na Yohana, wana Zebedayo nawo wehelewa. Yesu amgamba Simoni, “Usekogoha, kukongela vino haluse nautende mlowa wantu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Elo walavya izingalawa zawo mwa mazi na kuzibuza mpwani. Waleka chila chintu na kumtimila Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahonya mntu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 8:1-4; Mako 1:40-45</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Yesu hadya endaga kwemzi umwenga mgati mwe mizi idya kwalailaga mntu endaga akuhuma matana. Eze amwone Yesu, edula hasi na kumlombeza, “Zumbe, ukaunga, wadaha kunilengusa!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Yesu achumiza mkono wakwe na kumdonta. Niyo amgamba, “Lenguka!” Aho unyonje wamlawa mntu uyo. <verse number="14" style="v" />Yesu amgamba, “Usekumgambila mntu yoyose, mna hita kwa mlavyantambiko akuwone, naho ukalavye jeleko kwa chausa cho kulenguka kwako saviya Musa asigile, chani wantu waukule kugamba kuhona.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mna mbuli za Yesu niyo zajendesa vidala, na mafyo ya wantu nayo niyo yaita kumwetegeleza na kuhonywa manyonje yawo. <verse number="16" style="v" />Mna Yesu nakaita hantu hechedu na kumlombeza Chohile.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahonya mntu aholomale</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 9:1-8; Mako 2:1-12</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Zuwa dimwenga Yesu nakahinya. Mafalisayo wamwenga na wahinya Sigilizi walaile mwe chila mzi wa Galilaya na Yudeya na Yelusalemu hadya ekale akahinya. Nguvu za Zumbe nazimwingila ahonye wanyonje. <verse number="18" style="v" />Wantu wamwenga naweza wamwinula mntu mwe lusazi aholomale. Niyo wajeza kumwingiza kunyumba wamwike kulongozi kwa Yesu. <verse number="19" style="v" />Mna kwachausa che difyo dya wantu, wadunduga kumwingiza mndani. Ivyo wamwinula no lusazi na kumjisiza kulanga kwe digulu, waponkola langa, na kumseleza no lusazi lwakwe mgati mwe difyo kulongozi kwa Yesu.<figure style="fig" desc="" file="17 Lowering Man Through the Roof.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="LUK 5.19">Wantu wane wakujisa mntu kulanga kwe digulu</figure> <verse number="20" style="v" />Yesu eze awone uzumizi wananawo, niyo amgamba, “Mbuyangu, kulekeilwa masa yako.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Wahinya Sigilizi hamwenga na Mafalisayo wakonga kulonga wenye, “Yuno ni mntu ywani akumhuluta Chohile? Chohile nuyo ichedu akudaha kulekeila masa!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Yesu kabunkula zifanyanyi zawo na kuwagamba, “Ni mbwani mkufanyanya vino mwe myoyo yenyu? <verse number="23" style="v" />Vihufu ni vihi kugamba, ‘Masa yako yalekeilwa,’ hegu kugamba, ‘Chimala ujende?’ <verse number="24" style="v" />Mna naunga mmanye kugamba, Mwana ywa Mntu ana udahi wa kulekeila masa mwe isi yose.” Akajika amgamba yudya mntu aholomale, “Nakugamba, chimala, guha ulusazi lwako wite kukaya!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahadya mntu yudya achimala kulongozi kwawo wose, etwika ulusazi lwakwe endile akagonela, aita kaya, kuno akamtunya Chohile. <verse number="26" style="v" />Wantu wose niyo wehelweswa! Wengilwa ni woga, wamtunya Chohile, wakagamba, “Dyelo chiwona maula!”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu amwitanga Lawi</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 9:9-13; Mako 2:13-17</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Aho vize viheze, Yesu akafosa niyo amwona mchisanya kodi yumwenga akwitangwa Lawi, ekale mwe kazumba ka kuchisanyiza kodi. Yesu amgamba, “Nitimila.” <verse number="28" style="v" />Lawi achimala, asa chila chintu na kumtimila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Akaheza Lawi niyo amdamanyiza Yesu ngasu nkulu mwe nyumba yakwe, bunga kulu dya wachisanya kodi na wantu watuhu wendaga wakadya hamwenga nawo. <verse number="30" style="v" />Mafalisayo wamwenga na wahinya sigilizi wamwenga wa bunga dya Mafalisayo wawagamba wanampina wa Yesu. “Ni mbwani mkudya na kunywa na wachisanya kodi hamwenga na wata masa?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Yesu awahitula, “Wantu hewekulumwa hawakunga mgangana, mna wadya wakulumwa. <verse number="32" style="v" />Sizile kuwetanga wakuwoneka wedi weile, mna wadya wata masa wadahe kweila masa yawo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya kufunga</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 9:14-17; Mako 2:18-22</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Wantu watuhu wamgamba Yesu, “Wanampina wa Yohana wafunga kudya nkanana zilozize na kumlombeza Chohile, na wanampina wa Mafalisayo nawo wadamanya seivyo, mna wanampina wako wadya na kunywa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Yesu awahitula, “Mwafanyanya kugamba mwadaha kuwachinda wajeni wagonekwe kwe nyinka wafunge wasekudya aho msozi achei hamwenga nawo? Havikudahika! <verse number="35" style="v" />Mna mazuwa yeza umo msozi aneza kusigwa mgati mwawo, aho naho nawafunge.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Yesu naho awagambila mligano uno, “Hahana mntu akutatula chilaka cha suche mpya na kuchisuma mwe suche isakale. Anadamanya ivyo, nabalange isuche impya, na chiya chilaka che suche impya hachiivane neidya isuche isakale. <verse number="37" style="v" />Seivyo hahana mntu akujela divai mpya mwe mikwiji ya kale, kwaviya anadamanya ivyo, divai impya naitule idya mikwiji, divai naitikile hasi, mikwiji nayo naiwole vyabule. <verse number="38" style="v" />Mna divai mpya yawagila ijelwe mwe mikwiji mihya! <verse number="39" style="v" />Naho hahana mntu naunge anywe divai mpya anaheza kunywa divai ya kale. Agamba, ‘Idya divai ya kale ni yedi,’ vitendese.”</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya Zuwa dya Kuhumula</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 12:1-8; Mako 2:23-28</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zuwa dimwe dya Kuhumula Yesu na wanampina wakwe nawakajinka mwe nkonde zo uhemba. Wanampina wakwe niyo wakonga kuhasula maiso, wayahugusa ne mikono yawo, na kudya uhemba. <verse number="2" style="v" />Mafalisayo wamwenga wauza, “Ni mbwani mkudamanya mbuli ilemezwe mwe sigilizi yetu kudamanywa mwe zuwa dya Kuhumula?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Yesu awahitula, “Vino hamsomile viya adamanyaga Daudi hamwenga na weyawe umo nawana sala? <verse number="4" style="v" />Yeye nakengila mwe nyumba nkulu ya Chohile, niyo aguha migate ilavigwe kwa chausa cha Chohile na kuidya, niyo awapangila weyawe. Naho Sigilizi zilemeza mntu yoyose kudya migate iyo, mna walavyantambiko du.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Akajika Yesu awagamba, “Mwana ywa Mntu nuyo Zumbe ywa Zuwa dya Kuhumula.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mntu aholomale mkono</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 12:9-14; Mako 3:1-6</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mwe Zuwa tuhu dya Kuhumula Yesu aitaga kwe kuhinya mwe nyumba yo kuvikila. Mwe nyumba iyo mwendaga na mntu aholomale mkono wakwe wa kulume. <verse number="7" style="v" />Wahinya Sigilizi wamwenga na Mafalisayo wamwenga nawakazungula chintu chikunga chimhose Yesu, elo wamsinyisa hegu namhonye mntu yudya mwe Zuwa dya Kuhumula. <verse number="8" style="v" />Mna kwaviya Yesu nakamanya izifanyanyi zawo niyo amgamba yudya mntu mta mkono uholomale, “Souchimale hano.” Yudya mntu enuka niyo achimala hadya. <verse number="9" style="v" />Akaheza Yesu niyo awagamba, “Nawauzani, Sigilizi yetu yachunga chidamanye yedi hegu yehiye mwe Zuwa dya kuhumula? Kuhonya ujima wa mntu hegu kukoma?” <verse number="10" style="v" />Niyo ahituka na kuwakaula wantu woseni wendile hadya, niyo amgamba yudya mntu, “Chumiza umkono wako.” Naye niyo adamanya seivyo, mkono wakwe niyo wahona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mna wadya wantu niyo wengilwa niyo wehiwa wafanyanya wamtende chisimo chani Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu asagula wasigilwa mlongo na waidi</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 10:1-4; Mako 3:13-19</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mwa amazuwa ayo Yesu akwelaga ko lugulu akucheleza chilo chijima akamlombeza Chohile. <verse number="13" style="v" />Eze kuche, niyo etanga wanampina wakwe, na kusagula mlongo na waidi mgati mwawo, na kuwetanga wasigilwa, <verse number="14" style="v" />Simoni yudya amwinkile zina dya Petulo na mlukolo ywakwe Anduleya, Yakobo na Yohana, Filipo na Batolomayo, <verse number="15" style="v" />Matayo na Tomaso, Yakobo mwana ywa Alifayo, na Simoni akwitangwa Zelote, <verse number="16" style="v" />Yuda mwana ywa Yakobo na Yuda Isikaliyote amhosize Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahinya na kuhonya wantu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 4:23-25</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Yesu eze asele kulaila ko lugulu hamwenga na wanampina wakwe, wachimala hantu hachumile. Wanampina wakwe walozize. Fyo kulu dya wantu walaile ntendele zose za Yudeya na wantu walaile Yelusalemu na mpwani ya Tilo na Sidoni, <verse number="18" style="v" />Wantu awo naweza kumwetegeleza Yesu na kuhonywa manyonje yawo. Wadya wendile wakasulumizwa ni mpepo nchafu nawahonywa. <verse number="19" style="v" />Wantu wose nawakajeza kumkufya, kwa idya nguvu nendile ikalaila mndani mwakwe na kuwahonya wose.</para>
  <para style="s">Chinyemi na usungu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 5:1-12</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Yesu kawasinya wanampina wakwe agamba,</para>
  <para style="q">“Chinyemi china nyuwe wachiwa,</para>
  <para style="q">kwaviya Useuta wa Chohile ni wenyu!</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chinyemi china nyuwe mkulumwa nisala vino haluse,</para>
  <para style="q">kwaviya namwigute!</para>
  <para style="q">Chinyemi china nyuwe mkwila vino haluse,</para>
  <para style="q">kwa viya namseke!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Chinyemi china nyuwe chipindi wantu wakawaihiwani, na kuwalemela, na kuwahulutani, na kugambigwa mwiha, kwa chausa cha Mwana ywa Mntu! <verse number="23" style="v" />Mbwedani aho mbuli izo nazilaile, kwaviya mwikiwa ntunyo nkulu uko kwembingu. Kwaviya wadalahala wawo wawadamanyizaga saivyo wawoni.”</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Mna na mvimanye nyuwe mwi wagoli vino haluse,</para>
  <para style="q">kwaviya mhokela kale chinyemi chenyu!</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Namvimanye nyuwe mwigute vino haluse,</para>
  <para style="q">kwaviya namtende na sala!</para>
  <para style="q">Namvimanye nyuwe mkuseka vino haluse,</para>
  <para style="q">kwaviya namwomboleze na kwila!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Namvimanye nyuwe uneva wantu wakawatogolani, kwaviya wadalahala wawo watendaga saivyo wawoni wadanti.</para>
  <para style="s">Kuwaunga wankondo</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 5:38-48; 7:12a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Mna nawagambilani nyuwe mkunitegeleza, waungeni wankondo wenyu, wadamanyizeni vyedi wadya wakuwehiwani. <verse number="28" style="v" />Wajimbikeni wadya wakuwaligita, naho walombezezeni kwa Chohile wadya wakuwadamanyiza yehiye. <verse number="29" style="v" />Uneva mntu anakutowa mwe funda imwe, mleke akutowe mwe funda ya kaidi nayo, naho uneva mntu anaguha inkazu yako, mwinke ne shati nayo. <verse number="30" style="v" />Mntu yoyose akukulombeza chintu, naho mntu yoyose akukuhoka chintu chako, usekumgamba akuvuzize. <verse number="31" style="v" />Saviya mkunga wantu wawadamanyizeni nyuwe nanywi muwadamanyize seivyo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“Uneva mwa waunga wadya wakuwaungani awodu, ni mbwani mkunga mhokele ntogozi? Kwaviya hata wata masa wawaunga wadya wakuwaunga! <verse number="33" style="v" />Naho uneva mkawadamanyiza yedi wadya wakuwadamanyizani yedi, na mhokele ntunyo yani? Kwaviya hata wata masa wadamanya seivyo! <verse number="34" style="v" />Naho uneva mwawakopesha wadya mmanyize kugamba nawawaliheni, ni mbwani mkunga mhokele ntogozi? Hata wata masa wawakopesha wata masa, wakatenda na msuhi wakulihwa chiyasi ichiya! <verse number="35" style="v" />Mna nyuwe waungeni wankondo wenyu naho wadamanyizeni yedi, wakopesheni naho msekwika fanyanyi za kuvuzizwa. Mkaheza namwinkigwe jeleko kulu, na mtende chindedi wana wa Chohile Mkulu ywa kwembingu Kwaviya uyo ni ywedi kwa wantu wehiye hewena ntogozi. <verse number="36" style="v" />Mtende wata mbazi saviya Tati yenyu ana mbazi.</para>
  <para style="s">Kuwakantila watuhu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 7:1-5</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />“Mse kukantila watuhu, na Chohile naye hawakantile nyuwe, mse kuwalaha watuhu, na Chohile naye hawalaheni, walekeileni watuhu, na Chohile naye nawalekeile nyuwe. <verse number="38" style="v" />Wenkeni watuhu, na Chohile nawenkeni nyuwe. Kwaviya na mhimilwe chihimo chimemile na kusintwa mwe mikono yenyu. Naho chihimo mkunga muwahimile watuhu nicho Chohile naajeseze kuwahimila nyuwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Yesu naye niyo awagambila mligano uno akawauza, “Tuntu hakudaha kumlongoza ntutu mnyawe, anadamanya ivyo, wose waidi nawagwele mwe bome. <verse number="40" style="v" />Hahana mwanampina akumjinka mhinya wakwe, mna chila mwanampina umo akakomeleza mahinyo yakwe, natende saviya mhinya ywakwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />“Ni mbwani ukusinya kabasi kemwe ziso dya mlukolo ywako, mna hukuwona msomo wi mwe diziso dyako? <verse number="42" style="v" />Hegu naudahe vivihi kumgamba mlukolo ywako, ‘Hake, mlukolo ywangu, goja huuse kabasi mwe diziso dyako,’ mna hukuwona msomo wi mwe diziso dyako mwenye? Msongaganyi weye! Konga kuusa msomo wi mwe diziso dyako mwenye, nivyo naudahe kuwona pwilili na kudaha kuusa msomo wi mwe diziso dya mlukolo mnyawo.</para>
  <para style="s">Mti na matunda yakwe</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 7:16-20; 12:33-35</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />“Mti wedi haukweleka matunda yaihiye, naho mti wihiye haukweleka matunda yedi. <verse number="44" style="v" />Kwaviya chila mti umanyika kulawana na matunda yakwe ukweleka, wantu hawakwaha tini mwe saka dya miwa hegu kutunda zabibu mwe misongoma. <verse number="45" style="v" />Mntu ywedi alavya yedi kulaila mwe mpamba imwakwe, na mntu ehiye alavya yehiye kulaila mwe mpamba yakwe ya mbuli zihiye. Kwaviya mntu alonga chiya chimemile mo moyo wakwe.</para>
  <para style="s">Wazesi waidi wa nyumba</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 7:24-27</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />“Ni mbwani mkunitanga, ‘Zumbe, Zumbe,’ mna hamkudamanya yadya huwagambilani? <verse number="47" style="v" />Chila mntu akwiza kwangu na kwiva mbuli zangu na kuzitimila, nani walagise ivyo eli. <verse number="48" style="v" />Uyo kekela enga mntu, mo kuzenga nyumba yakwe, asimbisa na kwika msingi wakwe mwe luwe. Fula nkulu ize inye yabohola mo mto yaisingisa inyumba iyo mna haisingisike, kwaviya izengwa vyedi. <verse number="49" style="v" />Mna mntu yoyose akwiva izimbuli zangu akaleka kuzitoza aliganywa na mntu azengile nyumba mlanga mwe msanga hesimbile msingi, mazi ya bohole mwe mto yakeisingisa inyumba iyo yagwa hasi, naho yabogozoka!”</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Yesu amhonya mtumwa ywa mkulu ywa wankondo wa Lumi</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 8:5-13</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Yesu eze abinde kulonga yoseni yano kwa wantu, niyo aita Kapelinaumu. <verse number="2" style="v" />Mkulu yumwenga ywa wankondo gana wa Chilumi nana mtumwa amungise, mtumwa uyo nani mnyonje gaja.<figure style="fig" desc="" file="08 Centurion.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="LUK 7.2">Mkulu ywa wankondo gana wa Chilumi </figure> <verse number="3" style="v" />Yudya mkulu eze eve mbuli za Yesu, niyo awasigila wadalahala wamwenga wa Chiyahudi waite wakamlombeze akamhonye umtumwa ywakwe. <verse number="4" style="v" />Weze wambwile Yesu, niyo wamlombezesa, “Ichindedi mntu yuno aungigwa umwambize <verse number="5" style="v" />kwaviya awaunga wantu wose, naho kachizengela nyumba yo kuvikila.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Akaheza Yesu niyo ajesanya nawo. Eze abule haguhi ne nyumba ya yudya mkulu ywa wankondo, niyo yudya mkulu awasigilaga wambuyaze kumgamba Yesu, “Zumbe, usekwehosa kwiza kuno, kwaviya miye sikuwagila kukuhokela mwe nyumbangu. <verse number="7" style="v" />Naho miye nami sikuwagila kwiza kwako. Mna longa ulosi du, na mtumwa ywangu nahone. <verse number="8" style="v" />Kwaviya miye mwenye nami ni mntu mta udahi, naho nina wankondo we hasi yangu. Ninamgamba yumwenga, ‘Hita!’ Naye aita, na ninamgamba mtuhu, ‘So!’ Naye eza, na ninamgamba mtumwa ywangu, ‘Damanya vino!’ Naye adamanya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Yesu eze eve ivyo niyo ehelwa, niyo ahitukila idifyo dya wantu dikumtimila na kugamba, “Nawagambilani, sinati kuwona uzumizi sauno mwe isi yose ya Izulaeli!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Wadya wantu wasigilwe wauya kukaya kwa yudya mkulu na kumbwila mtumwa ywakwe kahona.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu auyusa mwana mvyele afilwe ni mgosiwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zuwa dikutimila, Yesu hamwenga na wanampina wakwe waita he mzi ukwitangwa Nayani. Fyo kulu dya wantu niyo dyawabasa. <verse number="12" style="v" />Umo wehaguhi ne nchili yo umzi, niyo kwa laila wantu wenule chimba cha mbwanga yumwenga endile ni mwana ichedu ywa mvyele afilwe ni mgosiwe, na fyo kulu dyo mzi udya nendile dikamsindikiza yudya mvyele kokuhamba. <verse number="13" style="v" />Zumbe eze amwone uyo umvyele, niyo amfila mbazi, na kumgamba, “Usekwila.” <verse number="14" style="v" />Niyo asogela na kuditoza idijeneza, wadya wagosi nawadinule niyo wachimala. Yesu agamba, “Mbwanga! Nakugamba, inuka!” <verse number="15" style="v" />Yudya mbwanga abanike enuka, ekala na kukonga kulonga. Yesu amwigala kwa mami yakwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Wantu wose niyo wengila woga na kumtunya Chohile. Niyo wagamba, “Muwoni mkulu kachilaila mgati mwetu! Chohile keza kwambiza wantu wakwe!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mbuli zino za Yesu zijenda mwe si yoseni ya Yudeya na si zoseni zi mguhi.</para>
  <para style="s">Wasigilwa kulaila kwa Yohana Mta kubatiza</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 11:2-19</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Wanampina wa Yohana niyo wamgambila Yohana izimbuli zino zose. Naye niyo etanga waidi mgati mwawo <verse number="19" style="v" />na kuwasigila kwa Zumbe wakamuze, “Vino weye nuyo alongigwe ni Yohana kugamba neze, hegu chimgoje mtuhu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Weze wabule kwa Yesu, wamgamba, “Yohana Mta kubatiza kachisigila chize chikuze kugamba ni weye nawize, hegu chimgoje mtuhu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chipindi ichiya Yesu nendile akawahonya wantu walozize wendile wanyonje na wata mpepo nchafu na kuwatenda mantuntu walozize wawone. <verse number="22" style="v" />Ivyo Yesu awahitula wanampina, “Hitani mkamgambile Yohana yadya muwone na kwiva, mantuntu wawona, viwete wajenda, wadya wakuhuma matana walenguka, hewekwiva weva, wabanike wauyuswa, na Mbuli Yedi ya Chohile yalongwa kwa wachiwa. <verse number="23" style="v" />Chinyemi china wadya hewena nkama na miye!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Wanampina wa Yohana weze wahalawe, Yesu niyo akonga kuwasimwila wantu mbuli za Yohana, “Umo mwitile kwenyika, namwita kusinya mbwani? Vino namwita kusinya nyasi ikusingiswa ni mpeho? <verse number="25" style="v" />Vino mlaila kuse mkasinye mbwani? Mntu avikile suche zedi? Bule! Wantu wakuvika suche za chiseuta naho wekala wikazi wa chigoli we mwe nyumba za chiseuta! <verse number="26" style="v" />Nigambilani, mwakusinya mbwani kuse? Muwoni? Chindedi, mna muwona akujinka muwoni. <verse number="27" style="v" />Kwaviya Yohana nuyo alongigwe mwa Mawandiko kugamba, ‘Chohile kagamba, nanisigile msigilwa ywangu akulongwele kukudamanyiza sila.’ <verse number="28" style="v" />Yesu ajendeleza kulonga,” Nawagambilani, “Yohana ni mkulu kujinka mntu yoyose elekwe ni mvyele. Mna mntu mdodo kujinka wose mo Useuta wa Chohile ni mkulu kujinka Yohana.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Wantu wose weze weve ayo, na hata wachisanya kodi, niyo nawazumila wedi wa Chohile kwaviya na wakabatizwa ni Yohana. <verse number="30" style="v" />Mna Mafalisayo hamwenga na wahinya Sigilizi walemela kumwiva Chohile naho nawalemela kubatizwa ni Yohana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Yesu niyo ajendeleza kulonga, “Vino wantu wa dyelo nadaha kuwaliganya na mbwani? Waligana na mbwani? <verse number="32" style="v" />Waligana na wana wekale he gwilo. Bunga dimwenga dyagutila kwa tuhu, ‘Chawachemelaga wila wa nyinka, mna hamwavinaga! Chachemaga wila wa ndilo, mna hamwiile!’ <verse number="33" style="v" />Yohana Mta kubatiza nakeza hekudya naho hakunywa divai, mwagambaga, ‘Ana mpepo!’ <verse number="34" style="v" />Mwana Mntu ezaga, naakadya na kunywa, niyo mwagamba, ‘Mkauleni yuno mntu! Aungisa kudya, naho ni mkozi, mbuya ywa wachisanya kodi na wata masa!’ <verse number="35" style="v" />Mna ubala wa Chohile uwoneka wedi naho wachindedi kwa wadya woseni wakuuzumila.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu mnyumba mwa Simoni Mfalisayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Mntu yumwenga Mfalisayo amgoneke Yesu mwe nkande ya chisingi. Niyo Yesu aita kwe kaya ya Mfalisayo uyo, ekala na kudya. <verse number="37" style="v" />Mwo umzi udya, nakuna mvyele mta masa. Keva kugamba Yesu naakadya mwe kaya ya Mfalisayo uyo, ivyo aguha kasupa kamemile mavuta ya kupwepweleka vitana. <verse number="38" style="v" />Achimala haguhi na Yesu kuno akaila, akachabaza iviga vya Yesu na mesozi yakwe. Niyo avifuta kwa fili zakwe, vikajika asesa na kuvikuluguta mavuta. <verse number="39" style="v" />Yudya Mfalisayo eze awone ivyo, afanyanya mo moyo wakwe, “Uneva chindedi mntu yuno nani muwoni, nakabunkula kugamba mvyele yuno akumtoza evivihi, nakamanya kugamba ni mta masa!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Yesu amgamba Mfalisayo uyo, “Simoni, nonga hugambile chintu.”</para>
  <para style="p">Simoni niyo agamba, “Haya Mhinyi, nigambila.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Yesu niyo akonga kulonga, “Nahana wantu waidi wakopaga hela kulaila kwa mntu akukopesha. Yumwenga nakakopa matundu magana mashano na mtuhu naye akopaga matundu milongo mishano. <verse number="42" style="v" />Hahana adahile kuliha matundu ayo, ivyo yudya mntu awakopeshaga niyo awalekeila awagamba wose wasekumliha. Haluse ni yuhi namungise mgati mwa wadya waidi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Simoni ahitula, “Nafanyanya kugamba ni yudya alekeilwe mta deni dya matundu yalozize.”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu amgamba, “Ni chindedi.” <verse number="44" style="v" />Niyo amhitukila yudya mvyele na kumgamba Simoni, “Wamwona mvyele yuno? Siza mwe kaya yako, huninkile mazi ya kuhaka iviga vyangu, mna mvyele yuno kanihaka iviga vyangu kwa mesozi yakwe na kuvifuta kwa fili zakwe. <verse number="45" style="v" />Hunihokele kwa kunisesa, mna yuno kukongela hadya nizile halekile kunisesa mwe viga vyangu. <verse number="46" style="v" />Huukulugute mavuta mtwi wangu, mna mvyele uyu kakuluguta mavuta matana iviga vyangu. <verse number="47" style="v" />Nakugambila, kwaviya kausizwa masa yakwe yalozize, ivyo naye aungisa. Mna mntu yeyose alekeilwe masa majeche naye aunga kidodo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Niyo Yesu amgamba yudya mvyele, “Kulekeilwa amasa yako.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Wantu watuhu wekale mwe meza wakonga kulonga wenye, “Yuno ni yuhi akudaha kulekeila masa?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Mna Yesu amgamba yudya mvyele, “Uzumizi wako ukuhonya. Jenda kwa utondowazi.”</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Wavyele nawakamwambiza Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Akajika, Yesu katamba kwe mizi na kaya kulonga Mbuli Yedi yo Useuta wa Chohile. Wanampina mlongo na waidi niyo waita naye, <verse number="2" style="v" />wavyele wamwenga wahonyigwe manyonje na kulavigwa mpepo ni Yesu nawo wawabasa. Wavyele awo wendaga ni Maliyamu akwitangwa Magidalena, yudya alavigwe mpepo nchafu mfungate, <verse number="3" style="v" />Yona, mkaza Kuza endaga mkulu mwe chitala cha Helode, Suzana, wavyele watuhu walozize. Wavyele awo wajesezaga ugoli wawo kumsankanila Yesu hamwenga na wanampina wakwe.</para>
  <para style="s">Mliganyo wa mhandi</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 13:1-9; Mako 4:1-9</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Wantu wajendeleza kwiza kwa Yesu kulaila chila mzi. Umo fyo kulu dya wantu dize didugane, Yesu nakasimwila mliganyo uno.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Hendaga na mntu aitile kuhanda mbeyu. Umo akamyaga izimbeyu mwe nkonde, zimwenga zigwela mwe sila. Aho zijatwa, wadege wa kulanga nawo wazidya. <verse number="6" style="v" />Izimwenga zigwela mwe luwe. Zize zikonge kuhota, zinyala kwaviya ulongo uswesa mazi. <verse number="7" style="v" />Izimwenga zigwela mwe miwa, zikula hamwenga ne miwa, miwa niyo yazifintafinta. <verse number="8" style="v" />Mbeyu ntuhu zigwela mwe ulongo wedi. Zakula na kweleka, chila imwenga nkanana gana.”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu naye abindiliza, “Mta magutwi neve!”</para>
  <para style="s">Vikuleka akuhinya kwa miliganyo</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 13:10-17; Mako 4:10-12</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Wanampina wakwe wamuza Yesu mliganyo uno ni mbwani, <verse number="10" style="v" />Niyo ahitula, “Nyuwe ugubwilwa kumanya chinyele cho Useuta wa Chohile, mna kwa wantu watuhu vyalongwa kwa miliganyo, chani wanasinya wasekuona, wanategeleza wasekukombaganya.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu atambalisa mliganyo wa mhandi</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 13:18-23; Mako 4:13-20</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Mliganyo uno nikugamba, mbeyu ni Mbuli ya Chohile. <verse number="12" style="v" />Izimbeyu zigwele mwe sila zaligana na wantu wakwiva Mbuli ya Chohile, mna Mwavu eza na kuiguha Mbuli iyo mwe myoyo yawo chani wasekuzumila na kukombolwa. <verse number="13" style="v" />Izimbeyu zigwele mwe luwe zaligana na wantu wakwiva Mbuli ya Chohile na kuihokela kwa chinyemi, mna haikwingila mwe myoyo yawo. Waizumila hadodo, mna wanajezwa waileka. <verse number="14" style="v" />Izimbeyu zigwele mwe miwa ni mliganyo wa wantu wakwiva Mbuli ya Chohile, mna wafintwa ni nkunto na ugoli na mbwedo wa mwe isi vyaleka wadunduga kweleka matunda. <verse number="15" style="v" />Izimbeyu zigwele mwe ulongo wedi zaligana na wantu wakwiva Mbuli ya Chohile, waizumila na kuika mwe myoyo yawo, naho waitoza kubula kweleka matunda.</para>
  <para style="s">Taa igubikwe mwe nyungu</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 4:21-25</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Wantu hawakuwasha taa na kuigubika na nyungu hegu kuika kwe divungu. Mna waika mnanga mwe chiya cha kwikiya taa, chani wantu walangazwe umo wakengila mnyumba.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Chochose chifisigwe nachilavyanywe kung'aile, naho chochose chigubikwe nachigubulwe na kwikwa kung'aile.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Elo msinyise, saviya mkwiva, kwaviya mta chintu nongezezwe, mna yudya hena chintu nahokwe chiya ichidodo akufanyanya ananacho.”</para>
  <para style="s">Nine na walukolo wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 12:46-50; Mako 3:31-35</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nine na walukolo wa Yesu wambasaga, mna hawadahile kumbwila kwa chausa che idifyo kulu dya wantu. <verse number="20" style="v" />Mntu yumwenga amgamba Yesu, “Mamiyako na walukolo wako wachimala heise waunga wakuwone.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Yesu awagamba wantu wose, “Mnala na walukolo wangu ni wadya wakwiva Mbuli ya Chohile na kuitimila.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aikwahila nkung'unto</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 8:23-27; Mako 4:35-41</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Zuwa dimwenga Yesu nakakwela mwe ngalawa hamwenga na wanampina wakwe. Niyo awagamba, “Chiteni ntendele ntuhu ye idiziwa.” Ivyo wakonga kwita. <verse number="23" style="v" />Umo wendile mwe ngalawa wakaita, Yesu niyo agona ntongo. Aho nkung'unto nkulu yavumila mwe diziwa, niyo ingalawa yakonga kumema mazi, woseni nawe mwe chilozo chikulu. <verse number="24" style="v" />Elo wanampina wakwe niyo wamwinula wakamgamba, “Zumbe, Zumbe! Chafa!”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu eze enuke, niyo akwahila idya inkung'unto na amawimbi ya mazi, niyo vya nyamala. <verse number="25" style="v" />Niyo awagamba wanampina wakwe, “Uzumizi wenyu nuhi?”</para>
  <para style="p">Mna wehelwa na kogoha kuno wakagambilana, “Yuno ni mntu ywani? Alonga na nkung'unto namawimbi navyo vyamwiva!”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahonya mta mpepo</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 8:28-34; Mako 5:1-20</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Yesu hamwenga na wanampina wakwe wajendeleza ne ntambo. Niyo wabula kwe isi ya Gelasi imwe ntendele ntuhu ye diziwa dya Galilaya. <verse number="27" style="v" />Yesu eze alawe mwe ingalawa, niyo adugana na mntu kudya ko mzi yudya endaga na mpepo. Mntu yudya nendile hakuvika suche kwa chipindi chitali, naho nendile hakwikala mwe nyumba, mna nakekala kwe zimbila. <verse number="28" style="v" />Eze amwone Yesu, kaguta kwa izwi kulu, kedula hasi mwe viga vya Yesu, na kugamba, “Yesu, Mwana Chohile ekulanga! Waunga mbwani kwangu? Nakulombeza, usekusulumiza!” <verse number="29" style="v" />Mntu uyo nakalonga ivyo kwaviya Yesu kamlagiza mpepo nchafu imlawe. Nkanana zilozize mpepo uyo nakamwizila uyo, hatahegu wantu nawakamvugaila mntu yudya, nakanyinywa mikono yakwe ne viga vyakwe kwa minyolo, mna nakaikanta minyolo iyo, na mpepo nakamwigala kwe nyika.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Yesu amuza, “Zina dyako niweye yuhi?”</para>
  <para style="p">Amhitula, “Zina dyangu nuyo ‘Nimiye Fyo’,” nakahitula ivyo kwaviya nendile na mpepo zilozize. <verse number="31" style="v" />Mpepo zamlombeza Yesu asekuzigala kwe dibome hedina uhelo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Nahana fyo dya nguluwe hajihi, dikadya hankanda he kagulu. Ivyo izimpepo zamlombeza Yesu azigale zikengile mwe izinguluwe, naye azumila. <verse number="33" style="v" />Ivyo mpepo zamlawa yudya mntu, niyo zengila mwe izinguluwe. Idifyo dyose dye zinguluwe digulukila ntendele ya kagulu kwe diziwa na kudidimila mwa mazi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Wantu nawakadima izinguluwe weze wawone chilaile, niyo waguluka na kulonga izimbuli izo mo mzi na mwe zinkonde. <verse number="35" style="v" />Wantu niyo waita wakakaule ni chibwani chilaile. Weze wabule kwa Yesu, wambwila yudya mntu alavigwe mpepo kekala he viga vya Yesu, kavika suche, na ana fanyanyi zakwe zedi. Niyo woseni wengila ni woga. <verse number="36" style="v" />Wadya wawone imbuli idya, wawagambila wantu yudya mntu mta mpepo viya ahonyigwe. <verse number="37" style="v" />Niyo wantu woseni wa si ya Gelasi wamwunga Yesu aite kwaviya nawakogoha vidala. Ivyo Yesu engila mwe ngalawa na kuhalawa. <verse number="38" style="v" />Yudya mntu alavigwe izimpepo amlombeza Yesu waitanye. Mna Yesu amgamba, <verse number="39" style="v" />“Uya kukaya naho ukawagambile wantu chiya udamanyizwe ni Chohile.”</para>
  <para style="p">Yudya mntu niyo aita ko umzi wose, awagambila wantu viya adamanyizwe ni Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Mndele abanike na mvyele mnyonje</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 9:18-26; Mako 5:21-43</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Yesu eze auye kwe ntendele ntuhu ye diziwa, wantu wamhokela, kwaviya woseni nawakamgoja. <verse number="41" style="v" />Akaheza niyo eza mntu yumwenga akwitangwa Yailo, nani mntu mkulu mwe nyumba yo kuvikila. Kedula hasi mwe viga vya Yesu na kumlombeza aite kwakwe, <verse number="42" style="v" />kwaviya mwanawe ywa chiche ywe ichedu mta mihilimo mlongo na midi, na akabanika.</para>
  <para style="p">Umo Yesu akaita uko, fyo dya wantu na dikamfinta. <verse number="43" style="v" />Mgati mwawo nakuna mvyele akulawigwa sakame kwa mihilimo mlongo na midi, alavyaga vyoseni ananavyo kwa wagangana, mna hahana hata yumwenga adahile kumhonya. <verse number="44" style="v" />Mvyele uyo kalaila mwe difyo hanyuma ha Yesu nakukufya lepe dye suche yakwe, aho sakame niyo ileka kumlawa. <verse number="45" style="v" />Yesu auza, “Sikufywa ni yani?”</para>
  <para style="p">Chila yumwenga kalemela, niyo Petulo agamba, “Zumbe, wantu woseni wakuzunguluka nakukufintafinta.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Mna Yesu agamba, “Kuna mntu yumwenga anikufize, sibunkula kwaviya nguvu zinilawa.” <verse number="47" style="v" />Yudya mvyele kawona kugamba kabunkulwa, Elo eza akazingiza nakwedula hasi he viga vya Yesu. Mwa meso ya chila mntu, akamgambila ivyo vilekile akamkufya na vilekile kahonywa aho. <verse number="48" style="v" />Yesu niyo amgamba, “Mwanangu, uzumizi wako ukuhonya. Jenda na utondowazi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Umo Yesu achei akulonga mbili izo, msigilwa yumwenga eza kulaila kwa yudya mkulu akwitagwa Yailo we nyumba yo kuvikila. Amgamba Yailo, “Mwanawo kabanika,” “usekumjela kivuzovuzo mhinya naho.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Mna Yesu eze eve ivyo, amgamba Yailo, “Usekogoha, zumila du, nahone.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Yesu eze abule kwe nyumba ya Yailo, haungile engile kunyumba na mntu mna Petulo, Yohana, na Yakobo, na tati ya mtu na mami ywa mwana. <verse number="52" style="v" />Wantu wose nendile wakaila nakulomboleza kwa chausa cho mwana. Yesu agamba, “Usekwila, mwana habanike katakutongomala du!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Wose niyo wamseka, kwaviya nawamanya kugamba kabanika. <verse number="54" style="v" />Mna Yesu niyo amtoza umkono na kumwitanga kwa izwi, “Chimala, mwanangu!” <verse number="55" style="v" />Muye wakwe umuwiya, niyo achimala ahadya, Yesu niyo awaunga wamwinke chintu cha kudya. <verse number="56" style="v" />Welesi wakwe weheleswa, mna Yesu kawalagisa wasekugambila mntu yeyose chilaile.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu awasigila wanampina Mlongo na waidi</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 10:5-15; Mako 6:7-13</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Yesu awetanga hamwenga wanampina mlongo na waidi niyo awenka nguvu za kugulusa mpepo na udahi wa kuhonya manyonje. <verse number="2" style="v" />Niyo awasigila kulonga Useuta wa Chohile na kuhonya wanyonje, <verse number="3" style="v" />akawagamba, “Msekuguha chochose mwe ntambo yenyu, msekuguha nkome, hegu mkwiji hegu nkande hegu hela, naho hata suche mbili. <verse number="4" style="v" />Hohose mkuhokelwa, ikalani umo mnyumba kubula mumlawe mo mzi uwo, <verse number="5" style="v" />hohose hemkuhokelwa, halaweni houmzi uwo, mpugute tifili mwe viga vyenyu vitende ukuzi kwawo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Wanampina niyo wajinka mwe vijiji wakalonga Mbuli yedi nakuhonya wantu chila hantu.</para>
  <para style="s">Mkanganyo wa Helode</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 14:1-12; Mako 6:14-29</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Helode, chilongozi wa Galilaya eze eve mbuli zoseni nazikalaila, kazaganywa vidala, kwaviya wantu wamwenga nawakagamba kugamba Yohana Mta kubatiza kauyuka. <verse number="8" style="v" />Watuhu nawakagamba Eliya kalaila, watuhu nawakagamba yumwenga mwa wawoni wa chikale kauyuka. <verse number="9" style="v" />Helode agamba, “Sikanta umtwi wa Yohana, mna yuno mntu ni yuhi hwiva izimbuli zino?” Niyo ajendeleza kujeza kumwona Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu alisa Fyo Kulu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 14:13-21; Mako 6:30-44; Yohana 6:1-14</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Wasigilwa weze wauye niyo wamgambila Yesu chila chintu wadamanye. Niyo ahalawa nawo, waita wenye kwe mzi ukwitangwa Betisaida. <verse number="11" style="v" />Idifyo dya wantu dize dive imbuli iyo, niyo wamtimila. Kawahokela, alonga nawo mbuli za Useuta wa Chohile, nakuhonya wadya waungile kuhonywa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Umo zuwa dikakonga kuswa, wadya wanampina wakwe mlongo na waidi wambasa nakugamba, “Lagana na wano wantu chani waite, kwe imizi na kwezinkonde zimjihi wakalonde nkande na hantu ha kugona kwa viya hano chili hechedu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mna awagamba “Wenkeni nyuwe wenye chintu cha kudya.”</para>
  <para style="p">Wahitula, “Chinanayo ni migate mishano na wasamaki waidi. Waunga chikagule nkande ya fyo jima?” <verse number="14" style="v" />Nahana wantu wakubula magana milongo mishano</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu awagamba wanampina wakwe, “Wagambeni wantu wekale mwe mabunga ya wantu milongo mishano shano.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Wanampina weze wabinde kudamanya niyo wantu wekale hasi, <verse number="16" style="v" />Yesu niyo aiguha idya imigate mishano na wadya wasamaki waidi, asinya kulanga, amjimbika Chohile, aibesula, awenka wanampina wawasangile wantu. <verse number="17" style="v" />Woseni wadya niyo weguta, wanampina walogota ntangulu mlongo na mbili za viya visigazwe.</para>
  <para style="s">Kweila kwa Petulo kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 16:13-19; Mako 8:27-29</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zuwa dimwenga umo Yesu akamlombeza Chohile echedu, wanampina wambasa. Awauza, “Idifyo dyanigamba miye ni yuhi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Wamhitula “Wamwenga wagamba wi Yohana Mta kubatiza, watuhu wagamba wi Eliya, watuhu nawo wagamba wiyumwenga ywa wawoni wa chikale kauyuka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Awauza, “Nanywi mwagaze?, Mwanigamba miye ni yuhi?”</para>
  <para style="p">Petulo ahitula, “Wi Kulisito ywa Chohile.”</para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu asimwila masulumizo na file yakwe</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 16:20-28; Mako 8:30-9:1</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Yesu niyo awalemeza wasekumgambila mntu yoyose imbuli iyo. <verse number="22" style="v" />Alonga naho kwawo, “Mwana ywa Mntu aungigwa asulumizwe na kulemelwa ni vilongozi wadalahala na mlavyantambiko mkulu na wahinya Sigilizi. Nakomwe, mna mazuwa matatu yakutimila nauyuke.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Niyo alonga kwa woseni, “Yoyose akunga anitimile aungigwa elemele, aguhe msalaba wakwe chila zuwa, nakunitimila. <verse number="24" style="v" />Kwaviya yoyose akunga ahonye ujima wakwe nawaze, mna yoyose akunga awaze ujima wakwe nauhonye. <verse number="25" style="v" />Kuna wedi wani kwa mntu kuhokela isi njima, mna aho aza ujima wakwe? <verse number="26" style="v" />Mntu ananiwonela soni na amahinyo yangu, Mwana ywa mntu naye namwone soni umo akeza mo ukuka wakwe na Ukulu wa Tate na wandima wa kwembingu wakukile. <verse number="27" style="v" />Nawagambilani chindedi, watuhu hano hawabanike kubula wauwone Useuta wa Chohile.”</para>
  <para style="s1">Mwili wa Yesu wahitukila</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 17:1-8; Mako 9:2-8</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Mazuwa mfungate eze alonge mbuli izo, Yesu awaguha Petulo na Yohana na Yakobo niyo waita he kagulu kumlombeza Chohile. <verse number="29" style="v" />Umo akalombeza, uso wakwe uhitukila, suche zakwe nazo niyo zang'alisa. <verse number="30" style="v" />Aho wantu waidi nawehadya wakasimwila naye. Nani Musa na Eliya, <verse number="31" style="v" />wantu waidi Musa na Eliya walaila wakaoneka mgati mo langazi wo ukuka ukulaila kwembingu. Nendile wakalonga na Yesu mwa yadya nayamlaile kudya Yelusalemu. Chani achintize yawandikwe mwakwe. <verse number="32" style="v" />Petulo na weyawe nawadotwa ni ntongo, mna niyo wenuka nakuwona ukulu wa Yesu na wantu waidi wachimale naye. <verse number="33" style="v" />Wadya wantu weze wamwase Yesu, Petulo amgamba, “Zumbe, utana wani uno wihano! Nachizenge mahema matatu, dimwenga dyako, dimwenga dya Musa na dimwenga dya Eliya.” Hamanyaga vitendese chiya akutamwila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Iviya akajendeleza kutamwila, ingu dyalaila na kuwagubika kwa chizuli chakwe, wanampina wogoha umo idingu dikawezila. <verse number="35" style="v" />Izwi dyevika kulaila mwe dingu, “Yuno nuyo Mwanangu, nisagule mwetegelezeni!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Idizwi dize dinyamale, wamwona Yesu ichedu. Wanampina wanyamala kusimwila imbuli ino, chipindi chiya hawamgambile yoyose chochose wawone.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu amhonya mwana mta mpepo</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 17:14-18; Mako 9:14-27</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Zuwa ditimile Yesu na wadya wanampina watatu wasela kulaila kwa kagulu, fyo kulu dyadugana na Yesu. <verse number="38" style="v" />Mntu yumwenga aguta kulaila mwe difyo, “Mhinya! Nakulombeza, msinye mwanangu echedu! <verse number="39" style="v" />Mpepo nchafu inamwingila aho atula lwasu, kuno yamgwisa chifutu, malovu nayo yalawa mo mlomo, ijendeleza kumlumiza naho haikunga kumlekela aite! <verse number="40" style="v" />Nawalombezaga wanampina wako waiguluse, mna waidunduga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Yesu ahitula, “Nyuwe lweleko helwikumzumila Chohile naho lwagile! Nanikale nanyuwe kubula ini? Nanikale na nyuwe kubula ini?” Niwajijimizeni kubula ini? Niyo amgamba yudya mntu, “Mlete mwawo hano.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Umo yudya mbwanga akeza, mpepo nchafu imgwisa hasi nakumjela chifutu. Yesu aikwamila impepo iyo, amhonya umbwanga, nakumvuza kwa tatiyakwe. <verse number="43" style="v" />Wantu woseni wehelwa mo udahi mkulu wa Chohile.</para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu asimwila naho mbuli ye file yakwe</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 17:22-23; Mako 9:30-32</para>
  <para style="p">Wantu nawechei wehelwa kwa chila chintu naakadamanya Yesu, umo alongaga kwa wanampina wakwe, <verse number="44" style="v" />“Mnasekujala chino hunga nilonge nanywi! Mwana ywa Mntu nenkizwe mo udahi wa wantu.” <verse number="45" style="v" />Mna wanampina hawakombaganye mbuli iyo manakwe ni mbwani. Naifiswa kwawo chani wasekuikombaganya, naho nawakogoha kumwuza mwe mbuli iyo.</para>
  <para style="s1">Mkulu kujinka woseni ni yuhi?</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 18:1-5; Mako 9:33-37</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Malosano yakonga mgati mwe wanampina wakauzana ni yuhi mkulu kujinka woseni. <verse number="47" style="v" />Yesu niyo abunkula viya nawakafanyanya mwe myoyo yawo, ivyo aguha mwana, amchimalisa hankanda hakwe, <verse number="48" style="v" />nakuwagamba, “Yoyose akunga amhokele mwana yuno mwe zina dyangu, anihokela miye, naho akunihokela, iviya amhokela yudya anisigile. Kwaviya yoyose wa hasi mwenyu wose nuyo mkulu kujinka woseni.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yoyose hekuhingana nanyuwe ni kwa chausa chenyu</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 9:38-40</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Yohana alonga, “Zumbe, chiwona mntu akugulusa mpepo kwa zina dyako, niyo chamgamba aleke, kwaviya hemwe dibunga dyetu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Yesu niyo awagamba, “Msekumlemeza, kwaviya yoyose ehamwenga na nyuwe ni mnyenyu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Wantu wa Samaliya walemela kumhokela Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Chipindi chikasogela umo Yesu naguhigwe kwigalwa kwembingu, kaviwona akonge ntambo kubula Yelusalemu. <verse number="52" style="v" />Kasigila wantu wamlongweile, waitile kwe kaya ya Samaliya kumdamanyiza chila chintu kwa chausa chakwe. <verse number="53" style="v" />Mna wantu wo mzi udya hawamhokele, kwaviya ni pwilili kugamba emwe ntambo kwita Yelusalemu. <verse number="54" style="v" />Umo wanampina Yohana na Yakobo weze wawone vino, wagamba, “Zumbe waunga chisigile moto kulaila kwembingu uwabalange?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.54 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mawandiko matuhu wajeleka </char><char style="fq" closed="false">saviya adamanyaga Eliya.</char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Mna Yesu niyo awahitukila na kuwakwahila. <verse number="56" style="v" />Wakaheza waita kwe mzi mtuhu.</para>
  <para style="s">Wakunga watende wakumtimila Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 8:19-22</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Umo wakajenda mwe isila, mntu yumwenga amgamba Yesu, “Nahutimile hohose ukunga wite.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Yesu amgamba, “Mauzi yana mabome, wadege nawo wana masasa, mna Mwana ywa Mntu hana hantu hekugona.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Amgamba mntu mtuhu, “Nitimila.”</para>
  <para style="p">Mna yudya mntu agamba “Zumbe, ndakunileka nuye hamhambe tate.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Yesu ahitula, “Waleke wabanike wahambe wabanike wawo. Wite ukalonge Useuta wa Chohile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Mtuhu naho agamba, “Zumbe, nahutimile, mna ndakunileka nite halage kukaya kwangu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Yesu amgamba, “Yoyose akukonga kutoza jembe niyo ajendeleza kusinya kunyuma hakuwagila ko Useuta wa Chohile.”</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Yesu awasagula milongo mfungate na waidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Eze yajike ayo, Zumbe niyo asagula wantu watuhu milongo mfungate na waidi. Awasigila waididi wamlongwele kujinkila chila mzi na chila hantu endile uyo mwenye nakaunga aite. <verse number="2" style="v" />Awagamba, “Ulozo utendesa, mna wata kuvuna ni wajeche. Mlombezeni Zumbe ywenkonde egale wavuni mwe nkonde yakwe. <verse number="3" style="v" />Hitani! Mkaulise nawasigilani saviya ngoto mgatigati mwe mauzi. <verse number="4" style="v" />Msekwinula hela hegu mkwiji hegu vilatu, naho msekumlamsa mntu yoyose mwe sila. <verse number="5" style="v" />Mkengila mwe nyumba, kongani kugamba, ‘Utondowazi utendeke mwe nyumba ino.’ <verse number="6" style="v" />Uneva akwikala umo ni mntu akunga utondowazi, utondowazi wenyu neikale hamwenga nauyo, hegu bule, ndamsa yenyu yo utondowazi ne iwawiyeni wenye. <verse number="7" style="v" />Ikalani mwe nyumba iyo, mkadya na kunywa vyo vyose wakuwenkani, kwaviya wandima waugwa wenkigwe maliho yawo. Msekujenda jenda kulaila nyumba imwenga kwita ntuhu. <verse number="8" style="v" />Mkengile mwe mzi wowose niyo wantu wawahokeleni, dyani viya wakuwenkani, <verse number="9" style="v" />honyani wanyonje we mo mzi uwo, naho wagambeni wantu wa uko, ‘Useuta wa Chohile wiza haguhi henyu.’ <verse number="10" style="v" />Mna mkengila mwe mzi niyo hamhokelwe, fosani mo lwazo kuno mkagamba, <verse number="11" style="v" />‘Hata tifili dikulaila mo mzi wenyu dimamatile mwe viga vyetu chadikung'untila mwenyu. Mna mkumbuke kugamba Useuta wa Chohile wiza haguhi henyu!’ <verse number="12" style="v" />Nawagambilani chindedi kugamba mwe dizuwa dyo kukantilwa ni Chohile mzi uwo nawafile mbazi kujinka mzi wa Sodoma!</para>
  <para style="s">Mizi heikumzumila</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 11:20-24</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Nauluwone weye, Kolazoni! Nauluwone weye mzi wa Betisaida! Uneva mpituko zidamanywe kwenyu zadamanywe uko Tilo na Sidoni, wantu wa uko na weila chikale, wavala suche za majuniya, na kwehaka maivu, kulagisa kugamba waleka masa yawo! <verse number="14" style="v" />Chohile nawafile mbazi Tilo na Sidoni mwe dizuwa dyo kukantilwa kujinka kwenyu. <verse number="15" style="v" />Na kwachausa chako weye Kapelinaumu! Waunga wekweze wenye kwembingu? Naudulwe hasi kwe bome hedina uhelo!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Yesu alonga kwa wanampina wakwe, “Akuwategelezani nyuwe anitegeleza miye, na akuwalemelani nyuwe anilemela miye, na akunilemela miye amlemela yudya anisigile.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kuya kwa wadya milongo mfungate na waidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Wadya wantu milongo mfungate na waidi wauya weleleswa vidala. Wagamba, “Zumbe,” “hata mpepo zichiva hadya chize chizikwahile kwe dizina dyako!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Yesu niyo awahitula, “Simuwona Shetani akagwa kulaila kwembingu saviya lumwemwe. <verse number="19" style="v" />Tegelezani! Siwenkani udahi, chani mdahe kujata nyoka na visuse na nguvu zose za kumhuda yudya mwihi, naho hahana chikunga chiwalumize. <verse number="20" style="v" />Hata ivyo msekwelelwa kwaviya mpepo zawevani, mna mwelelwe kwaviya mazina yenyu yawandikwa kwembingu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu elelwa</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 11:25-27; 13:16-17</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mwe chipindi ichiya Yesu niyo amemezwa chinyemi kwa udahi wa Muye Ukukile, niyo agamba, “Tate, Zumbe dya kwembingu ne isi! Nakuhongeza kwaviya mbuli ufisize kwa wantu wata ubala na umanyi. Kuzivugula kwa wadodo. Heye Tate, zose izo ni kulawana neivyo vikuwagile.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Tate kaninka vintu vyoseni. Hahana akumanya Mwana ukaleka Tate, naho hahana amanyize Tate ukaleka Mwana na yoyose yudya Umwana akunga amlagise kwakwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Akaheza Yesu niyo awahitukila wanampina wakatenda wechedu, awagamba, “Watogolwe ni wantu wakuwona mbuli ziya mkuziwona! <verse number="24" style="v" />Nawagambilani kugamba wawoni na maseuta walozize nawakaungisa wayawone yadya mkuyawona nyuwe, mna hawayawone, nakuyeva yadya mkwiva, mna hawayevile.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mliganyo wa Mfambazi ywedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Akaheza mhinya yumwenga ywa Sigilizi niyo achimala amuza Yesu kwa kumjeza. Akamuza, “Mhinya,” “naungwa nitende mbwani chani nihokele ujima wa mazuwa yose?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Yesu amhitula, “Iwandikwa mbwani mwe Sigilizi? Wamanya mbwani ukaisoma?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Yudya mntu ahitula, “ ‘Munge Zumbe Chohile ywako kwa moyo wako wose, kwa muye wako wose, hamwenaga na nguvu zako, na kwa fanyanyi zako zose,’ ” naho “ ‘Munge mnyawo saviya ukweunga we mwenye.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Yesu ahitula, “Kuhitula vikungwa,” “damanya ivyo nawe nawikale.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mna yudya mhinya Sigilizi nakaunga awoneke ywedi, niyo amuza Yesu, “Mnyangu ni yuhi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Yesu ahitula, “Handaga na mntu yumwenga akulaila ko mzi wa Yelusalemu akasela kwita Yeliko mwesila adugana na wapolaganyi wamhuta, niyo wamwasa ehaguhi na kubanika. <verse number="31" style="v" />Niyo kwalaila mlavyantambiko yumwenga nakajinka mwe sila idya, mna eze amwone yudya mntu, niyo ajinkila mnkanda. <verse number="32" style="v" />Seivyo Mlawi yumwenga naye kabula aho, kajinka nakumsinya yudya mntu, niyo ajinkila mnkanda. <verse number="33" style="v" />Mna Mfambazi yumwenga endile akatamba mwe sila iyo kabula hayudya mntu, naye eze amwone, moyo wakwe wingilwa ni mbazi. <verse number="34" style="v" />Amsogeila, amwitila mavuta na divai mwe zinkwenje zakwe na kumzingiliza katambala, niyo amkweza mnanga mwe mpunda yakwe amwigala mwe nyumba ya kufikila wajeni, na kumuuguza. <verse number="35" style="v" />Zuwa ditimile alavya matundu maidi ya hela nakumwinka yudya msinya idya inyumba. Amgamba yudya msinya inyumba, ‘Msinye,’ umo haogola nanuye ne sila ino, ‘nahulihe chochose ukunga ujeseze mo kumsinya,’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Yesu niyo amuza yudya mhinya Sigilizi, “Mwezifanyanyanyi zako, niyuhi mwa wano watatu amwonele mbazi yudya mntu atoigwe na wapolaganyi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Yudya mhinya sigilizi amhitula, “Ni yudya afile mbazi.”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu ahitula, “Jenda, naho, na ukadamanye saivyo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu awatalamkila Masa na Maliyamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Umo Yesu na wanampina wakwe we mwe ntambo, kengila mwe mzi umwenga kudya na kuna mvyele yumwenga akwitagwa Matha kamhokela mwe nyumba yakwe. <verse number="39" style="v" />Masa na ana lumbudye akwitagwa Maliyamu ekale hasi mwe viga vya Zumbe na kwetegeleza mahinyo yakwe. <verse number="40" style="v" />Matha endaga na ndima zilozize mnyumba, ivyo kambasa Yesu na kumgamba, “Zumbe, hukuviwona vino lumbu dyangu anasize nisankane ichedu? Mgambe eze anambize!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Zumbe amhitula, “Matha, Matha! Wangadika na kwevinya mwe mbuli zilozize, <verse number="42" style="v" />mna kuna chintu chimwenga du chikungwa. Maliyamu kasagula chintu chikungiswa, na chiya hahana mntu namhoke.”</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Mahinyo ya Yesu mwe Kumlombeza Chohile</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 6:9-13; 7:7-11</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zuwa dimwenga Yesu nakalombeza hantu hamwenga. Eze abinde, yumwenga mwe wanampina wakwe amgamba, “Zumbe, chihinye kumlombeza Chohile, saviya Yohana awahinyaga wanampina wakwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Yesu awagamba, “Mkalombeza, gambani vino,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Tate,</para>
  <para style="q">Zina dyako ditunywe,</para>
  <para style="q">Useuta wako wize.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chinke nkande yetu ya chila zuwa.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chilekeile masa yetu,</para>
  <para style="q">kwaviya suwe chawalekeila wadya wachidamanyize vihihe.</para>
  <para style="q">Naho usekuchijela mwe majezo.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Niyo Yesu awagamba wanampina wakwe, “Fanyanyani yumwenga mgati mwenu aite kukaya kwa mbuyaye chilogati nakugamba, ‘Mbuyangu, nikopesha migate mitatu. <verse number="6" style="v" />Kwaviya sizilwa ni mbuyangu emwentambo mna sina nkande yoyose ya kumwinka!’ <verse number="7" style="v" />Fanyanya mbuyayo akuhitula kulaila kunyumba, ‘Use kunilonda ulosi! Lwivi luvugalwa kale, miye hamwenga na wanangu chimwe zisazi. Sikudaha kwinuka hwinke chochose.’ <verse number="8" style="v" />Ni vyedi, chikutimila ni chihi? Nawagambilani kugamba hata hegu henuke nakukwinka umgate kwaviya wi mbuyaye, mna nenuke na kukwinka vyoseni ukunga kwaviya huna soni kujendeleza kulombeza.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Na ivyo nalonga kwenyu, lombeza, nauhokele, londa, namwinkwe, towani hodi, na uvugwilwe ulwivi. <verse number="10" style="v" />Kwaviya woseni wakulombeza nawahokele, wadya wakulonda nawenkwe, lwivi nalwo naluvugulwe kwa yoyose akutowa hodi. <verse number="11" style="v" />Mwana anamlombeza tatiyakwe samaki, togola namwinke nyoka siyo samaki? <verse number="12" style="v" />Hegu wamwinka chisuse uneva kalombeza tagi? <verse number="13" style="v" />Wihi wenyu mnanawo, mvimanya kuwenka wana wenyu vintu vyedi. Haluse chihimo chani Tati yenyu ywa kwembingu na wenke Muye Ukukile kwa wadya wakumlombeza!”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Baizebuli</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 12:22-30; Mako 3:20-27</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Yesu nakagulusa mpepo heikulonga, mpepo ize ite, yudya mntu niyo akonga kulonga. Idifyo dyehelwa, <verse number="15" style="v" />mna wantu wamwenga wagamba, “Ni Belizebuli, mkulu ywa mpepo, amwinkile udahi wa kuzigulusa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Watuhu nawakaunga wamhime Yesu, ivyo wamlombeza awadamanyize vilagiso kulagisa kugamba udahi wakwe ulaila kwembingu kwa Chohile. <verse number="17" style="v" />Mna Yesu nakamanya viya nawakafanyanya, ivyo awagamba, “Wantu wa useuta wowose wakalemana wowo wenye useuta uwo naugwe. Naho wantu wa lukolo lumwenga wakalema wowo wenye, lukolo ulo lwagwa. <verse number="18" style="v" />Ivyo uneva useuta wa Shetani wepanga wenye mwe mafyo yakutowana, nawikale vivihi? Mwagamba Nagulusa mpepo kwaviya Belizebuli aninka udahi wa kudamanya ivyo. <verse number="19" style="v" />Uneva nagulusa mpepo kwa udahi wa Belizebuli, ivyo wantu we difyo dyenyu wazigulusa kwa udahi wayuhi? Wantu awo nawawone kwa sila ya ntendwa zawo kugamba nyuwe mkantilwa! <verse number="20" style="v" />Sivyo, nagulusa mpepo kwa udahi wa Chohile, vino vyalagisa kugamba Useuta wa Chohile wiza kale kwenyu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Mntu mta nguvu, akadima ikaya yakwe kwa viziha, ugoli wakwe wose wikala mpeho. <verse number="22" style="v" />Mna mta nguvu kumjinka aneza nakumtowa, ataha viziha vyakwe na ananavyo nakuvilavya viya abaile.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Yoyose hehamwenga namiye ahigana namiye, yoyose hekunambiza kuchisanya amwaganisa.</para>
  <para style="s">Kuya kwa Mpepo</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 12:43-45</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Mpepo nchafu ikamlawa mntu, yatamba mwe si nkavu ikalonda hantu hakuhumula. Uneva inalonda haiwone, yelongela, ‘Nanuye kwe nyumba yangu.’ <verse number="25" style="v" />Ivyo yauya nakubwila inyumba ihagilwa na kuhambwa. <verse number="26" style="v" />Akaheza yahalawa yakuguha mpepo ntuhu zihise mfungate kujinka yoyo yenye, niyo zeza nakwikala aho. Vyoseni vikaheza, yudya mntu nalumiswe kujinka ivyo neli aho nkongo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Chinyemi cha chindedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Yesu eze alonge vino, mvyele yumwenga alaila kulonga mwe diya idifyo nakumgamba, “Chinyemi chivivihi cha mvyele akweleke nakonkeza!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Mna Yesu ahitula, “Iviya, chinyemi chivivihi kwa wadya wakwiva mbuli ya Chohile nakuitimila!”</para>
  <para style="s">Kunga mpituko</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 12:38-42</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Umo wantu wamemile wamzunguluke Yesu, kajendeleza kulonga, “Wantu wa dyelo wana wihi wi vivihi! Waunga vilagiso, hawenkigwe yoyose mna mpituko ya Yona. <verse number="30" style="v" />Mwe ivyo kugamba muwoni Yona nani chilagiso kwa wantu wa Ninawi, ivyo Mwana ywa Mntu natende chilagiso kwa wantu wa dyelo. <verse number="31" style="v" />Mwe dizuwa dyo kukantila Seuta ywa chivyele ywa Sheba nachimale nakuwalaha wantu wa dyelo, kwaviya atambaga kulaila kwe isi yakwe kwita kwetegeleza milosi ya chimanyi ya Seuta Sulemani, naho nawagambilani hano hana mkulu kumjinka Solomoni. <verse number="32" style="v" />Mwe dizuwa dyo kukantilwa wantu wa Ninawi nawachimale hamwenga na wantu wa dyelo na kuwalahani, kwaviya weilaga masa yawo weze wamwive Yona akalonga, naho nawagambilani chindedi hano hana yudya mkulu kumjinka Yona!</para>
  <para style="s">Ulangazi wa mwili</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 5:15; 6:22-23</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“Hahana akuwasha taa niyo aifisa he ntangulu hegu kuika hasi hedivungu, Mawandiko matuhu hayana hegu kuika hasi hedivungu. Mna aika he chiya cha kwikiya taa, chani wantu wawone ulangazi umo wakengila. <verse number="34" style="v" />Meso yako yekala saviya taa kwachausa cho mwili. Uneva meso yako ni yedi, umwili mjima niwedi, mna hegu meso yako sayo yedi, umwili wako mjima nautende nachiza. <verse number="35" style="v" />Haluse, kaulisa kugamba ulangazi wi mwako unase kutenda chiza. <verse number="36" style="v" />Ivyo uneva umwili wako mjima niwedi, naung'aile mazuwa yoseni, saviya taa ikulangaza na ulangazi wakwe.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Akantila Mafalisayo na Wahinya Sigilizi</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 23:1-36; Mako 12:38-40</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Yesu eze akomeleze kulonga, Falisayo yumwenga amgonekaga akadye hamwenga naye, ivyo kengila nakwikala hasi kudya. <verse number="38" style="v" />Falisayo uyo nakehelwa eze awone kugamba Yesu hahakile henati kudya. <verse number="39" style="v" />Ivyo Zumbe amgamba, “Kaula, nyuwe Mafalisayo mwelengusa kuse mwe vyampa na sahani, mna mndani mwenyu mmema wihi na finju. <verse number="40" style="v" />Wahezi nyuwe! Suyo Chohile adamanye kuse naho nuyo adamanye mndani? <verse number="41" style="v" />Mna lavyani viya vimwevyampa vyenyu na sahani kwa wachiwa, chila chintu nachitende chilenguka kwachausa chenyu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />“Namluwone nyuwe Mafalisayo! Mwamlaviza Chohile fungu dya mlongo dya wabwanga vintu saviya nkande na chila mboga zesimile, mna mwabela wedi wa Chohile. Mbuli saizo nizo nendile mkaungwa mzitozese mkaleka kujala ntuhu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />“Namluwone nyuwe Mafalisayo! Mwaunga vigoda vikigwe koso mwe nyumba zo kuvikila nakulamswa kwa ntunyo mwa magwilo. <verse number="44" style="v" />Namluwone! Mwi saviya mbila hezikuwoneka na zikujendelwa ni wantu hewekuvimanya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Yumwenga mgati mwa wahinya Sigilizi amgamba, “Mhinyi, kwa kulonga ivyo, wachihuluta suwe naswi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Yesu ahitula, “Naho namluwone nyuwe wahinya Sigilizi! Mwaika mizigo mwe migongo ya wantu heikwinulika, mna nyuwe wenye hamchuluse kadole kuwambiza kwinula imizigo iyo. <verse number="47" style="v" />Namluwone! Mwadamanyiza wawoni mbila zedi wadya wawoni wakomigwe ni wadalahala wenyu. <verse number="48" style="v" />Nyuwe wenye mwaukula kugamba, kuzumila wababa zenyu, kwaviya wowo wawakomaga wadya wawoni, niyo mwazenga izimbila zawo. <verse number="49" style="v" />Kwachausa chino Umanyi wa Chohile wagamba, ‘Nanisigile kwenyu wawoni na wasigilwa, nawakome wamwenga mgati mwenyu nawawasulumize watuhu.’ <verse number="50" style="v" />Ivyo wantu wa chipindi chino nawakantilwe kwa ukomi wa wawoni woseni wakomagwa kukongela uumbi we isi, <verse number="51" style="v" />Kukongela ukomi wa Habili kubula ukomi wa Zakaliya, akomigwe hagati he Nyumba ya Chohile mwe nchanja yo kulaviza ntambiko na Hantu Hakukile. Chindedi nawagambilani, wantu wa chipindi chino nawakantilwe kwachausa cha woseni!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />“Namluwone wahinya Sigilizi! Mtoza dikomwelo dikuvugula ulwivi lwe nyumba yo umanyi, nyuwe wenye hamwingile mndani, naho mwahiga wadya wakujeza kwingila mndani!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Umo Yesu akahasa hadya hantu, wahinya Sigilizi na Mafalisayo wakonga kumvinya kwa usungu nakumuza mbuli zilozize, <verse number="54" style="v" />wakajeza kumtegela wamgwile akalonga chintu chihiye.</para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Mwiko kwa wasongaganyi</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 10:26-27</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Umo milongo mlongo ya wantu wamemile hamwenga kubula wajatana, Yesu niyo akonga kulonga na wanampina wakwe, “Msinyise mahinyo ya Mafalisayo kugamba ni wasongaganyi.” <verse number="2" style="v" />Hahana chintu chochose chifisigwe nachiswese kubunkulwa, naho hahana chinyele nachiswese kumanywa. <verse number="3" style="v" />Kwaivyo, chila mchilongile mwe chiza nachivike nomsi, naho mbuli zozose na mtakalisane mwi wenye mwe chumba nazimpwinkulwe namlonge kulaila kwedigulu.</para>
  <para style="s">Wakogohigwa</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 10:28-31</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Nawagambilani, wambuya zangu, msekuwogoha wadya wakudaha kukoma umwili mna hawakudaha kudamanya chochose chihise.” <verse number="5" style="v" />Naniwalagiseni yudya mkungwa mumogohe, mwogoheni Chohile, yudya, akaheza kukoma, nuyo mta udahi wa kumdula mntu kwe bome hedina uhelo. Chindedi nawagambilani, nuyo mkungwa mumogohe!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Togolani! Wadege washano hawakutagwa kwa matundu maidi? Naho hahana yumwenga akujalwa ni Chohile.” <verse number="7" style="v" />Mna hata fili zimwe mitwi yenyu ziwazwa. Elo msekogoha, nyuwe mna yombe kujinka wadege walozize!</para>
  <para style="s">Kumhitukila Chohile na kumlemela Yesu.</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 10:32-33; 12:32; 10:19-20</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Nawagambilani kugamba kwa wadya wakulonga mwa wantu kugamba we kwangu, Mwana ywa Mntu nawadamanyize ivyo mwa meso ya wandima wa kwembingu wa Chohile. <verse number="9" style="v" />Mna wadya wakunilemela mwa wantu, Mwana ywa Mntu nawalemele mwa meso ya wandima wa kwembingu wa Chohile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Mntu yoyose akusimwila vihiye mwa Mwana ywa Mntu adaha kulekeilwa, mna chila mntu akuhuluta Muye Ukukile halekeilwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Umo wakawegala mkalahwe mwe nyumba zo kuvikila hegu mwa meso ya wakulu we vilongozi, msekwogoha chiya mkunga mhitule hegu mkunga mlonge. <verse number="12" style="v" />Kwaviya Muye Ukukile nawahinye aho chiya mkunga mlonge.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mliganyo wa mgoli mhezi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mntu mwe difyo amgamba Yesu, “Mhinya, mgambile mlukolo ywangu chipangane ulisi chasizwe ni tatiyetu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Yesu amhitula, “Mbuyangu, niyani aninkile kulamula hegu kwinkiza ugoli mgati mwenyu nyuwe waidi?” <verse number="15" style="v" />Naho ajendeleza kuwagambila wose, “Mkaulise naho mwesinye wenye mwe chila tama ya ugoli, kwaviya wikazi wa chindedi wa mntu haukulawana na vintu ananavyo, hata akatenda na ugoli wi vivihi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Niyo Yesu awagambila mliganyo uno, “Hendaga na mntu yumwenga mgoli endaga na mgunda una ulozo utendese. <verse number="17" style="v" />Akonga kwefanyanya mwenye, ‘Sina hohose hakwika ulozo wangu wose. Nitende mbwani?’ <verse number="18" style="v" />Egamba mwenye, ‘vino nivyo nanidamanye,’ ‘Nanitule magulu yangu niyo nazenga matuhu makulu yatendese, umo nanike nkande yangu na vintu vituhu vyose. <verse number="19" style="v" />Niyo elongela mwenye, Mntu atendile mbafu! Una chila vintu vyedi vyose ukunga kwa mihilimo ilozize. Ikala wikazi wedi, dya, nywa, naho ubwede mwenye!’ <verse number="20" style="v" />Mna Chohile niyo amgamba, ‘Mhezi weye! Dyelo dino nechilo walavya ujima wako, haluse ni yuhi akunga aguhe vintu vino vyoseni weikiye?’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Yesu niyo akomeleza kugamba, “Vino nivyo vili kwa wose wakweikiya ugoli utendese mna sawo wagoli mwa meso ya Chohile.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mzumile Chohile</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 6:25-34</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Akaheza Yesu awagamba wanampina wakwe, “Nivyo vilekile huwagambani msekwehelwa mwe nkande mkunga iwenkeni ujima hegu mwe suche mkunga kwachausa che mili yenyu. <verse number="23" style="v" />Ujima ni wedi kujinka nkande, na mwili nawo waungiswa kujinka suche. <verse number="24" style="v" />Kaulani wadege hawakuhanda hegu hawakuvuna, hawana magulu hegu vihenge, Chohile awalisa! Nyuwe mwawagila vidala kujinka wadege! <verse number="25" style="v" />Niyuhi mgati mwenyu akudaha kweongezeza hata zuwa dimwenga kujinka chipindi cho wikazi wakwe? <verse number="26" style="v" />Uneva hamkudaha kudamanya chintu chidodo enga chino, ni mbwani una nkama na vintu vituhu? <verse number="27" style="v" />Kaula maluwa ya kumbago ivyo yakusuka, hayakudamanya ndima hegu kwesumila suche. Mna nawagambilani kugamba hata Zumbe Sulemani na ugoli wakwe woseni hendaga na suche ntana saviya yano maluwa. <verse number="28" style="v" />Ni Chohile akuvisa mani ya kumbago mani yakutenda hano dyelo nakwaga luvi, yakokwa mwe moto. Hatendese na ukanuni wakuwavisa? Ujeche wani wa uzumizi mnanawo!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Elo msekwehanganya, chila nkanana mfanyanye chiya namdye na kunywa. <verse number="30" style="v" />Kwaviya wantu sawo Wayahudi mno mwe isi nawo wakulonda vintu vyoseni ivyo. Tati yenyu kavimanya kugamba mwavyunga vintu ivyo.” <verse number="31" style="v" />Mna, mwevinye no Useuta wakwe, naye nawenkeni vino vintu.</para>
  <para style="s">Ugoli wi kwembingu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 6:19-21</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“Msekogoha, nyuwe bunga dodo, kwaviya Tati yenyu kelelwa kuwenka Useuta.” <verse number="33" style="v" />Tagani vintu vyenyu vyose na muwenke wachiwa izihela. Kweikiyeni hela hezikusakala, naho mweikiye ugoli wenyu kwembingu, kudya hekudaha kuhunguka, kwaviya hakuna mbavi akudaha kuubwila, na matele hayakudaha kuubalanga. <verse number="34" style="v" />Kwaviya myoyo yenyu chila nkanana naitende kudya ugoli wenyu wili.</para>
  <para style="s">Wandima wakanuni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />“Mwikale enga wandima wakumgoja mkulu ywawo kwa ntendwa hamwenga na taa zenyu zikaka, <verse number="36" style="v" />mtende saviya wandima wakumgoja mkulu ywawo auye kulaila kwembwedo wa nyinka. Umo akeza nakugong'onda ulwivi, nawamvugwile aho.” <verse number="37" style="v" />Chinyemi chivivihi kwa wadya wandima wakunga wabwilwe ni mkulu ywawo wakacheleza chipindi akuwiya! Nawagambilani chindedi, nahambule suche yakwe, awaunge wekale hasi wadye nkande, na kuwasankanila. <verse number="38" style="v" />Nawatende na chinyemi wandima wadya nawabwile wakacheleza kubula nechilogati hegu nyumani mwe saa idya! <verse number="39" style="v" />Naho mvimanya kugamba hegu mta nyumba anamanya muda akwizila mbavi, hamlekele avune nakwingila mnyumba.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />“Nyuwe, nanywi, mwaungwa mwemalanye, kwaviya Mwana ywa Mntu neze mwe chipindi hemwikuifanyanya.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mndima mchindedi na suyo mchindedi</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 24:45-51</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Petulo agamba, “Zumbe, mliganyo uno ni wetu suwe, hegu ni kwa chila yumwenga?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Zumbe ahitula, “Ni yuhi, naho, mzumizi na mmanyi na msankani? Ni yudya aikigwe ni mkulu ywakwe achimaile weyawe, na kumlagiza awenke nkande mwe chipindi chikigwe.” <verse number="43" style="v" />Mndima uyo natende na chinyemi chivivihi hegu zumbe dyakwe anambwila akadamanya vino umo akauya kukaya! <verse number="44" style="v" />Chindedi, nawagambilani, mkulu namtende mndima uyo achimaile vintu vyakwe vyose. <verse number="45" style="v" />Mna hegu mndima uyo akelongela mo moyo kugamba mkulu ywakwe akawa kuya niyo akonga kuwatowa wandima watuhu, wagosi na wavyele, na kudya na kunywa nakukolwa, <verse number="46" style="v" />ivyo mkulu ywo mndima uyo neze mwe zuwa hemanyize na saa heimanyize. Naho namtowe enga wantu sawo wazumizi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />“Mndima akumanya chiya mkulu ywakwe akunga adamanyizwe, mna hakwemalanya kuchidamanya, na asulumizwe kwa kutoigiswa. <verse number="48" style="v" />Mna yudya mndima hemanyize mbuli hekunga mkulu ywakwe, na akudamanya mbuli zikuwagila nkanto, natoigwe nkome njeche. Kwaviya chila mntu enkigwe vilozise, naho enkigwe ukulu utendese nauzwe vitendese.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nkongelo ya kwenegana</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 10:34-36</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />“Siza kuchulika moto isi, nasivyungisa vyatendile uchuikwa kale! <verse number="50" style="v" />Nina ubatizo wa kuhokela, nkunto yani ninanayo kubula uchinte! <verse number="51" style="v" />Mwafanyanya kugamba nasiza kwigala utondowazi mwe si? Sivyo ivyo, siyo utondowazi, mna mwenegano. <verse number="52" style="v" />Kukongela haluse wantu washano wa lukolo lumwenga nawenegane, watatu nawahigane na waidi na wahigane na watatu. <verse number="53" style="v" />Watate nawahigane na wanawawo, wana nawo na watati zawo, wavyele nawahigane na wanachiche wawo, na wanachiche mwe mamizawo, wakwe wa chivyele nawahigane na wakaza wana wawo, wakaza wana nawo mwe wakwe zawo wa chivyele.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kukombaganya chipindi</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 16:2-3</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Yesu alonga naho kwa wantu, “Umo mkawona ingu kulaila ntendele za mwingilo wa zuwa, aho mwalonga kugamba fula yaunga inye naho yavitenda. <verse number="55" style="v" />Naho umo mkeva mpeho ikavumila, mwalonga kugamba kwatenda na chivuguto naho chalaila. <verse number="56" style="v" />Nyuwe wasongaganyi! Mmanya kubunkula ivyo isi ili no ulanga, nimbwani hamkudaha kubunkula chipindi cha haluse?</para>
  <para style="s">Mwivane na mlemanyi ywako</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 5:25-26</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />“Nimbwani nyuwe wenye hamkwelamwila wedi? <verse number="58" style="v" />Uneva ukaita kwe chitala na mlahi ywako, mwivane mwe isila hemnati kubula kwechitala. Hegu sivyo nakwigale kwe chitala mkanti, akunga awenke wankondo, naho namjelwe mndani. <verse number="59" style="v" />Uko nawikale, nawagambilani, mkabula kuliha hela ya udumo kwa maliho yenyu ya malaho.”</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Lekani Masa yenyu na Mbanike</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chipindi icho wantu wamwenga nawehadya wamgambilaga Yesu mbuli za Wagalilaya wakomagwa ni Pilato umo nawakachinja wanyama chani walavye ntambiko zawo kwa Chohile. <verse number="2" style="v" />Yesu niyo awagamba, “Mwafanyanya kugamba Wagalilaya awo wendaga na masa yatendese kujinka watuhu, hambwe kwaviya wasulumizwa saivyo? <verse number="3" style="v" />Ichindedi sivyo ivyo! Naho nawagambilani kugamba hegu hamnaeile masa yenyu, nyoseni nambanike saviya wabanike. <verse number="4" style="v" />Hegu mwafanyanya kugamba wadya wantu mlongo na mnane wagwelagwa nu mnala kudya ko mzi wa Silowamu niyo wabanika wana masa kujinka wekazi wose nawakekala Yelusalemu? <verse number="5" style="v" />Ichindedi sivyo ivyo! Naho nawagambilani kugamba hamneile masa yenyu, nyose nambanike saviya wabanike.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mliganyo wa mtini hewina hokweleka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Yesu niyo awasimwila mliganyo uno, “Hendaga na mntu yumwenga mta mti wa mtini mwe nkonde yakwe. Mntu uyo aitaga chani akazungule tini mo mtini uwo, mna niyo aubwila mti uwo haweleke hata ntunda dimwenga. <verse number="7" style="v" />Niyo amgamba yudya msinya inkonde, ‘Kaula! Ni mihilimo mitatu neza hano kuzungula tini mo mtini uno, mna silondole chochose. Ukante! Nimbwani ukujendeleza kujeseza isanga vya bule?’ <verse number="8" style="v" />Mna yudya msinyi wo mgunda ahitula, ‘Zumbe, ndakuuleka, ujinke mhilimo umwenga, naniuhaile nakuujeila mboleya. <verse number="9" style="v" />Hegu uneva uneleka mhilimo ukutimila, navitende vyedi vidala, hegu sivyo ivyo, wadaha kuukanta.’ ”</para>
  <para style="s">Mvyele mta mpepo ahonywa mwe Zuwa dya kuhumula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zuwa dimwenga dya kuhumula Yesu na kahinya mwe nyumba yo kuvikila. <verse number="11" style="v" />Mvyele yumwenga endaga mnyonje, engilagwa ni mpepo zihiye kwa chipindi cha mihilimo mlongo na mnane, mgongo wakwe wendaga uhinda hakudaha kuchuluka. <verse number="12" style="v" />Yesu eze amwone niyo amwitanga, “Mnala, kuhonywa unyonje wako!” <verse number="13" style="v" />Amwikiya mikono yakwe, ahadya echulusa mwenye na kumtunya Chohile.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mkulu ywe nyumba yo kuvikila kehiwa kwaviya Yesu kahonya mwe Zuwa dya kuhumula, ivyo alonga kwa wantu, “Kuna mazuwa mtandatu yakudamanya ndima, ivyo wize mwe mazuwa ayo chani uhonywe, siyo mwe Zuwa dya kuhumula!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Zumbe amhitula, “Nyuwe wasongaganyi! Chila yumwenga ywenyu mwe Zuwa dya kuhumula hakukomweila njeku yakwe au mpunda kulaila mwe didewa na kuigala ko kuinywesa mazi? <verse number="16" style="v" />Haluse mwelekwa yuno ywa Bulahimu nuyo avugailagwa ni Shetani kwa mihilimo mlongo na mine, hakungigwa alekeilwe chifungo chakwe mwe Zuwa dya kuhumula?” <verse number="17" style="v" />Hitulo dyakwe ditenda wahigani wakwe wahuze, mna wantu watuhu niyo welelwa mwe mbuli zose zikwehela adamanye.</para>
  <para style="s">Mliganyo wa Mbeyu ya Haladali</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 13:31-32; Mako 4:30-32</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Yesu kauza, “Useuta wa Chohile wi savihi? Nadaha kuuliganya na mbwani? <verse number="19" style="v" />Wikala savino. Mntu aguha mbeyu nddo ikwitangwa haladali nakuihanda mwe nkonde yakwe. Yakula na kutenda mti, na wadege wo ulanga wazenga masasa mwa matambi yakwe.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mliganyo wa Hamila</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 13:33</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Yesu kauza naho, “Useuta wa Chohile naniuliganye na mbwani? <verse number="21" style="v" />Wekala savino. Mvyele aguha hamila njeche na kuihanganya na madebe maidi na nusu ukajika unga wose niyo wagwaduka.”</para>
  <para style="s">Lwivi lufinyu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 7:13-14, 21-23</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Yesu niyo ajendeleza na ntambo yakwe kwita Yelusalemu, kajinkila kwe mizi na kaya, akahinya wantu Mbuli Yedi. <verse number="23" style="v" />Yumwenga kamwuza, “Zumbe, nawahonywe wantu wajeche du?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kawahitula, <verse number="24" style="v" />“Damanyani viya mkudaha kwingila mwe lwivi lufinyu, kwaviya wantu walozize nawajeze kwingila mna hawadahe. <verse number="25" style="v" />Mkulu ywa nyumba nenuke nakuvugala ulwivi, niyo umo mkachimala kuse nakukonga kulonga mo ulwivi nakugamba, ‘Zumbe chivugwile ulwivi!’ Nawahituleni, ‘Sivimanyize mwalawahi!’ <verse number="26" style="v" />Niyo mwahitula, ‘Chidya na kunywa hamwenga na nyuwe kuhinya mo mzi wetu!’ <verse number="27" style="v" />Mna nagambe naho, ‘Simanyize uko mkulaila. Halaweni hangu, nyuwe wose mkudamanya yehiye!’ <verse number="28" style="v" />Namwile vivihi nakusigina meno yenyu umo mkamwona Bulahimu, Isaka na Yakobo na wawoni woseni mo Useuta wa Chohile, umo nyuwe mduligwe kuse! <verse number="29" style="v" />Wantu na weze kulaila ulailo wa zuwa na uswelo wa zuwa, na kulaila kwa mwenye mzi na chibula, nakwikala he ngasu mo Useuta wa Chohile. <verse number="30" style="v" />Niyo wadya we waudumo haluse nawatende wankongo, na wadya wankongo haluse nawatende wa udumo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ayunga Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 23:37-39</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mwe chipindi icho Mafalisayo wamwenga weza kwa Yesu na kumgamba, “Waungwa uhalawe hano wite hantu hatuhu, kwaviya Helode aunga akukome.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Yesu awahitula, “Hitani mkadigambe diya uzi, ‘Nagulusa mpepo nakuhonya dyelo na luvi, mwe dizuwa dya katatu nanibindilize ndima yangu.’ <verse number="33" style="v" />Havinati naungwa nitende mwe sila dyelo, luvi, nachisindo siyo vyedi kwa muwoni kukomwa hatuhu mna Yelusalemu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Yelusalemu, Yelusalemu! Weye ukuwakoma wawoni na wasigilwe ni Chohile kwenyu kwa kuwaduila mayuwe! Nkanana zilozize nasunga niwachisanye wekazi wako saviya nguku akufugasila wanawe hasi mwa mawawa yakwe, mna nyuwe hamnungile! <verse number="35" style="v" />Na kwaivyo Nyumba yenyu nkulu ya kuvikila nailekwe. Nawagambilani kugamba hamniwone naho kubula umo namgambe, ‘Kajimbikwa uyo akwiza kwa zina dya Zumbe.’ ”</para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Yesu Ahonya Mntu Mnyonje</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zuwa dimwenga dya kuhumula Yesu nakaita kudya nkande mwe nyumba ya chilongozi yumwenga ywa Mafalisayo, wantu nawo nawakamsinya Yesu kwa hajihi. <verse number="2" style="v" />Mntu yumwenga mta viga na mikono ivimbile kamwizila Yesu, <verse number="3" style="v" />Yesu naye awauza wahinya Sigilizi na Mafalisayo, “Sigilizi yaunga kuhonya mwe Zuwa dya kuhumula hegu bule?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mna wowo niyo wanyamala. Yesu niyo amtoza uyo umnyonje na kumhonya, amleka aite zakwe. <verse number="5" style="v" />Niyo awagamba, “Uneva yoyose yumwenga ywenyu mta mwana hegu njeku igwele mwe bome mwe Zuwa dya kuhumula, hamvilavye aho mwe Zuwa dya kuhumula?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mna hawadahile kumhitula mwe vino.</para>
  <para style="s">Untu na Wikazi wedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Yesu nakabunkula viya wajeni wamwenga nawakasagula hantu hedi, ivyo kawagambila woseni umliganyo uno. <verse number="8" style="v" />“Umo yumwenga anakugoneke kwe nyinka, usekwikala hantu hedi. Vyadahika kagonekwa yumwenga wa awagile kujinka weye, <verse number="9" style="v" />mkaya wako, awagoneke woseni waidi, neze nakulonga kwenyu, ‘Mlekeni ekale hano.’ Niyo nawingile soni nakwikala hantu hasi. <verse number="10" style="v" />Mna, ukagonekwa, jenda ukekale hantu hasi, chani mkaya ywako akeza kulonga kwako, ‘Mbuyangu, so hantu hedi,’ Ino naikwinke ntunyo mwa wajeni woseni. <verse number="11" style="v" />Kwa wadya woseni wakwetenda wakulu nawaselezwe, na wadya wakweseleza nawatendwe wakulu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Niyo Yesu amgamba mkaya ywakwe, “Ukalavya nkande ya msi hegu ya chisingi, usekugoneka mbuyazo hegu walukolo wako wakwelekwa hegu wehaguhi wagoli kwaviya nawakugoneke, usekunga kulihwa kwa chiya udamanye. <verse number="13" style="v" />Ukadamanya ngasu, wagoneke wachiwa, vilema na waholomale na mantuntu, <verse number="14" style="v" />naujimbikwe, kwaviya hawadahe kukuliha. Chohile nawalihe mwe zuwa dya uyuso kwa wantu wedi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mliganyo wa Ngasu Nkulu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 22:1-10</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Yumwenga mwa wadya wekale mwe meza eze eve vino, amgamba Yesu, “Chinyemi chivivihi kwa wekale he ngasu mo Useuta wa Chohile!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Yesu amgamba, “Kwendaga na mntu yumwenga nana ngasu nkulu niyo agonekaga wantu walozize. <verse number="17" style="v" />Chipindi che ngasu chizechibule, kasigila wandima wakwe kugambila wajeni wakwe, ‘Soni, chila chintu chajika!’ <verse number="18" style="v" />Mna woseni wakonga kulavya uzulu yumwenga kutimila mtuhu. Wankongo kamgamba uyo mndima, ‘Sigula mgunda naungwa nite haukaule, hake netegeleza.’ <verse number="19" style="v" />Mtuhu agamba, ‘Sigula jozi shano za njeku ivyo nimwesila kwita hazijeze, hake netegeleza.’ <verse number="20" style="v" />Mtuhu agamba, ‘Nivyo silawa mwe kusola, kwa ivyo sikudaha kwiza.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Yudya mndima niyo auya nakumgambila zumbe dyakwe yoseni yano. Zumbe kehiwa nakumgamba mndima ywakwe, ‘Guluka wite kwe zisila nkulu na ndodo zo umzi, walete wachiwa na vilema na mantuntu na waholomale.’ <verse number="22" style="v" />Aho mndima agamba, ‘Zumbe, viya ungile vidamanyika kale, mna hechei na hantu ha kwikala.’ <verse number="23" style="v" />Ivyo zumbe amgamba mndima, ‘Jenda wite kwe zisila nkulu na ndodo ze isi uwalete wantu, chani nyumba yangu imeme. <verse number="24" style="v" />Nawagambilani kugamba hamna hata yumwenga mwe wadya wagonekwe nalume nkande yangu ya chisingi!’ ”</para>
  <para style="s">Maliho ya kutenda Mwanampina</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 10:37-38</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Aho mafyo makulu ya wantu nayakatimilizana na Yesu, kahituka nakuwagamba, <verse number="26" style="v" />“Wadya wakwiza kwangu hawakudaha kutenda wanampina wangu hegu wakanungisa miye kujinka tati zawo na mami zawo, mvyele na wanawe, walukolo wawo na walumbu zawo, na kujinka ujima wawo wenye. <verse number="27" style="v" />Wadya hewekwinula misalaba yawo wenye na kunitimila hawakudaha kutenda wanampina wangu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Uneva yumwenga ywenyu afanyanya kuzenga mnala, wakonga kwikala hasi nakukaula kugamba wonga uzengwe kwa yombe dyani, kukaula hegu una hela ya kuchinta kubindiliza indima iyo. <verse number="29" style="v" />Huna vitendile ivyo, haudahe kukomeleza umnala uwo ukaheza kuzenga msingi, woseni wakuwona chilaile nawakuseke. <verse number="30" style="v" />Nawagambe, ‘Yuno mntu kakonga kuzenga mna hakudaha kubindiliza indima!’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Uneva Seuta yumwenga anafosa na wantu mlongo magana mlongo kutowana na seuta mtuhu akwiza na wantu milongo midi magana mlongo, nandekwikala hasi nakukaula hegu ana udahi wa kudaha kuhigana na zumbe mtuhu uyo. <verse number="32" style="v" />Hegu hakudaha, nasigile wantu kudugana na zumbe uyo, kulombeza utondowazi umo yeye achei hale. <verse number="33" style="v" />Mwe ivyo,” Yesu akomeleza, “Hahana yumwenga mwenyu akudaha kutenda mwanampina ywangu uneva hana lekile chila chintu ananacho.</para>
  <para style="s">Munyu Ubanike</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 5:13; Mako 9:50</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Munyu ni wedi, mna hegu unaza umunyu wakwe, hakuna sila yakuvuza umunyu wakwe naho. <verse number="35" style="v" />Suwo wedi kwa ulongo hegu zala, wadulwa. Tegelezani, hegu mna magutwi!”</para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Ngoto yagile</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 18:12-14</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zuwa dimwenga umo wachisanya kodi na wata masa watuhu weza kumwetegeleza Yesu, <verse number="2" style="v" />Mafalisayo na wahinya Sigilizi wakonga kung'ung'uzika, “Yuno mntu ahokela wata masa naho adya hamwenga nawo!” <verse number="3" style="v" />Ivyo Yesu awagambila mliganyo uno.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Fanyanya yumwenga mwenyu ana ngoto gana niyo imwenga mwe izo yaga natende mbwani? Wasa ntuhu mlongo chenda na chenda zikadya nakwita ukalonde iyo imwenga yagile kubula aho nailondole. <verse number="5" style="v" />Unailondola, watenda na chinyemi nakwihagata mayega yako, <verse number="6" style="v" />nakuivuza kukaya. Niyo wetanga wambwiyazo na wajihi wako hamwenga na kuwagamba, ‘Nina chinyemi vidala silondola ngoto yangu yagaga. Nachivineni!’ <verse number="7" style="v" />Mwe ivyo, nawagambilani, nakutende na chinyemi vidala kwembingu mwe mta masa yumwenga akweila masa kujinka wantu milongo chenda na chenda wakuwoneka wedi kulongozi kwa Chohile.</para>
  <para style="s">Tundu dyagile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Hegu fanyanya mvyele mta matundu mlongo ya hela aza dimwenga mwe ayo natende mbwani? Awasha taa, ahagila nyumba yakwe, nakusinyisa chila hantu kubula aho nadilondole. <verse number="9" style="v" />Anadilondola, etanga wambuya zakwe na wajihi wakwe hamwenga, nakuwagamba, ‘Nina chinyemi vidala silondola tundu dyangu dyagaga. Nachivineni!’ <verse number="10" style="v" />Mwe ivyo, nawagambilani, wandima wa kwembingu wa Chohile watenda na chinyemi mwe yumwenga akweila masa yakwe.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mwana Agile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Yesu ajendeleza kulonga, “Kwendaga na mntu mta wana waidi. <verse number="12" style="v" />Umdodo amgamba, ‘Tate, ninka hantu ho ugoli wangu haluse.’ Ivyo yudya mntu enkiza vintu vyakwe mwa wanawe waidi. <verse number="13" style="v" />Mazuwa majeche yeze yakajinke mwana umdodo niyo ataga ntendele ya ugoli wakwe nakuhalawa hanyumba na hela. Kaita kwe si ya hale, uko kajeseza hela zakwe mwe wikazi wihiye. <verse number="14" style="v" />Kajeseza chila chintu nananacho. Niyo kwengila gumbo kulu mwe si yose, naye kasigwa hena chintu. <verse number="15" style="v" />Ivyo aita kwa mkaya yumwenga mwe isi iyo kwe kudamanya ndima, amwigale kwe nkonde yakwe akalise nguluwe. <verse number="16" style="v" />Nakaunga hegu nakadaha kudya mwe zae dye zinguluwe, mna hahana amwinkile chochose cha kudya. <verse number="17" style="v" />Ko udumo ezilwa ni fanyanyi na kugamba, ‘Wandima woseni wa tate wana chimemile cha kudya, miye hano nonga kukomwa nisala! <verse number="18" style="v" />Nanihalawe na kwita kwa tate nakumgamba, Tate, sidamanya masa kwembingu na kwa Chohile hamwenga na weye. <verse number="19" style="v" />Sikuwagila kwitangwa mwanawo, nitenda saviya yumwenga ywa wandima wako.’ <verse number="20" style="v" />Ivyo achimala nakukonga ntambo kuya kwa tati yakwe.</para>
  <para style="p">“Nachei hale kulaila kukaya umo tati yakwe amwone, moyo wakwe naumema mbazi, niyo aguluka, edula mwe mikono yakwe kumzunguluka mwanawe nakumsesa. <verse number="21" style="v" />Yudya mwana agamba, ‘Tate,’ ‘Sidamanya masa kwa Chohile hamwenga na weye na kwembingu. Sikuwagila kwitangwa mwanawo.’ <verse number="22" style="v" />Mna tati yamntu ketanga wandima wakwe. Agamba, ‘Sunguzani!’. ‘Igalani suche yedi vidala mumvise. Mviseni mpete mwa kadole kakwe na vilatu mwe viga vyakwe. <verse number="23" style="v" />Mkaheza mwite mkaguhe ndama idamane mchinje, chivineni ngasu! <verse number="24" style="v" />Kwaviya yuno mwanangu nakabanika, mna haluse ni mjima, nakaga, mna haluse kalondoka.’ Aho ngasu yakonga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Mwe chipindi icho mwana ywa yudya mdalahala nekwenkonde. Umo emwe sila akauya, eze abule hajihi na hakaya, eva nchelejele na ngoma. <verse number="26" style="v" />Ivyo etanga yumwenga mwa wandima nakumuza, ‘Ni chibwani chikujendeleza?’ <verse number="27" style="v" />Yudya mndima ahitula, ‘Mlukolo ywako kauya kukaya, tati yako naye kachinja ndama idamane, kwaviya kamhokela emjima.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Yudya mwana umkulu nakehelwa vidala vilekile hengile kunyumba, ivyo tati yakwe afosa na kumlombeza engile. <verse number="29" style="v" />Mna kamhitula tati yakwe, ‘Kaula, mihilimo ino yoseni sikusankanila enga mtumwa, naho salemelaga lagizo dyako. Kuninka mbwani? Hata mbuzi hadamanye ngasu na wambuya zangu! <verse number="30" style="v" />Mna mwanawo yuno kaza ugoli wako kwa uchilanga, naho eze auye kaya, wamchinjiza ndama idamane!’ <verse number="31" style="v" />Tati yamntu ahitula, ‘Mwanangu, wi hano mazuwa yose hamwenga na miye, chila chintu ninanacho ni chako. <verse number="32" style="v" />Mna chaungwa chidamanye ngasu naho chitende na chinyemi, kwaviya mlukolo ywako nakabanika, mna haluse ni mjima nakaga, mna haluse kalondoka.’ ”</para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Mliganyo wa Mchimaila ugoli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Yesu niyo awagamba wanampina wakwe mliganyo uno, “Kwendaga na mgoli yumwenga endaga akachimaila ugoli wakwe. Yudya mchimaila niyo alongelezwa kwa mkulu ywakwe kugamba abalanga ugoli wa mkulu ywakwe, <verse number="2" style="v" />Akaheza mkulu ywakwe amwitanga niyo amgamba, ‘Ni mbuli zani nizivile kulawana na weye? Lavya mahokelo yose yo ugoli wangu kulawana na viya wingize na viya vifosize, naho hukudaha kutenda mchimaila ywangu naho.’ <verse number="3" style="v" />Yudya mchimaila niyo elongela mwenye kugamba, ‘Zumbe dyangu aunga anilavye mo chimaila ugoli. Na nitende mbwani? Kulima sikudaha, naho kwita kwe kulombeza enga mchiwa nawona soni. <verse number="4" style="v" />Haluse simanya dyo kudamanya, chani umwo habalazwa mo uchimaila wantu wadahe kunihokela kwe zikaya zawo.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Niyo awetanga wadya wose wakutigizwa ni mkulu ywakwe. Kamuza ywa nkongo, ‘Watigizwa chiyasi chani ni mkulu ywangu?’ <verse number="6" style="v" />Niyo amhitula, ‘Mavuta ya nyonyo mapila gana,’ yudya mchimaila ugoli niyo amgamba. ‘Guha ibaluwa yako ye ntigizo,’ mkulu amgamba, ‘ikala hasi uwandike watigizwa mapila milongo mishano.’ <verse number="7" style="v" />Akaheza amwuza mtigizwa mtuhu, ‘Weye watigizwa chiyasi chani?’ Niyo amhitula, ‘Majuniya gana ya ngano,’ yudya mchimaila niyo amgamba. ‘Guha ibaluwa yako ya ivyo mwivane,’ ‘Uwandike milongo mnane.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Mna mkulu ywakwe niyo amtogola yudya mchimaila ugoli kwaviya adamanye kwa umanyi, kwa viya wantu wa mwe isi ino ni wabala vitendese kujinka wantu wakunga kwikala mo ng'azi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Yesu niyo ongezeza kugamba, “Nami nawagambilani, jesezani ugoli we isi ino kwa kutenda na wambuya, chani ugoli uwo ukasila, mhokelwe mo wikazi wa ujima wa mazuwa yose. <verse number="10" style="v" />Mntu yeyose akunga atende mzumizi mwe mbuli ndodo naatende mzumizi mwe mbuli nkulu, na mntu yoyose yudya hatende mzumizi mwe mbuli ndodo, hakudaha kutenda mzumizi mwe mbuli nkulu. <verse number="11" style="v" />Hegu nyuwe sawo wazumizi mwe ugoli we isi ni yuhi akunga awenkeni ukanuni na kuwatunyani mwe ugoli wa chindedi? <verse number="12" style="v" />Hegu hwimkanuni na ugoli wa mntu mtuhu kwa uzumizi, ni yuhi akunga awenkeni ugoli wenyu we ichedu?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Hahana mndima akudaha kusankanila wakulu waidi, kwa viya na mwihiwe yumwenga na kumungisa mtuhu. Hamkudaha kumsankanila Chohile no ugoli.”</para>
  <para style="s">Milosi yesimile ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 11:12-13; 5:31-32; Mako 10:11-12</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mna mafalisayo weze weve ayo yose, kwa viya wowo na wakaungisa hela niyo wamona Yesu hakuwagila chintu. <verse number="15" style="v" />Yesu niyo awagamba, “Nyuwe mwi wantu mkwetenda kugamba mwawoneka wedi kulongozi kwa wantu, mna Chohile kamanya ye mwe myoyo yenyu. Kwaviya yakutogolwa ni wantu ni maihizo kulongozi kwa Chohile.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Sigilizi ya Musa na mawandiko ya wawoni yalongwa kubula kwiza kwa Yohana, kukongela chipindi icho Mbuli Yedi ya Useuta wa Chohile yalongwa, naho chila mntu engiza kwa nguvu mo useuta uwo.” <verse number="17" style="v" />Mna ni vihufu vitendese imbingu ne isi kujinka, ukaleka kubula helufi imwenga ya Sigilizi yuswe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Mntu yoyose akumwasa mkaziwe niyo asola mntu agonya, yoyose nasole mvyele asigwe agonya.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mgoli na Lazalo Mchiwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Hendaga na mntu yumwenga mgoli vidala, na akavala suche zina langi ya zambalau na chitani zina yombe kulu na kudamanya ngasu chila zuwa.” <verse number="20" style="v" />Naho nahana mchiwa yumwenga akwitangwa Lazalo, mchiwa uyo naana nkwenje mwili mjima wantu na wakamgoneza ho lwivi lwe nyumba ya yudya mgoli. <verse number="21" style="v" />Yudya mchiwa na akaungisa adye nkande ikulagala mnanga mwe imeza hadya akudila yudya mgoli, naho makuli na yakeza yakamlambita mwezi nkwenje ahadya agonile.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Yudya mchiwa niyo abanika, wandima wa kwembingu niyo wamguha wakwikala naye haguhi na Bulahimu.” Yudya mgoli naye niyo abanika, niyo ahambwa, <verse number="23" style="v" />Elo, kudya kwedibome hedina uhelo akasulumizwa niyo asinya kulanga niyo amwona Bulahimu, kwa luhale, na Lazalo akatenda ehankanda hakwe. <verse number="24" style="v" />Elo niyo etanga kwa izwi nkulu, Tate Bulahimu! Nifila mbazi, naho mgambe Lazalo atweze akadole kakwe mwa mazi anitwekeze hata twentwe dimwenga mo lulimi lwangu, kwaviya nasulumila vidala mo umoto uno!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Mna Bulahimu niyo amhitula, ‘Kumbuka, mwanangu, kugamba mo wikazi wako mwe isi wenkagwa yedi, Lazalo niyo ahokela yehiye.’ Haluse Lazalo atondowazwa, weye wasulumizwa.” <verse number="26" style="v" />Ukaleka ayo, mgati mwenyu na suwe hana bome kulu, chani wakunga kwiza kwenyu kulaila kuno wasekudaha, na wauko wasekudaha kwiza kuno. <verse number="27" style="v" />Yudya mgoli agamba, Elo, nakulombeza weye, tate Bulahimu, msigile Lazalo aite kwe nyumba ya tate, <verse number="28" style="v" />Kwaviya nina walukolo washano. Chani awagambe wanase kwiza kuno kwa masulumizo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Bulahimu niyo amgamba, ‘Walukolo wako wana mawandiko ya Musa na ya wawoni ya kuwafunda, waleke wayategeleze.’ <verse number="30" style="v" />Mna yudya mgoli niyo agamba, ‘siyo ivyo, tate Bulahimu! Mna uneva mntu yumwenga anauyuka nakuwabasa, naweile kulaila mwa masa yawo.’ <verse number="31" style="v" />Mna Bulahimu niyo amhitula, ‘Uneva hawanawevile Musa na wawoni, hata anauyuka mntu anawabasa hawamwive.’ ”</para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Masa</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 18:6-7, 21-22; Mako 9:42</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Yesu niyo awagamba wanampina wakwe, “Vintu naviwahose wantu vyaungwa vilaile, mna namanye mwenye mntu yudya akunga avitende vilaile! <verse number="2" style="v" />Na vita vyedi mntu uyo atalizwe yuwe kulu dya kusigintila mwe singo akadulwe mwe bahali ukaleka akahosa yumwenga ywa wadodo wano wakole masa.” <verse number="3" style="v" />Kwaivyo mwedime vyedi!</para>
  <para style="p">Uneva mlukolo ywako anakola masa, mkwahile, na uneva aneila, mlekeile. <verse number="4" style="v" />“Uneva ana kola masa nkanana mfungate kwa zuwa, na chila nkanana auya kwako akagamba ‘neila kwako,’ mlekeile.”</para>
  <para style="s">Uzumizi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Wasigilwa niyo wamgamba Zumbe, “Chongezeze uzumizi wetu.” <verse number="6" style="v" />Zumbe niyo ahitula, “Uneva mna uzumizi saviya kapuluzi ka mbeyu ikwitangwa haladali, na mkadaha kuugamba umti uno wo mkuyu, ‘Ng'oka na ukehande mwe bahali!’ Nawo na uweveni.”</para>
  <para style="s">Vikungwa mndima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Chigambe kwa mliganyo yumwenga ywenyu ana mndima ywakwe akulima kwe nkonde hegu akudima ngoto, togolani akauya kulaila kwe nkonde, namumgambe uyo mndima sunguza so udye nkande? <verse number="8" style="v" />Bule! Mna, namgambe, ‘nikiya nkande, naho wikale ahano kubula nibinde ukudya na kunywa, vikaheza wenawe nivyo na udye.’ <verse number="9" style="v" />Togola, haumtogole uyo mndima kwa viya kadamanya yadya malagizo, bule? <verse number="10" style="v" />Nivyo vili kwenyu nyuwe, uneva mdamanya yadya yose mgambigwe mdamanye, gambani, ‘Suwe chiwandima du, chibinda yadya chungigwe chidamanye.’ ”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahonya wadya wantu mlongo wata matana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Umo Yesu nemwe ntambo ya kwita Yelusalemu, nakajinka mwe mihaka ya Samaliya na Galilaya. <verse number="12" style="v" />Umo akengila mwe kaya imwenga niyo adugana na wantu mlongo wata matana. Wachimala kwa luhale, <verse number="13" style="v" />waguta wakagamba, “Yesu! Zumbe! Chifile mbazi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Yesu eze awawone niyo awagamba, “Hitani kwa walavyantambiko mkelagise chani wawakauleni.”</para>
  <para style="p">Mwesila wakajenda niyo walenguswa. <verse number="15" style="v" />Yumwenga ywawo eze awone kahonywa, niyo auya, kuno akamtunya Chohile kwa izwi kulu. <verse number="16" style="v" />Niyo amfikila madi Yesu kuno akamtunya. Uyo mntu nani Mfambazi. <verse number="17" style="v" />Aho Yesu agamba, “wantu walenguswe hawendile mlongo, awatuhu wekuhi? <verse number="18" style="v" />Hawoneke mtuhu awiye kumtogola Chohile mna yuno mjeni uyodu?” <verse number="19" style="v" />Akaheza Yesu amgamba yudya mntu, “Chimala wite zako, uzumizi wako ukuhonya.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kwiza kwa Useuta wa Chohile</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 24:23-28, 37-41</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mafalisayo weza wamuze Yesu useuta wa Chohile nawize ini. Awahitula, “Useuta wa Chohile hawize kwa kuwoneka pwilili. <verse number="21" style="v" />Naho hahana yumwenga nagambe, ‘Kaula, wihano!’ Hegu, ‘Wihadya!,’ Kwaviya useuta wa Chohile wi mgati mwenyu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Niyo awagamba wanampina wakwe, “Mazuwa yeza ayo mkunga munge muwone zuwa dimwe dya Mwana ywa Mntu, mna hamdiwone. <verse number="23" style="v" />Wantu nawawagambeni, ‘Kaulani, ekudya!’ Mna nyuwe msekufosa naho mkawabasa. <verse number="24" style="v" />Kwaviya enga lumwemwe viya lukwaka kwembingu na kumulika uko na uko, nivyo Mwana ywa Mntu akunga eze mwe dizuwa dyakwe. <verse number="25" style="v" />Mna aungwa nkongo asulumiziswe na kulemelwa ni wantu wa dyelo. <verse number="26" style="v" />Saviya mwe dizuwa dya Nuhu nivyo vikunga vitende mwe chipindi cha Mwana ywa Mntu. <verse number="27" style="v" />Mwa mazuwa yadya wantu na wakadya na kunywa, naho kusola na kusolwa, kubula zuwa diya Nuhu eze engile mwe safina na fula nkulu niyo yanya na kuwakoma wose. <verse number="28" style="v" />Nivyo vyendaga mwa mazuwa ya Lutu. Wantu na wakadya na kunywa, kugula na kutaga, kuhanda na kuzenga. <verse number="29" style="v" />Mna zuwa diya Lutu eze akulawe Sodoma, niyo kwalaila moto wa chibiliti usela kulaila kwembingu na kuwakoma woseni. <verse number="30" style="v" />Ivyo nivyo vikunga vitende zuwa diya akwizila Mwana ywa Mntu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Mwe dizuwa idyo mntu yudya aungagwa aselezwe hasi kulaila mnanga mwe nyumba asekusela kwita kwe nyumba yakwe akaguhe vintu vyakwe, seivyo mntu ekwenkonde asekuya kaya. <verse number="32" style="v" />Kumbukani yadya yamlaile mkaza Lutu! <verse number="33" style="v" />Yoyose nadime ujima wakwe nawaze, mna yudya nalavye ujima wakwe na audime. <verse number="34" style="v" />Nawagambilani nyuwe, mwe dizuwa idyo, wantu waidi nawatende wagona mwe lusazi lumwenga, yumwenga aguhigwa, yumwenga asigwa. <verse number="35" style="v" />Wavyele waidi nawatende wabunda hamwenga, yumwenga naguhigwe, yumwenga nasigwe.” <verse number="36" style="v" />Wantu waidi nawatende mwenkonde imwenga, yumwenga naguhigwe, yumwenga asigwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Wanampina niyo wamuza, “Zumbe, mbuli zino nazidamanyike kuhi?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu niyo awahitula, “Hadya hana chimba chiwoile, naho hakuchima magushu.”</para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Mliganyo wa mvyele abanikilwe ni mgosi na mlamuzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Akaheza Yesu awagambila wanampina wakwe mliganyo uno kwa kuwalagisa kugamba mazuwa yose waungigwa wamlombeze Chohile naho wasekufa chevu. <verse number="2" style="v" />Agamba, “Mwe mzi msiku kwendaga na mkanta yumwenga hekumogoha Chohile hegu hekumtunya mntu yoyose. <verse number="3" style="v" />Seivyo kwendaga na mvyele abanikilwe ni mgosi mo umzi uwo nakajendeleza kumbasa akalombeza enkigwe vintu vyakwe vikumuwagila, akagamba, ‘Nambiza mwe vikuniwagila mwa mhiga ywangu!’ <verse number="4" style="v" />Kwa chipindi chitali yudya mkanta kalemela kudamanya, mna keuza mwenye akagamba, ‘Hata hegu sikumwogoha Chohile hegu sikutunya mntu yoyose, <verse number="5" style="v" />mna kwaviya yudya mvyele abanikilwe ni mgosiwe mwe chivuzovuzo akuninka, nani kaule kugamba ahokela vikumuwagila. Hegu sanivitende, najendeleze kwiza kunijela maya!’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Akaheza Zumbe agamba, “Tegelezani ivyo mkanta uyo aihiye ivyo alongile.” <verse number="7" style="v" />Elo, Chohile hawenke wadya wedi kulongozi kwa Chohile wantu wakumwila chilo na msi wambizwe? Nakawe kuwambiza? <verse number="8" style="v" />Nawagambilani nyuwe, hakawe kuwenkani vikuwoneka vyedi kulongozi kwa Chohile. Mna Mwana ywa Mntu aho akwizila nabwile wazumile mwe isi?</para>
  <para style="s">Mliganyo wa Mafalisayo na wachisanya kodi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Yesu awagambila naho mliganyo uno kwa wantu wewone kutenda wedi na kubela chila mntu mtuhu. <verse number="10" style="v" />“Nakuna wantu waidi wakweile kwita kwe kulombeza mwe Nyumba nkulu ya Chohile, yumwenga nani Falisayo, mtuhu ni mchisanya kodi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Yudya Falisayo kachimala hankanda mwenye akalombeza zavino, weye Chohile, ‘Nakuhongeza weye, Chohile, kugamba miye suyo mbafu, naho nimchindedi naho si mgonyi hegu mbunyanyi, sayuno mchisanya kodi ehadya hankanda hekwiva. <verse number="12" style="v" />Nafunga mazuwa maidi chila juma, naho nalavya fungu dyangu dya mlongo dya vintu vyose ni nanavyo.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Mna yudya mchisanya kodi kachimala kwa luhale naho haungile hata kwinula uso wakwe kwembingu, mna kutowa mwe chifuwa chakwe nakugamba, ‘Chohile, nifila mbazi, miye ni mkola masa!’ <verse number="14" style="v" />Yesu niyo agamba, Nawagambilani,” “mchisanya kodi, kauya kaya akatenda kalekeilwa masa yakwe mna suyo Falisayo, akuoneka ywedi kulongozi kwa Chohile. Kwaviya woseni wakwekweza nawaselezwe, woseni nawo wakunyanyahala nawatendwe wakulu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Ajimbika Wana Wadodo</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 19:13-15; Mako 10:13-16</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Wantu wamwenga nawamwila Yesu chani awajelekele mikono yakwe. Wanampina weze wawone niyo wawakwahila kwa kudamanya ivyo, <verse number="16" style="v" />mna Yesu kawetanga wadya wana kwakwe nakugamba, “Walekeni wana weze kwangu msekuwachinda, kwaviya Useuta wa Chohile wikwa wadodo sawano. <verse number="17" style="v" />Chindedi nawagambila vino! Yoyose hekuhokela Useuta wa Chohile enga mwana hawingile.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mntu mgoli</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 19:16-30; Mako 10:17-31</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chilongozi yumwenga ywa Chiyahudi amuza Yesu, “Mhinya Ywedi, nidamanye mbwani nihokele ujima wa mazuwa yose?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Yesu amuza, “Ni mbwani ukunitanga ywedi?” “Hakuna mntu ywedi ukaleka Chohile du. <verse number="20" style="v" />Kuyamanya malagizo, ‘Usekugonya, usekukoma, usekubawa, usekulonga udanti, watunye iso na nyokwe.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Yudya mntu ahitula, “kukongela ni mdodo, sitimila malagizo yano yoseni.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Yesu eze eve vino, amgamba, “Kuchei nachintu chimwenga ukungigwa udamanye. Taga vyoseni unanavyo uwenke wachiwa izihela, nawe nautende na ugoli kwembingu, ukaheza wize unitimile.” <verse number="23" style="v" />Mna yudya mntu eze eve vino, kengilwa ni chinyulu vidala, kwaviya nanimgoli vitendese. <verse number="24" style="v" />Yesu kawona kugamba nana chinyulu vitendese, “Udala wi vivihi kwa mntu mgoli kwingila mo Useuta wa Chohile! <verse number="25" style="v" />Ni vidala vitendese kwa mntu mgoli kwingila mo Useuta wa Chohile kujinka ngamiya kujinka mwe ntundu ya singano.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Wantu wamwivaga wamuza, “Ni yuhi, naho, akudaha kukombolwa?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Yesu ahitula, “Hechikudahika kwa mntu chadahika kwa Chohile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Niyo Petulo agamba, “Kaula! Suwe chileka kaya zetu nakukutimila weye.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Yesu awagamba, “Chindedi,” naho nawagambilani kugamba yoyose akwasa nyumba hegu mvyele hegu mlukolo hegu welesi hegu wana kwachausa cha Useuta wa Chohile, <verse number="30" style="v" />nahokele vilozese mwe chipindi chino na wikazi wa ujima wa mazuwa yose mwe mihilimo ikwiza.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu asimwila nkanana ya katatu ye file yakwe na kuuyuka kwakwe</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 20:17-19; Mako 10:32-34</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Yesu awaguha hankanda wadya wanampina mlongo na waidi nakuwagamba, “Tegelezani! Chaita Yelusalemu kudya chila chintu chiwandikwe ni wawoni mwe Mwana ywa Mntu nachitende chindedi. <verse number="32" style="v" />Kwaviya nalavigwe mwe mikono ya wantu sawo Wayahudi, wadya wakunga wamtile, wamhulute na kumtwela mate. <verse number="33" style="v" />Nawamhute na kumkoma, mna mazuwa matatu yakutimila nauyuke.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Mna wadya wanampina hawakombaganye chochose mwe vino vintu, nikugamba ulosi ufisizwa wowo, naho hawamanyaga nichibwani Yesu nakakisimwila mwe mbwani.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Ahonya tuntu Mlombezi</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 20:29-34; Mako 10:46-52</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Hadya Yesu eze atende haguhi no mzi wa Yeliko, kwendaga na mntu yumwenga tuntu ekale hankanda he sila, akalombeza. <verse number="36" style="v" />Eze eve fyo dya wantu wakajinka, auza, “Kuna mbwani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Wamgamba, “Yesu wa Nazaleti ajinkila hano.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Aguta, “Yesu! Mwana ywa Daudi! Nifila mbazi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Wantu walongole wamkwahila nakumgamba anyamale. Mna niyo agutisa, “Mwana ywa Daudi! Nifila mbazi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Elo Yesu niyo achimala nakuwalagiza wamwigale yudya tuntu kwakwe. Eze abule hajihi, Yesu amuza, <verse number="41" style="v" />“Waunga hudamanyize mbwani?”</para>
  <para style="p">Ahitula, “Zumbe,” “Naunga niwone naho.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Yesu amgamba, “Kwaivyo wana! Uzumizi wako ukuhonya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Ahadya yudya tuntu niyo adaha kuwona, niyo amtimila Yesu, kuno akamhongeza Chohile. Fyo dize diwone ivyo, wose wamtunya Chohile.</para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Yesu na Zakayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Yesu kajendeleza kwingila Yeliko naho nakajinkanya. <verse number="2" style="v" />Nakuna mchisanya kodi mkulu kudya akwitangwa Zakayo, endaga mgoli. <verse number="3" style="v" />Nakajeza kusinya Yesu nani yuhi, mna nani mntu mjihi naho hadahile kumwona Yesu kwachausa che difyo. <verse number="4" style="v" />Ivyo kalongola kulongozi kwe difyo nakukwela kulanga kwe mkuyu amwone Yesu, kwaviya Yesu nakaunga ajinkile mwe sila iyo. <verse number="5" style="v" />Umo Yesu eze abule hadya hantu, kasinya kulanga nakumgamba Zakayo, “Zakayo sunguza usele, kwaviya naungwa dyelo nikale mwe nyumba yako.” <verse number="6" style="v" />Zakayo kasunguza kusela na kumhokela kwa chinyemi. <verse number="7" style="v" />Wantu wose wawone ivyo wakonga kung'ung'uzika wakagamba, “Mntu yuno kaita na kwikala na mntu mta masa!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mna Zakayo niyo achimala nakumgamba Zumbe, “Zumbe! Tegeleza, naniwenke wachiwa nusu yo ugoli wangu, naho hegu namhokaga mntu yoyose chakwe, nanilihe nkanana nne kujinka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Yesu amgamba, “Dyelo wambulwa wingila mwe nyumba ino, kwaviya mntu yuno, naye, ni mwelekwa ywa Bulahimu. <verse number="10" style="v" />Kwaviya Mwana ywa Mntu keza kuzungula na kwambula wagile.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mliganyo wa matundu ya Zahabu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 25:14-30</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Umo wantu waketegeleza yano, Yesu kajendeleza na kuwagambila mliganyo. Kwaviya nehaguhi no mzi wa Yelusalemu, nawo nawakafanyanya kugamba mazuwa yo Useuta wa Chohile nawihajihi na kulaila. <verse number="12" style="v" />Ivyo agamba, “Kwendaga na mntu yumwenga mkulu atambaga kwita mwe si ya hale vidala chani akatendwe seuta, akaheza auye kukaya. <verse number="13" style="v" />Umo henati kuhalawa, kawetanga wandima wakwe mlongo nakuwenka chila yumwenga tundu dya zahabu nakuwagamba, ‘Kaulani mwadaha kudamanya mbwani mwe chino chani mwingize umo miye sihali.’ <verse number="14" style="v" />Mna, wantu wa kwawo niyo wamwihiwa, ivyo wasigila wantu kwakwe kugamba, ‘Hachikunga mntu atende seuta ywetu.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Yudya mntu niyo atendwa seuta nakuya. Akaheza alagiza wadya wandima wakwe enkile yadya matundu weze, chani akaule chila yumwenga icho engize. <verse number="16" style="v" />Ywa nkongo keza nakulonga, ‘Zumbe, miye singiza matundu ya zahabu mlongo mwe imwenga waninkaga.’ <verse number="17" style="v" />Agamba, ‘Kudamanya vyedi,’ ‘wimndima ywedi! Kwaviya na wi mkanuni kwa vintu vidodo, nahutende mchimaila ywa mizi mlongo.’ <verse number="18" style="v" />Mndima ywa kaidi keza nakugamba, ‘Zumbe, miye singiza matundu mashano ya zahabu mwe imwenga waninkaga.’ <verse number="19" style="v" />Uyo naye amgamba, ‘Nahutende mkulu mwe mizi mishano.’”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Mndima mtuhu keza nakugamba, ‘Zumbe, tundu dyako dya zahabu dino dihano, nasidifisa mwe katambala ka mo mkono. <verse number="21" style="v" />Nahakogoha, kwaviya wi mntu mdala. Waguha sicho chako naho wavuna hwihandile.’ <verse number="22" style="v" />Amgamba, ‘Wimndima ehiye! Nahukantile kwa ulosi wako mwenye! Kuvimanya kugamba ni mdala, kuguha sicho changu nakuvuna sihandile. <verse number="23" style="v" />Nivyedi, elo, nimbwani hwikiye hela zangu kwa wakulavya vyongezekele? Niyo nahokela chongezekele umo ukanivuziza.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Niyo alonga kwa wadya nawachimale hadya, ‘Guhani idyo iditundu dye zahabu kulaila kwakwe mmwinke mndima yudya mta matundu mlongo.’ <verse number="25" style="v" />Mna wamgamba, ‘Zumbe, ana matundu mlongo kale!’ <verse number="26" style="v" />Awahitula, ‘Nawagambilani,’ ‘kugamba mtu mta chintu, nongezezwe, mna wadya hewena chintu, hata chiya chidodo wananacho nawahokwe. <verse number="27" style="v" />Haluse, kwa wadya wankondo wangu hawaungile miye nitende seuta ywawo, waleteni hano muwakome mwa meso yangu!’ ”</para>
  <para style="s">Mwingilo wa kwe ngasu uko Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 21:1-11; Mako 11:1-11; Yohana 12:12-19</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Yesu eze alonge vino, kawalongweila kwita Yelusalemu. <verse number="29" style="v" />Umo akabula hajihi na Betifage na Besaniya ho lugulu lwa Mizeituni, kasigila wanampina waidi walongole, <verse number="30" style="v" />awasigila vino, “Hitani kudya ko mzi wikulongozi kwenyu, umo mkengila, namlondole mwana mpunda atalizwe henati kukwelwa. Mchohweleni mumwigala hano. <figure style="fig" desc="" file="15 Colt.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="LUK 19.30">Mwana mpunda</figure> <verse number="31" style="v" />Uneva mntu anawauzani ni mbwani mwamchohola, mgambeni kugamba Zumbe amunga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Waita intambo yawo nakubwila chilachintu saviya Yesu awagambile. <verse number="33" style="v" />Umo wakamchohola yudya mwana mpunda, umwenye awauza, “Ni mbwani mkumchohola?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Wahitula, “Zumbe, amunga,” <verse number="35" style="v" />niyo wamwigala mwana mpunda uyo kwa Yesu. Wadula suche zawo mwe mpunda iyo nakumwambiza Yesu kukwela. <verse number="36" style="v" />Umo akajendeleza, wantu watandaza suche zawo mwe sila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Eze abule haguhi na Yelusalemu, hantu hana seleza kwita kolugulu lwe Mizeituni, fyo kulu dya wanampina wakwe welelwa na kukonga kumhongeza Chohile na kumtogola kwa izwi kulu kwa mpituko zose wawone. <verse number="38" style="v" />Wakagamba, “Ajimbikwe seuta akwiza kwa zina dya Zumbe! Utondowazi kwembingu na ukuka kwa Chohile!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Niyo Mafalisayo wamwenga mwe difyo walonga wamgamba Yesu. Wagamba, “Mhinya,” “wakwahile wanampina wako wanyamale!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Yesu awahitula, “Nawagambilani kugamba uneva wananyamala, mayuwe nayagute.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu awila Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Yesu eze abule haguhi no umzi, na eze auwone, kawila, <verse number="42" style="v" />akagamba, “Hegu du wamanyize dyelo dino chintu chikudaha kukwigaila utondowazi! Mna haluse hukudaha kuchiwona! <verse number="43" style="v" />Kwaviya mazuwa yeza umo wankondo wenyu nawawazunguluke kwa nkondo, aho nawazenge chiwambaza cha kuwachinda nakuwavugaila ntendele zose. <verse number="44" style="v" />Nawawakomeni vitendese na wantu we mwe viwambaza vyenyu, hahana yuwe dikunga disigazwe hantu hakwe, kwaviya hawakombaganye chipindi umo Chohile akunga eze awambuleni!”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu engila kwe Nyumba ya Kuvikila</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 21:12-17; Mako 11:15-19; Yohana 2:13-22</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Yesu niyo engila mwe Nyumba nkulu ya Chohile nakukonga kugulusa wakutaga mayombe, <verse number="46" style="v" />akawagamba, “Iwandikwa mwa mawandiko kugamba Chohile kagamba, ‘Nyumba nkulu ya Chohile ya Kuvikila naitende nyumba ya kulombezeza.’ Mna nyuwe mwihitula hantu hakwefisiza wabavi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Yesu na kahinya chila zuwa mwe Nyumba nkulu ya Chohile. Walavyantambiko wakulu, wahinya Sigilizi, na vilongozi wa wantu nawakaunga wamkome, <verse number="48" style="v" />mna hawabunkule sila yakumkoma, kwaviya wantu wose nawakamwetegeleza, wasekuleka kwiva ulosi wowose.</para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya udahi wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 21:23-27; Mako 11:27-33</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zuwa dimwenga umo Yesu nakahinya wantu mwe Nyumba nkulu ya Chohile na kulonga Mbuli Yedi, walavyantambiko wakulu na wahinya Sigilizi, hamwenga na wadalahala, weza <verse number="2" style="v" />nakumgamba, “Chigambile, Wadamanya mbuli zino kwa udahi wa yuhi? Ni yuhi akwinkile udahi uno?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Yesu awahitula, “Gojani niwauze mbuli. Nigambilani, <verse number="4" style="v" />Udahi wa Yohana wo kubatiza ulaila kwembingu hegu kwa mntu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Niyo wafanyanya chalumwe, “Chigeze? Uneva chinagamba, ‘Ulaila kwembingu,’ nagambe, ‘Nimbwani, hamumzumile Yohana?’ <verse number="6" style="v" />Mna uneva chinagamba ‘Ulaila kwa wantu,’ dino difyo dyose nadichitowe mayuwe, kwaviya wabunkula kugamba Yohana endaga muwoni.” <verse number="7" style="v" />Ivyo wahitula, “Hachivimanyize uko ulaile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Yesu awagamba, “Saniwagambileni, ni kwa udahi wani nadamanya mbuli zino.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mliganyo ywa Mkodisha nkonde ya mizabibu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 21:33-46; Mako 12:1-12</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Yesu niyo ajendeleza kuwagambila mligano uno, “Kwendaga na mntu yumwenga nakalima nkonde yakwe ya mizabibu, niyo aikodisha kwa walimizi, niyo atamba kwita si ya hale kakwikala uko kwa chipindi chitali. <verse number="10" style="v" />Umo chipindi cho uvuni we zabibu chize chibule, niyo amsigila mndima ywakwe yumwenga kwa wadya walimizi chani wamwinke ntendele yakwe yo ulozo. Mna wadya walimizi niyo wamtowa yudya mndima na kumvuza mikono bule. <verse number="11" style="v" />Yudya mntu niyo amsigila mndima mtuhu, mna naye niyo wamtowa saiviya na kumtendela vihiye na kumvuza mikono bule. <verse number="12" style="v" />Niyo asigila mtuhu ywa katatu, yuno naye weze wamtowe na kumlumiza niyo wambalaza. <verse number="13" style="v" />Vikaheza yudya zumbe mta inkonde ye mizabibu niyo agamba, ‘Nitende zeze? Nani msigile mwanangu hungisa, wadaha wakamwiva.’ <verse number="14" style="v" />Wadya walimizi weze wamuwone yudya mwana niyo wagambilana, ‘Yuno nuyo mlisi, haluse chimkome chani uno ulisi utende wetu.’ ” <verse number="15" style="v" />Niyo wamlavya mweidya inkonde ye mizabibu, wamkoma.</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu niyo auza, “Yuno zumbe mta inkonde nawatende mbwani wadya walimizi?” <verse number="16" style="v" />“Neze awakome wadya walimizi na kuwenka walimizi watuhu idya inkonde ye mizabibu.”</para>
  <para style="p">Wantu weze weve ziya izimbuli, niyo wamhiga wagamba “Havikudahika!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mna Yesu niyo awasinya, awagamba, “Mawandiko yano Yakukile manakwe ni mbwani?</para>
  <para style="q">‘Yuwe dilemelwe ni wazesi,</para>
  <para style="q">haluse ditenda yuwe kulu dya msingi.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Mntu yoyose anagwa mnanga mwe diya diyuwe nakantike vihandehande, naho dinamgwela mntu yoyose nadimtiginte enga unga.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya kuliha kodi</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 22:15-22; Mako 12:13-17</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Wahinyi wa Sigilizi na walavyantambiko wakulu na wamanya kugamba mligano uwo wawalanga wowo, ivyo na wakaunga wamgwile ahadya, mna nawakawogoha wantu. <verse number="20" style="v" />Ivyo niyo wakonga kumhanga Yesu, niyo wasigila wazuza waketenda ni wantu wedi chani wamgwile mo ulosi wakwe, na mwe sila iyo wadahe kumlavya mwe mikono ye vilongozi we isi. <verse number="21" style="v" />Awo wazuza niyo wamgamba, “Mhinyi, chimanya kugamba walonga na kuhinya mbuli za chindedi, chimanya weye hukupagula, weye wahinya ichindedi chenye che sila ya Chohile. <verse number="22" style="v" />Elo chigambile hegu ni vyedi hegu sivyo vyedi mwe sigilizi yetu kuliha kodi kwa mkulu ywa Chilumi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Yesu niyo amanya viya wamtegile, niyo awagamba, <verse number="24" style="v" />“Nilagisani ivyo hela iyo ili, nauza iyo isula ne chapa ni yayuhi?”</para>
  <para style="p">Niyo wamhitula, “Niya Mkulu ywa Chilumi”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Yesu niyo awagamba, “Elo mwinkeni mkulu ywa Chilumi ivyakwe na Chohile ivyakwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Elo wadya wantu niyo wadunduga kumgwiza mwe mbuli yoyose, niyo wehelwa hawahitule, niyo wanyamala dwii.</para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya Kuyuka</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 22:23-33; Mako 12:18-27</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mna Masadukayo wadya wakugamba wabanike hawakudaha kuyuka, niyo wamhitula Yesu wagamba, <verse number="28" style="v" />“Mhinyi, Musa kachiwandikila vino hegu mntu anabanika kuno kasa mkaziwe heleke wana, vyongigwa mlukolo ywakwe amsole yudya mvyele, chani amwelekele wana yudya mlukolo abanike. <verse number="29" style="v" />Mna na kuna walukolo mfungate. Ywankongo asolaga mvyele niyo abanika heleke mwana, <verse number="30" style="v" />mlukolo ywa kaidi niyo ampala yudya mvyele naye niyo abanika, <verse number="31" style="v" />ywakatatu seivyo vilaile kwa wose mfungate, wose na wabanika heweleke wana. <verse number="32" style="v" />Weze wabanike wose yudya mvyele naye niyo abanika. <verse number="33" style="v" />Nauza mwe dizuwa idyo dyo kuuyuka, mvyele uyo natende mkaza yuhi? Kwaviya na kasolwa ni wose mfungate.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Yesu niyo awagamba, “Wantu we mihilimo ino wasola na kusolwa, <verse number="35" style="v" />mna wadya nawafanyanywe kugamba wawagila kuyuswa na kwikala mwe mihilimo ikwiza hawasole hegu kusolwa. <verse number="36" style="v" />Naho hawabanike vituhu, kwa viya na watende saviya wandima wa kwembingu, na watende wana Chohile. Kwa viya wauyuka. <verse number="37" style="v" />Mna mbuli yo kuyuka ni chindedi, hata Musa ailongaga mwa Mawandiko yakwe Yakukile, hadya awandikaga mbuli ya saka dikwaka moto niyo amtaja Zumbe saviya Chohile ywa Bulahimu na Isaka na Yakobo. <verse number="38" style="v" />Uyo suyo Chohile ywa wabanike, mna ni Chohile ywa wajima, kwaviya kwa uyo woseni wekala.” <verse number="39" style="v" />Wahinyi Sigilizi watuhu wagamba, “Mhinyi, kuhitula vyedi vidala!” <verse number="40" style="v" />Niyo hawamuzize vituhu.</para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya Mesiya</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 22:41-46; Mako 12:35-37</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Yesu niyo awauza, “Kwa mbwani wantu wagamba Kulisito ni mwana ywa Daudi? <verse number="42" style="v" />Kwa viya Daudi mwenye nakalonga mwe chitabu chakwe cha zabuli,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Zumbe na kamgamba zumbe ywangu.</para>
  <para style="q">Ikala kwe ntendele ya kulume kwangu.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Kubula aho naniwaike wadya wakukwihiwa enga fumbi dya kwikiya viga vyako.’</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Elo ni vivihi Daudi akumwitanga Yesu ‘Zumbe’, nivivihi naho, Kulisito adaha kutenda mwelekwa ywa Daudi?”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Awafunda Wahinya Sigilizi</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 23:1-36; Mako 12:38-40</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Yesu niyo awagambila wanampina wakwe ahadya ha wantu wose. <verse number="46" style="v" />“Mwedime na wahinya Sigilizi, wakunga kujinka jinka wavika nkazu, wakungisa kulamswa ni wantu kwa kutunywa kwa magwilo, wongisa kwikala hantu na hedi mwe midugano mwa nyumba yo kuvikila na kuguha hantu hedi mwe zingasu, <verse number="47" style="v" />Wawahoka ugoli wadya wafilwe ni wagosi zawo mwe zi nyumba zawo, na kulombeza malombezo matali chani wawoneke kulongozi kwa wantu. Kwaviya nawakantilwe vitendese!”</para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Malavyo ya Mvyele abanikilwe ni mgosi</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 12:41-44</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Yesu eze enule meso awawona wagoli waidi wakajela malavyo mwe shanduku mndani mwe nyumba nkulu ya Chohile. <verse number="2" style="v" />Niyo amona mvyele yumwenga afilwe ni mgosiwe, ajeleka wahela waidi mndani mwe chiya ichiya. <verse number="3" style="v" />Yesu niyo agamba, “Nawagambilani chindedi, mvyele yuno afilwe ni mgosiwe kajeleka majeleko makulu mwe ino mpamba kujinka wose. <verse number="4" style="v" />Kwa viya wantu wose walavya malavyo yawo mwe hela ziya zisigale mwe zimbuli zawo. Mna yuno mvyele na uchiwa ananawo kalavya chiya chikunga chimwambize mo wikazi wakwe.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Asimwila mwe Uvuni wa Nyumba nkulu ya kuvikila</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 24:12; Mako 13:1-2</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mna wanampina watuhu na wakalonga mwe mbuli ze Nyumba nkulu ya Chohile, ivyo ihambigwe kwa mayuwe ya zahabu, hamwenga na majeleko yalavigwe kwa chausa cha Chohile. Mna Yesu niyo agamba, <verse number="6" style="v" />“Yose mkuyawona sicho chintu, nayeze mazuwa hamuwone hata yuwe dimwenga, mnanga mo mnyawe, chila chintu nachibanangwe.”</para>
  <para style="s">Nkunto na Masulumizo</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 24:3-14; Mako 13:3-13</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mna niyo wamwuza, “Mhinyi, mbuli izo na zilaile ini? Naho ni chilagiso chani chikunga chilagise mbuli izo zihaguhi kulaila,”?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Yesu niyo awahitula, “Kaulani, sima mnadantwe. Wantu walozize naweze waketanga zina dyangu, wakagamba, ‘Miye nuyo Kulisito!’ ‘Chipindi chibula!’ Mna nyuwe msekuwatimila. <verse number="9" style="v" />Mna mkeva mbuli za nkondo na nkunto ze isi msekogoha, ayo yaungwa yakonge kulaila, mna udumo wa yose haunati.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Akaheza Yesu niyo ajendeleza kulonga agamba, “Si naitowane na si ntuhu, naho useuta nautowane na useuta. <verse number="11" style="v" />Chila hantu na kulaile chisingisa chikulu mwe isi, nakutende na sala na manyonje ya kwinkilizana, na kutenda na mbuli za kutisa na vilagiso vikulu kulaila kwembingu. <verse number="12" style="v" />Mna nyumani mbuli izo hezinati kulaila, namgwilwe na kusulumizwa, na mwigalwe kwe kukantilwa mwe nyumba zo kuvikila na kuwagwilani, naho namwigalwe kulongozi kwa maseuta na wakulu kwa chausa che dizina dyangu. <verse number="13" style="v" />Ivyo namlavye ukuzi wangu kulongozi kwawo. <verse number="14" style="v" />Mna mwekambe mndani mwe myoyo kugamba ivyo mkunga mweile hemnati kulahwa. <verse number="15" style="v" />Kwa viya naniwenke mbuli zedi zo kulonga zikunga zileke wakuweihiwa hawadahe kulemela hegu kuhigana na nyuwe. <verse number="16" style="v" />Welesi wenyu, walukolo wenyu na wambuya zenyu nawawalemele, na watuhu na mkomwe. <verse number="17" style="v" />Wantu wose nawawaihiwe kwa chausa cha zina dyangu. <verse number="18" style="v" />Mna hata luvili lumwenga mwe mitwi yenyu halwage. <verse number="19" style="v" />Kwa viya yo uijimizi mnanawo, wikazi wenyu hawage.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Asimwila mwe Uvuni wa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 24:15-21; Mako 13:14-19</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Chipindi namuwone umzi wa Yelusalemu uzungulukwa ni wankondo, aho manyani kugamba kubalangwa kwakwe kwihaguhi. <verse number="21" style="v" />Aho wadya nawatende Yudeya wagulukile kwe milima, wadya we komzi wafose, na wadya wekwe zinkonde wasekuya komzi wa Yelusalemu. <verse number="22" style="v" />Kwa viya mazuwa ayo ‘Na yatende ya nkunto’, chani yadya yose yawandikwe mwa Mawandiko Yakukile yachinte. <verse number="23" style="v" />Wavyele wasoka na wakonkeza nawaluwone mwa mazuwa ayo! Kwa viya nakutende na nkunto nkulu mwe isi na maya ya Chohile nayawagwele wantu wano. <verse number="24" style="v" />Watuhu nawakomwe kwa mabamba, watuhu na waguhigwe mateka kulaila mwe chila si na mzi wa Yelusalemu na uguhigwe ni wantu wa si ntuhu kubula chipindi chawo chize chisile.</para>
  <para style="s">Kwiza kwa Mwana ywa Mntu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 24:29-31; Mako 13:24-27</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Nakutende na vilagiso mwedizuwa na mo mnenge na mwezintondo. Mwe zisi zose nazitende na nkunto wantu na welelwe kulawana na mawimbi makulu kwe bahali. <verse number="26" style="v" />Wantu na wafe kififimbazi kwa chausa cha woga wakagoja mbuli zikunga zilaile mwe isi yose, kwaviya vyose vina nguvu kwembingu navisingiswe. <verse number="27" style="v" />Nawamwone mwana ywa Adamu akasela mwa maingu kulaila kwa Chohile, kamema nguvu na ukuka. <verse number="28" style="v" />Umo izimbuli izo zikakonga kulaila, chimalani niyo mwenule mitwi yenyu kulanga kwa viya ukombolwa wenyu wihaguhi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Hinyo dya mtini</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 24:32-35; Mako 13:28-31</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Yesu niyo awagambila mligano ukugamba, kaulani ivyo wili mtini na miti mituhu yose. <verse number="30" style="v" />Mkawona kugamba mani yo mtini yakonga kusuka bunkulani wenye kugamba chipindi cha zuwa kali chihaguhi. <verse number="31" style="v" />Saivyo, mneza kuwona mbuli izo zikalaila mmanye kugamba Useuta wa Chohile wihaguhi. <verse number="32" style="v" />Nawagambilani chindedi, cheleko chino cha haluse hachijinke, izimbuli izo zose hazinati kulaila. <verse number="33" style="v" />Mbingu ne isi vyose na vijinke, mna ulosi wangu haujinke.</para>
  <para style="s">Ungi wa Kusinya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Mkaulise myoyo yenyu inase kuzamilwa ni mbuli zimwe isi ino, saviya ukozi na kutumbwazikila wikazi, mkaulise kwa viya zuwa idyo nadiwezile kwa kuwetukizani. <verse number="35" style="v" />Kwaviya zuwa idyo na diwezile saviya mtego ukufyuka kwa wose wakwikala mwe isi. <verse number="36" style="v" />Elo, nagamba mcheleze mkalombeza chila zuwa chani mwinkwe nguvu za kwenega mbuli zose izo nazilaile nanywi mchimale kulongozi kwa Mwana ywa Mntu.” <verse number="37" style="v" />Yesu nomsi nakekala mwe Nyumba nkulu ya Chohile akahinya, nechilo nakaita kugona ko lugulu lwe Mizeituni. <verse number="38" style="v" />Mtondo wantu wose nawakaita kwe Nyumba nkulu ya Chohile chani wakamwetegeleze.</para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Njama za kumkoma Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 26:1-5; Mako 14:1-2; Yohana 11:45-53</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zuwa kulu dye migate heijeligwe hamila, ikwitagwa Pasaka nadisogela. <verse number="2" style="v" />Walavyantambiko wakulu na wahinya sigilizi nawakalonda mbuli ya kumkoma Yesu mna nawakogoha wantu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yuda azumila kumhituka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 26:14-16; Mako 14:10-11</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Shetani amwingila Yuda akwitangwa Isikaliyote, yumwenga mgati mwa wadya wasigilwa mlongo na waidi wa Yesu. <verse number="4" style="v" />Yuda aita akulonga na Walavyantambiko wakulu na wadya wadimi we nyumba nkulu yo kuvikila, ivyo akunga amhituke Yesu chani wamgwile. <verse number="5" style="v" />Niyo welelwa wamgamba nawamwinke hela anadamanya ivyo. <verse number="6" style="v" />Yuda azumila, niyo akonga kulonda hantu hedi hakumhituka Yesu chani wamgwile, mna wantu wasekumanya.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Emalanya Kudya nkande ya Pasaka</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 26:17-25; Mako 14:12-21; Yohana 13:21-30</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Niyo dyabula zuwa dya migate heijeligwe hamila, zuwa idyo nidyo idizuwa dyo ukuchinjwa mwanangoto we Pasaka. <verse number="8" style="v" />Ivyo Yesu awasigila Petulo na Yohana awagamba, Hitani mkachikiye vintu vye ngasu chani chidahe kudya Pasaka. <verse number="9" style="v" />Mna niyo wamuza, “Waunga chikaikiye kuhi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Yesu awahitula, Tegelezani umo mkaita ko mzi namdugane na mgosi ketwika biga dya mazi, mtimileni kubula aho he nyumba akunga engile. <verse number="11" style="v" />Mgambileni mta inyumba iyo mhinyi akuza chikuhi icho ichumba hunga nidile Pasaka hamwenga na wanampina wangu? <verse number="12" style="v" />Naye nawenkeni chumba chikulu cha kulanga chihambigwe vyedi, ikani umo ivintu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Niyo waita wabwila saviya wagambilwe ni Yesu, niyo waika ivintu vye ingasu ye dizuwa dye Pasaka.</para>
  <para style="s">Nkande ya Chisingi ya Zumbe</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 26:26-30; Mako 14:22-26; 1Wakolinto 11:23-25</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ichipindi chize chibule Yesu niyo ekala adye inkande hamwenga na wasigilwa wakwe. <verse number="15" style="v" />Yesu niyo awagamba, siungisa chidye hamwenga mwe ingasu ino ye dizuwa dye Pasaka umo sinati kusulumizwa. <verse number="16" style="v" />Nawagambilani ichindedi sanidye vituhu kubula ize idamanyike mwe idizuwa idyo dyo useuta wa Chohile hadinati kubula.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Niyo achiguha ichikombe amtogola Chohile agamba, “Guhani chino ichikombe mhokelezane kunywa. <verse number="18" style="v" />Nawagambilani chindedi kukongela haluse saninywe naho divai ino ikudamanywa na zabibu, kubula Useuta wa Chohile nawizile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Niyo aguha umgate, amtogola Chohile niyo aubesula, awenka, awagamba, uno nuwo umwili wangu, ukulavigwa kwa chausa cha nyuwe, mdamanye savino chani mnikumbuke chila mkadamanya. <verse number="20" style="v" />Niyo adamanya saivyo ne ichikombe nacho, weze wabinde ukudya, niyo agamba, chikombe chino ni lagano hya dya Chohile dikuukulwa kwa sila ya sakame yangu, ikwitika kwachausa cha nyuwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mna kaulani yudya akunga anihituke ehano he meza. <verse number="22" style="v" />Chindedi Mwana ywa mntu aita akukomwa saviya vikigwe, mna hangi mwenye yudya mntu akunga amhituke.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahadya niyo wakonga kuuzana wo wenye ni yuhi akunga amhituke Zumbe ywawo.</para>
  <para style="s">Kuhigana mwe Ukulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Wadya wasigilwa niyo wakonga kuhigana wo wenye ni yuhi mgati mwetu akunga atende chilongozi mwa weyawe. <verse number="25" style="v" />Yesu niyo awagamba, “Maseuta wa si ntuhu wawalongoza wantu wawo kwa nguvu, na wadya wakulongoza ‘Wakwetanga wambuya wachila mntu’. <verse number="26" style="v" />Mna visekutenda ivyo mwenyu mna yudya akunga atende mkulu mwenyu aungwa atende mdodo kujinka wose akunga atende chilongozi aungwa atende mndima. <verse number="27" style="v" />Nauza mkulu ni yuhi ni yudya akwikala mwe meza akagoja nkande hegu ni yudya akumwigaila? Nafanyanya ni yudya ekale he meza akagoja inkande hegu miye sikala hano enga mndima ywenyu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Nyuwe namwihamwenga na miye umo hasulumila. <verse number="29" style="v" />Saviya Tate aninkile Useuta saivyo miye nami naniwenkeni nyuwe Useuta. <verse number="30" style="v" />Nidye na kunywa he meza yangu mwe useuta wangu naho namwikale mwe vigoda vyenyu vyo useuta mkayakantila makabila mlongo na maidi ya izulaeli.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alotela Ukani wa Petulo</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 26:31-35; Mako 14:27-31; Yohana 13:36-38</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Simoni, Simoni! Tegeleza! Shetani kalekelwa chipindi cha kuwajezani nyuwe, saviya mntu akuheta ngano. <verse number="32" style="v" />Mna miye sikulombezeza kwa Chohile chani uzumizi unanawo usekuhunguka naunihituke mna unauya uwajele moyo walukolo wako.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Petulo niyo amhitula amgamba, “Zumbe, miye semalanya kale nite na weye kwedigeleza hata habanika sina mbuli.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Yesu amhitula, “Nakugambila, Petulo,” “Zogolo hadinati kwila neichilo naunilemele nkanana ntatu kugamba hunimanyize.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mkwiji na Sime</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Yesu niyo awauza wanampina wakwe “Umo nawasigilagani msekutoza hela hegu mkwiji hegu vilatu mwahungukilagwa ni chibwani?”</para>
  <para style="p">Niyo wamhitula. “Bule,”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Yesu awagamba mna yudya mta mkwiji wa hela naguhe, mta mkwiji we vintu naye naguhe. Seivyo hene bamba natage isuche yakwe chani agule. <verse number="37" style="v" />Nawagambila imbuli ino ya mawandiko yano Yakukile yekigwa hamwenga na wata ubanasi yongigwa yadamanywe. Yadya hungigwa nidamanye yehaguhi kubula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Wanampina wakwe niyo wamgamba, “Zumbe, kaula hano!” Yesu niyo awahitula, “Vichinta!”.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Alombeza Chohile ko lugulu lwa Mizaituni</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 26:36-46; Mako 14:32-42</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Yesu niyo ahalawa enga viya nakadamanya niyo aita ko lugulu we imizaituni mna wanampina wakwe niyo wambasa. <verse number="40" style="v" />Eze abule uko niyo awagamba mkalombeza sima mwingile mwe majezo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Niyo awasa aita hale hadodo utali wa mntu akudula yuwe hadya dikugwela. Niyo afika madi alombeza. <verse number="42" style="v" />“Tate,” uneva hegu ukaunga, unusize chikombe cha masulumizo. Mna visekutenda viya hunga miye, mna “Ivyo ukunga navitendeke.” <verse number="43" style="v" />Aho mndima ywa kwembingu kulaila kwa Chohile niyo eza amjela moyo. <verse number="44" style="v" />Umo emwe masulumizo makulu niyo ajendeleza kulombeza niyo alawa chiluke saviya madwentwe ya sakame niyo yajuluzika kubula hasi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Eze abinde ukulombeza niyo auya hadya hantu awasize wanampina wakwe niyo awambwila wagona, kwaviya nawana chinyulu. <verse number="46" style="v" />Niyo awagamba kwambwani mgona? Inukani mlombeze chani msekwingila mwe majezo.</para>
  <para style="s">Kugwilwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 26:47-56; Mako 14:43-50; Yohana 18:3-11</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Umo hanati kubinda ukulonga fyo dya wantu niyo dyeza dikalongozwa ni Yuda yumwenga mwe wadya wasigilwa mlongo na waidi, Yuda niyo ambasa Yesu chani amlamse kwa kumsesa. <verse number="48" style="v" />Mna Yesu niyo amgamba vino Yuda, wamhituka Mwana ywa mntu kwa kumsesa?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Wadya wanampina wakwe weze wawone izimbuli zikudamanywa, niyo wagamba Zumbe chiwasenge mabamba? <verse number="50" style="v" />Yumwenga mwe wadya wanampina niyo amsenga bamba mndima ywa Mlavyantambiko Mkulu, niyo amsenga idigutwi dyakwe dya kulume</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Aho Yesu niyo amgamba, leka, “Vyachinta!” Niyo adonta idigutwi dya yudya mntu na kumhonya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Yesu niyo awagamba wadya Walavyantambiko wakulu, wadalahala wa wadimi we nyumba nkulu ya Chohile na wantu wakulu wose wezile kumgwila vino mwiza mtoza mabamba na makome mwiza kunigwila enga miye ni mbavi? <verse number="53" style="v" />Umo nanihamwenga na nyuwe mwe nyumba nkulu ya Chohile kwa chila zuwa hamnigwile mna chindedi chino nicho ichipindi chenyu, chino nicho chipindi cho udahi wa shetani.</para>
  <para style="s">Petulo amhituka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 26:57-58, 69-75; Mako 14:53-54, 66-72; Yohana 18:12-18, 25-27</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Niyo wamgwila wamguha wamwigala kubula kwe inyumba ya Mlavyantambiko mkulu mna Petulo nakamtimila Yesu kwa kunyuma luhalehale. <verse number="55" style="v" />Moto naujimbwa hagati ho uwa wo mdugano wose nawekala hamwenga, Petulo naye nehadya. <verse number="56" style="v" />Mndima yumwenga mvyele eze amwone Petulo kekala haguhi ho moto, niyo amng'oila meso amgamba, Yuno mntu nehamwenga na Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Mna Petulo niyo alemela agamba, We mvyele miye simmanyize.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Chize chijinke chipindi chidodo mntu mtuhu niyo amwona Petulo amgamba, Weye wiyumo mwe wano wagwiligwe,</para>
  <para style="p">Mna Petulo niyo amhitula amgamba we mbwawe suyo miye.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Enga saa dimwinga dijinkile mntu yumwenga niyo eza kumvilikiza chindedi yuno ne ehamwenga na Yesu, hambwe kalaila Galilaya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Mna Petulo niyo amgamba, we mbwawe simanyize icho ukulonga,</para>
  <para style="p">Ahadya umo achekulonga zogolo niyo dyaila. <verse number="61" style="v" />Zumbe Yesu niyo ahituka na kumsinya Petulo, ahadya Petulo niyo akumbuka yadya agambilwe ni Zumbe, dyelo zogolo hadinati kwila naunihituke nkanana ntatu. <verse number="62" style="v" />Aho Petulo niyo afosa kweise, na kwila vidala.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu atilwa na kutoigwa</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 26:67-68; Mako 14:65</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Wadya wantu nawakamdima Yesu niyo wamtila nakumtowa. <verse number="64" style="v" />Wamgubiga ameso niyo wamuza, “Akutoile ni yuhi? Hebu bunkula chikaule?” <verse number="65" style="v" />Niyo wamhuluta vidala.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu egalwa mwa meso ye Chitala</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 26:59-66; Mako 14:55-64; Yohana 18:19-24</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Kwize kuche, wakulu wo mzi na wantu niyo wekala chitala, Wahinya Sigilizi na walavyantambiko wakulu naweyumo mwe icho chitala, Yesu niyo egalwa he chitala. <verse number="67" style="v" />Niyo wamuza, “Chigambile,” “Weye nuyo masiya?”</para>
  <para style="p">Kulisito niyo awagamba, “Uneva nina wagambilani, nyuwe hamnizumile, <verse number="68" style="v" />naho hegu ninawauzani hamnihitule. <verse number="69" style="v" />Mna kukongela vino haluse Mwana ywa Mntu nekale haguhi na Chohile Mta nguvu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />Wose niyo wamuza, “Elo, chigambile weye nuyo Mwana ywa Chohile?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu niyo awagamba, “Nyuwe mlonga mwagamba miye nuyo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" />Niyo wagamba, “Hachikunga ukuzi mtuhu mwakwe! Suwe wenye chimwiva ivyo alongile!”</para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Yesu Egalwa kulongozi kwa Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 27:1-2, 11-14; Mako 15:1-5; Yohana 18:28-38</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Akaheza wantu wose niyo wachimala, wamwigala Yesu kulongozi kwa Pilato, <verse number="2" style="v" />Wakonga kumlongeleza wakagamba, “Yuno mntu nachimbwila akawadanta wantu wose, walemele kuliha kodi kwa Seuta ywa Lumi na kwetanga hambwe nuyo Kulisito, Seuta.” <verse number="3" style="v" />Pilato amuza Yesu, “Weye wi seuta ywa Wayahudi?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu amhitula. “Niweye ukulonga,”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Akaheza Pilato awagamba walavyantambiko wakulu hamwenga ne difyo dya wantu, “miye sikuwona wavu wowose wakumkantila yuno mntu.” <verse number="5" style="v" />Mna wowo walahiliza wakagamba, “Kwa sila ya mahinyo yakwe awaluvya wantu wadamanye wavu mwe isi yose ya Yudeya. Kakongela Galilaya haluse kubula hano.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Egalwa kwa Helode</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pilato eze eve ayo, niyo auza, “Vino mntu yuno ni mkaya wa Galilaya?” <verse number="7" style="v" />Eze amanye kugamba Yesu ne mo mkowa ukulongozwa ni Helode, niyo amwigala kwa Helode, kwaviya Helode naye nendile eyuko Yelusalemu. <verse number="8" style="v" />Helode eze amwone Yesu niyo eleleswa, kwaviya nakeva kale izimbuli zakwe, ivyo nakamgoja kwa chipindi chitali. Nana msuhi amwone Yesu akadamanya vilagiso. <verse number="9" style="v" />Ivyo niyo amuzisa, mna Yesu hahitule dyodyose. <verse number="10" style="v" />Walavyantambiko wakulu na wahinya Sigilizi wendaga aho walavyaga malaho makulu mwa Yesu. <verse number="11" style="v" />Ivyo Helode hamwenga na wankondo wakwe wambasa Yesu na kumjela soni, niyo wamvisa suche zikale za chiseuta na kumvuza kwa Pilato. <verse number="12" style="v" />Mwe dizuwa diya Helode na Pilato wendaga hawekwivana, mna kukongela dizuwa idyo niyo watenda wambuya.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Akantilwa file</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 27:15-26; Mako 15:6-15; Yohana 18:39-19:16</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ivyo Pilato niyo etanga chitala cha wakulu wa walavyantambiko, vilongozi, na wantu wawo, <verse number="14" style="v" />awagamba, mnigaila mntu yuno mwagamba nakawadanta wantu. Haluse tegelezani, nize nimuze imbuli iyo mwa meso yenyu simuwone na lema dyodyose mwa ayo mkumlaha. <verse number="15" style="v" />Naho Helode hamwone lema dyodyose, nivyo vilekile kamvuza kwetu. Mntu yuno hadamanye dyodyose dikuleka ankantilwe kukomwa. <verse number="16" style="v" />“Ivyo nanilagize atoigwe nkome niyo namlekela.” <verse number="17" style="v" />Chila zuwa dya Pasaka Pilato na kaungwa alekele mfungwa yumwenga. <verse number="18" style="v" />Mna wose hamwenga watula lwasu, “Muse yuno mntu! Chifungwile Balaba!” <verse number="19" style="v" />Balaba nakajelwa mndani kwa wavu wa nkumbizi mwe kaya, naho nakakoma wantu. <verse number="20" style="v" />Pilato nakaunga amlekele Yesu, ivyo niyo alonga nawo vituhu. <verse number="21" style="v" />Mna wowo niyo watula lwasu vituhu, “Mtungike! Mtungike!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pilato awagamba nkanana ya katatu, “Kabalangani? Sikuwona ubanasi wowose mwakwe vikuleka akomwe! Nanilagize atoigwe nkome vikaheza nimlekele.” <verse number="23" style="v" />Mna wowo wajendeleza kutula lwasu vidala kugamba Yesu aunngwa atungikwe mo msalaba, na mo udumo wo lwasu lwawo niyo wahudwa. <verse number="24" style="v" />Ivyo Pilato kamkantila Yesu saviya nendile wakaunga. <verse number="25" style="v" />Amvugwila kulaila kwedijeleza yudya waungile, yudya ajeligwe kwedijeleza kwa wavu wa nkumbizi na kukoma wantu, amwinkiza Yesu kwawo wamdamanye ivyo wakunga.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Atungikwa mo Msalaba</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 27:32-44; Mako 15:21-32; Yohana 19:17-27</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Umo wakamwigala ko kumtungika mwe sila, wadugana na mntu yumwenga akwitagwa Simoni wa si ya Kilene endaga akalaila kwe kaya zihaguhi. Wamchimalisa, wamkankalisa etwike msalaba wa Yesu, na kumtimila mnyuma. <verse number="27" style="v" />Fyo kulu dya wantu dimtimila, mgati mwawo namna wavyele nawakalomboleza na kwila. <verse number="28" style="v" />Yesu awahitukila awagamba, “Nyuwe wavyele wa Yelusalemu! Msekuniila miye, mna kweileni nyuwe wenye na wana wenyu. <verse number="29" style="v" />Kwaviya mazuwa nayeze aho wantu wakunga walonge, ‘Chinyemi china wadya hewakweleka, wadya hawajezaga kweleka hegu konkeza!’ <verse number="30" style="v" />Chipindi icho wantu nawakonge kuyagamba magulu, ‘Chigweleni!’ Na wagulu, ‘Chigubikeni!’ <verse number="31" style="v" />Kwaviya uneva wantu wautendela mti mbisi seivyo, naitende zeze kwa mti unyaile?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Kwendaga na wantu watuhu waidi, wendaga weihiye, wegalagwa hamwenga na Yesu ko kutundikwa. <verse number="33" style="v" />Weze wabule hantu hakwitangwa, “Gobela dya mtwi”, niyo wamtungika Yesu mo msalaba, na hamwenga na wadya wabanasi waidi, yumwenga ntendelo ya kulume yumwenga kumoso kwakwe. <verse number="34" style="v" />Akaheza Yesu agamba, “Walekeile, Tate kwaviya hawamanyize diya wakudamanya.”</para>
  <para style="p">Niyo wapangana izisuche za Yesu kwa kuzitoila tegatega. <verse number="35" style="v" />Wantu nawachimala hadya wakakaula kuno vilongozi wa Wayahudi wakamtila wakagamba, “Ambulaga wantu watuhu, haluse neambule mwenye hegu nuyo Kulisito yudya asagulwe ni Chohile!” <verse number="36" style="v" />Wankondo nawo niyo wamtila, wamwigaila divai igwaduke, <verse number="37" style="v" />na kumgamba, “Kweambule mwenye hegu weye wi seuta ywa Wayahudi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ulahi na uwandikwa savino kulanga kwakwe, “Yuno nuyo Seuta ywa Wayahudi.” <verse number="39" style="v" />Yumwenga mwa wadya wabanasi atundikwe mo msalaba amhuluta, akamgamba, “Weye hwi Kulisito? Elo kweambule mwenye ukaheza uchambule naswi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Mna yudya mnyawe niyo amkwahila, amgamba, “Weye hukumogoha Chohile? Hata hegu waungwa uhokele kanto seiyo. <verse number="41" style="v" />Suwe, ivyovili, vyachiwagila, kwaviya chongigwa chinkigwe kanto kwa yadya chidamanye, mna yuno mntu hana icho abalange.” <verse number="42" style="v" />Niyo amgamba Yesu, “Unikumbuke, Yesu, mo Useuta wako!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Yesu niyo amhitula amgamba, “Chindedi dyelo dino nautende hamwenga nami hantu hahoile.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kubanika kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 27:45-56; Mako 15:33-41; Yohana 19:28-30</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Yendaga saa mtandatu vino no msi, umo zuwa dilekile kulangaza isi, niyo kwatenda na chiza kubula saa chenda. <verse number="45" style="v" />Paziya dyendile ditungikwa mwe Nyumba ya Chohile ditatuka vihande vidi. <verse number="46" style="v" />Yesu niyo aguta kwa izwi kulu, “Tate! Mwe mikono yako naika muye wangu!” Kalonga vino nakubanika.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Yudya mnkondo kawona chiya chilaile, niyo amtunya Chohile, akagamba, “Chindedi nani mntu ywedi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Umo fyo dya wantu nawadugane hadya kukaula yose yalaile, wose niyo wauya kukaya, waketowa mwe vifuwa vyawo kwa chinyulu. <verse number="49" style="v" />Wadya wantu woseni wammanyaga Yesu, hamwenga na wadya wavyele wamtimilaga kulaila Galilaya, wachimala kwa hale wakakaula.</para>
  <para style="s">Kuhambwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 27:57-61; Mako 15:42-47; Yohana 19:38-42</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Kwendaga na mntu yumwenga akwitangwa Yusufu, mwelekwa ywa mzi umwenga wa Wayahudi ukwitangwa Alimataya. Endaga mntu ywedi akutunyiswa. <verse number="51" style="v" />Nendile akagoja kwiza kwa useuta wa Chohile. Hata hegu endaga yumwenga mwe Chitala Chikulu cha Wayahudi, endaga hevanaga nawo mwe ntendwa yawe. <verse number="52" style="v" />Yusufu aitaga kwa Pilato nakulombeza mwili wa Yesu. <verse number="53" style="v" />Niyo auseleza umwili hasi, auvisa sanda, nakuwika mwe mbila yadamanyagwa mwe luwe naho hayadamanyaga ndima. <verse number="54" style="v" />Dyendaga zuwa dya kuhumula nadyo dihajihi nakukonga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Wadya wavyele wezaga na Yesu kulaila Galilaya wamtimila Yusufu nakuwona imbila na ivyo mwili wa Yesu nauhambwe umo. <verse number="56" style="v" />Niyo wauya kukaya kudamanya malihamu na mavuta yakupwepweleka wauhake umwili.</para>
  <para style="p">Wahumula mwe Zuwa dya kuhumula, saviya Sigilizi ikunga.</para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Kuyuka wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 28:1-10; Mako 16:1-8; Yohana 20:1-10</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zuwa dya kuhumula dya nkongo dya juma chilo chilo wadya wavyele niyo waita kwembila, nawenula yadya mavuta wadamanye. <verse number="2" style="v" />Wadya wavyele mo kulomboleza wabwila diya diyuwe difingiliswa hale ne mbila.<figure style="fig" desc="" file="16 Tomb.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="LUK 24.2">Yuwe difingiliswe hale ne mbila</figure> <verse number="3" style="v" />Mna weze wengile mndani mwe mbila hawauwone umwili wa Zumbe Yesu. <verse number="4" style="v" />Umo wachei kwehelwa mwe mbuli iyo, niyo walaila wantu waidi wavaile suche zing'alise wachimala haguhi na wowo. <verse number="5" style="v" />Wadya wavyele niyo wengilwa ni woga na kwinama chifudifudi kubula hasi. Wadya wantu wawagamba, “Kwambwani mwamlonda mntu mjima mwe wantu wabanike? <verse number="6" style="v" />Hahali hano kauyuka, kumbukani ivyo awagambilagani viya achei Galilaya. <verse number="7" style="v" />‘Yongigwa mwana ywa mntu alavigwe mwe wantu wata masa na kusulumizwa na kuyuka zuwa dya katatu.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aho wadya wavyele niyo wakumbuka ulosi wakwe. <verse number="9" style="v" />Weze wauye kulaila kwe mbila, niyo wawagambila mbuli zose wadya wasigilwa mlongo na yumwe na wadya nawakamtimila Yesu. <verse number="10" style="v" />Awo walongile izimbuli kwa wasigilwa ni Maliyamu Magidalena, Yona, na Maliyamu nine dya Yakobo, hamwenga na wadya wavyele wendile wehamwenga. <verse number="11" style="v" />Awo nawo niyo wawagambile wasigilwa mbuli izo. Wasigilwa hawatolotoze imbuli iyo, niyo hawaizumile. <verse number="12" style="v" />Mna Petulo niyo afosa aguluka kubula kwembila, eze afuname nakusungila mndani mwakwe aona sanda iyodu. Niyo auya kukaya kuno kehelwa ni mbuli izo zilaile.</para>
  <para style="s">Kutalamka kwita Emau</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 16:12-13</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mwe diziwa idyo, wantu waidi mgati mwa wanampina wakwe na wakaita mwe kaya imwenga ikwitagwa Emau, kaya iyo ihale no mzi wa Yelusalemu enga lujendo lwa masa maidi. <verse number="14" style="v" />Nawakatamwila wenye mwe mbuli zose zilaile. <verse number="15" style="v" />Umo nawakatamwila na kuzana wowo wenye, Yesu mwenye niyo alaila alongozana nawo. <verse number="16" style="v" />Nawamona kwa meso mna hawammanyize kugamba ni Yesu. <verse number="17" style="v" />Yesu awauza, “Mwatamwila mbuli zani hano he sila?”</para>
  <para style="p">Wowo niyo wachimala, kuno wana chihovu. <verse number="18" style="v" />Yumwenga akwitangwa Kilopa, amhitula agamba, “Weye ichedu wi mjeni mo mzi uno wa Yelusalemu, vitende humanjize mbuli zilaila mwa mazuwa yano?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Yesu awauza, kulaila mbwani? Wamhitula, mbuli za Yesu ywa Nazaleti, yudya nani muwoni, mta udahi wa kudamanya na kulonga ko uso wa Chohile na wantu wose. <verse number="20" style="v" />Wakulu wa walavyantambiko hamwenga na vilongozi wetu wamlavya chani akantilwe file, niyo wamsulumiza mo msalaba. <verse number="21" style="v" />Mna suwe nachina msuhi kugamba uyo nuyo akunga aikombole Izulaeli, elo dyelo ni zuwa dya katatu kukongela hadya izimbuli izo zilaile. <verse number="22" style="v" />Ukaleka ayo wavyele watuhu mwe bunga dyetu wachitusa, nawaita chilochilo kwembila. <verse number="23" style="v" />Hawaubwile umwili wakwe, wauya na kugamba walailwa ni wandima wa kwembingu niyo wawagambila kugamba ni mjima. <verse number="24" style="v" />Wetu watuhu nawaita kwe mbila wawona ivyo walongile wadya wavyele, mna yeye hawamuwone.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Niyo Yesu awagamba, “Nyuwe wahezi na wata myoyo midala ya kuzumila mbuli zose za wawoni walongile! <verse number="26" style="v" />Elo havyungigwe Kulisito asulumizwe akaheza engile mwe ukuka wakwe?” <verse number="27" style="v" />Niyo awagambila mbuli zose ziwandikwe mwa Mawandiko Yakukile, kukongela muwoni Musa kubula wose.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Weze wabule hajihi ne idya ikaya nawakaita, Yesu enga ajendeleza ne ntambo awasa. <verse number="29" style="v" />Mna wowo wamlombeza wamgamba, usekwita kwaviya zuwa diswa chilo chengila. Ivyo engila he ikaya na kwikala nawo. <verse number="30" style="v" />Eze ekale na kudya nkande hamwenga nawo, aguha mgate aujimbika, aubesula awenka. <verse number="31" style="v" />Ahadya meso yawo niyo yagubulwa, wambunkula kugamba ni Yesu, mna ahadya niyo ahalawa kuno wakasinya. <verse number="32" style="v" />Niyo wagambilana togolani “Myoyo yetu haisangale vidala umo akatamwila na suwe mwe sila na kuchigambila Mawandiko Yakukile?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Niyo wahalawa isa idya, niyo wabula Yelusalemu niyo wawabwila wadya mlongo na yumwe wadugana hamwenga na wantu watuhu we dibunga dyawo. <verse number="34" style="v" />Wakalonga, Zumbe kauyuka chindedi, naye kamlaila Simoni.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Niyo wawagambila mbuli zose mbuli zose zilaile mwe sila neivyo wambunkule Yesu umo akabesula umgate.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Alaila kwa Wanampina wakwe</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 28:16-20; Mako 16:14-18; Yohana 20:19-23; Ntendwa 1:6-8</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Umo nawakawagambila ayo, Yesu mwenye alaila achimala hagati hawo, awagamba, Mtende na utondowazi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Wasetuka na kwingilwa ni woga, nawamanya wawona mpepo. <verse number="38" style="v" />Mna yeye awagamba, kwambwani mnankama? Kwambwani mwatenda na nkama mwe myoyo yenyu? <verse number="39" style="v" />Kaulani imikono ne viga vyangu, chani mmanye ni miye, nitozanitozani muwone, kwa viya mpepo haina mwili na mavuha enga vino mkuniwona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Eze alonge iyo, awalagisa imikono yakwe ne viga vyakwe. <verse number="41" style="v" />Umo hawenati kuzumila kwa chinyemi wananacho kuno wakehelwa, awauza, hano mna nkande yoyose? <verse number="42" style="v" />Niyo wamwinka chihande cha samaki yokigwe. <verse number="43" style="v" />Aiguha, aidya kuno wose wakamsinya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Niyo awagamba, “Uno nuwo ulosi nahawagambilani umo nendaga nichei hamwenga na nyuwe, kugamba vyaungwa nichintize mbuli zose niwandikilwe mwe Sigilizi ya Musa, na mwamawandiko ya wawoni na Zabuli.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Niyo agubula fanyanyi zawo chani wamanye Mawandiko Yakukile, <verse number="46" style="v" />awagamba, “Ivyo nivyo viwandikwe kugamba Kulisito nasulumizwe zuwa dya katatu nauyuke. <verse number="47" style="v" />Naho kugamba kwa zina dyakwe wantu wose kukongela Yelusalemu nawagambilwe Mbuli Yedi weile chani walekeilwe masa yawo. <verse number="48" style="v" />Nyuwe namtende waukuzi wangu mwe mbuli zino. <verse number="49" style="v" />Miye mwenye naniwegaileni yudya Tate ekiye ndagano kugamba namsigile kwenyu, mna ikalani muno mo mzi kubula mwinkigwe idya nguvu ikulaila kulanga.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Aguhigwa kwita Kwembingu</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 16:19-20; Ntendwa 1:9-11</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Niyo awalongoza kubula Besaniya, enula imikono yakwe awajimbika. <verse number="51" style="v" />Umo akawajimbika, awasa, aguhigwa kulanga kwembingu. <verse number="52" style="v" />Wamvikila, niyo wauya Yelusalemu kuno wana chinyemi vidala. <verse number="53" style="v" />Nawo nawakekala kwe nyumba nkulu ya Chohile chila zuwa, wakamjimbika Chohile.</para>
</usx>